s will cost him dearly.}) 33... Rc1 34. Kg2 Qc6+ 35. Kh3 Qe6 36. g4 Qb3 37. Nxe3 (37. Qxa6 Bxf4+ 38. Ng3 Rxd1 $19 39. Qb6+ $19 {Missing the hidden resource} Kc8 $1 40. Qc5+ Bc7) 37... Qxe3+ 38. Kg2 {Black prefers to preserve the opportunity to play for a mate and therefore the queens to the trivial} Rxd1 $5 39. Qxd1 Qe1 0-1

