 Rxe7 Rd2 27. b4 Ra8 28. Rb7 g6 29. Rxb6 Raxa2) 19... Qc5 (19... Na5 20. Bd3) 20. a3 Rd5 21. Bc4 Rxe5 22. Nxe5 Nxe5 $132 {Black has restored the harmony in his set-up and the position is roughly equal again.} 23. Ba6 (23. Bd3 Qd5 $1 24. f3 Nxd3 $14 {[%csl Rc5,Rd5][%cal Ya1c1,Ye1d3] ac1,d3 and the  are under unpleasant pressure.} 25. Qxd3 Bf6 $14) 23... Bc6 24. Bf4 Ng6 25. Bg3 Qd5 26. f3 Ba4 $5 (26... b5 27. Qd3 $132 {Probably this was the right moment for} Bf6 $5 28. Rfe1 h5) 27. Rc1 b5 28. Qd3 h5 29. f4 (29. Rfe1 h4 $11 30. Bf2 (30. Bc7 Bg5) 30... Bf6 (30... Nf4 31. Qxd4 Qg5 32. g3 hxg3 33. hxg3 Ne2+ $19 {Polgar wants more than} 34. Rxe2 Qxc1+ 35. Re1 $11) 31. Rc8 Rxc8 32. Bxc8 $13 Ne5 $2) (29. Bc7 Bd8 $11 {f6} 30. Bxd8 Rxd8 31. f4 Qd6 32. Rc8 Rxc8 $14 33. Bxc8 Nxf4 34. Qf5 d3 35. Rxf4 Bb3 $1 36. Qd7 Qxd7 $36 37. Bxd7 d2 38. Rd4 d1=Q+ $13 39. Rxd1 Bxd1 40. Bxb5 Bb3) 29... Bd6 $5 (29... h4 30. Be1) 30. Qf3 $2 (30. b3 Qxb3 31. Qxb3 $17 {/-+} Bxb3 32. Bxb5 {[%cal Rg7g6] g6-+} h4 33. Bf2 $17 Bxf4) 30... Qxf3 31. Rxf3 h4 $1 $40 {[%csl Gc5,Gd5,Ge5,Rh5] ,פh5} 32. Bf2 Bxf4 (32... Nxf4 33. Rc6 Bb8 (33... Be5 34. Rc5 f6 35. g3 Ne6 36. Rc1) 34. g3 (34. Bxh4 d3 35. Be1 Ne2+ 36. Kf1 $19 Nd4) 34... d3 $19 35. gxf4 d2 36. Rd3 d1=Q+ 37. Rxd1 Bxd1 38. Bxb5) 33. Rc8 Rxc8 34. Bxc8 b4 35. Bxd4 a5 $1 36. Bb7 Bd1 $19 37. Rf1 Bc2 38. Bd5 bxa3 39. bxa3 a4 40. Rf2 Bd1 41. Rf1 Bc2 42. Rf2 Bd1 43. Bxf7+ Kxf7 $1 44. Be3 Kf6 45. Bxf4 Nxf4 $19 46. Rxf4+ Kg5 $1 47. Rd4 Bb3 48. Kf2 0-1

