d5 $16 Rxd5 22. Bg2 e4 23. f3 f5 24. fxe4 $16 fxe4 $142 $14 25. Nb1 {was still possible, e.g.}) 21. Bg2 {[%csl Rb7,Rd5] Suddenly Black is in trouble.} c6 22. e4 dxe4 (22... Nc8 $1) 23. Nxe4 Nc8 24. Kh2 Nd6 25. Nd2 c5 26. Nf3 cxd4 27. Bxd4 {and White gradually converted his extra pawn:} Bxd4 28. Nxd4 Nf5 29. Nxf5 Bxf5 30. Qe3 h6 31. c5 Rac8 32. b4 axb4 33. axb4 b6 34. cxb6 Rxc1 $1 {was even simpler:} 35. Qxc1 Rxd1 36. Qxd1 Qxb4 $16 37. Qd8+ {is too late due to} Kg7 38. b7 1-0

