1. d4 {Tsesarsky Tsesarsky} Nf6 2. Nf3 g6 3. c4 Bg7 4. Nc3 O-O 5. e4 d6 6. Be2 e5 7. Be3 Ng4 8. Bg5 f6 9. Bh4 Nh6 $2 $16 {A serious mistake. Polgar probably forgot to play g6-g5 or h7-h5 first... This mistake was done a couple of times by different players - see below. White wins a whole  by force and obtains a strategically winning position.} ({The mainlines are:} 9... g5) (9... h5) (9... Qe8) (9... Qd7) 10. dxe5 $1 (10. O-O $2 c6 11. Qd2 Qe8 12. Rfe1 Nf7 13. Bg3 Nd7 14. a3 f5 15. exf5 gxf5 16. Bf1 $132 {1-0 Hoerstmann,R-Jostes,M/Germany 1997/EXT 2003 (28)}) (10. Qb3 $2 g5 11. Bg3 Kh8 12. dxe5 dxe5 13. Rd1 Nd7 14. O-O c6 15. h4 (15. Qa3 Nf7 16. c5 Qe7 17. b4 $14) 15... g4 (15... Qe7 16. Rd2 (16. hxg5 fxg5 $14) 16... Nf7 $14 {1-0 To Ngoc Minh-Hoang Hai/Hanoi 2002/CBM 90 ext (43)}) 16. Nd2 f5 17. exf5 Nxf5 $132) 10... dxe5 ({In case of} 10... g5 {White leaves with advantage:} 11. Qd5+ $1 (11. exf6 Bxf6 12. Bg3 Nc6 13. O-O (13. Rc1 g4 14. Nd2 $16 {½-½ Hellsten,J-Sandstrom,L/Stockholm 1996/CBM 57 ext (24)}) 13... Be6 (13... Nf7 14. Ne1 Be6 15. Nc2 Nce5 16. Ne3 $16 {0-1 Volosjuk,J-Kiseleva,N/Menorca 1996/Juniors (39)}) 14. Nd5 g4 15. Nd2 $16 {1-0 Sadler,M-Buckley,G/Isle of Man 1997/EXT 99 (40)}) 11... Nf7 12. e6 Bxe6 (12... gxh4 13. exf7+ Kh8 14. Nxh4 $18 {1-0 Mozetic,D-Tosic,M/Banja Vrucica 1991/EXT 97 (59)}) 13. Qxe6 gxh4 14. Nxh4 $18 {1-0 Cramling,D-Marklund,G/Karlskrona 1983/MCD (20)}) 11. Qxd8 Rxd8 12. Nd5 {[%csl Rc7,Rf6] Black loses a whole  without any compensation.} g5 13. Nxc7 gxh4 14. Nxa8 Na6 15. c5 $1 {[%cal Ge2a6,Ga8c7] Easily releasing a8.} Nxc5 16. Nc7 Nxe4 17. O-O (17. Nxh4 $16) (17. Rd1 {All this was played already!} Rxd1+ 18. Bxd1 Bf8 19. Bb3+ Kh8 20. Be6 Bxe6 21. Nxe6 Be7 22. Ke2 Kg8 23. Rd1 $18 {1-0 Hedman,E-Szieberth,A/Budapest 1993/EXT 97 (51)}) 17... Nf5 18. Rfd1 Rf8 19. Bc4+ Kh8 20. Ne6 Re8 21. Bb5 $1 Rg8 22. Bd7 Bh6 (22... Nfd6 23. Bxc8 Rxc8 24. Rac1 $18) 23. Bxc8 Rxc8 24. Rd8+ Rxd8 25. Nxd8 Ned6 ({Or} 25... Nc5 26. b4 Nd3 27. Rd1 Nxb4 28. Rd7 Kg8 29. Rxb7 Nxa2 30. Rf7 $18 {[%csl Ra7,Re5,Rf6][%cal Gf3e5]}) 26. Rd1 Bf8 27. Ne6 Be7 28. Rc1 e4 29. Nfd4 Nxd4 30. Nxd4 Kg8 31. Rc5 Kf7 32. Nf5 b6 33. Nxd6+ Bxd6 34. Rh5 Kg6 35. Rxh4 f5 36. g4 Kg5 37. Rxh7 Kxg4 38. Rxa7 Kf3 39. Rf7 f4 40. Kf1 b5 41. a3 Bc5 42. Rf5 Bd4 43. b3 Bb2 44. a4 bxa4 45. bxa4 Kg4 46. Rb5 1-0

