rwiev under the strain. The correct 34...d8! would indirectly address the bishop on d3 and nearly equalize the chances. The game move is robbing her own king of the fleeing square f8.''Ribli,Zoltan: 'Ftacnik: 'Even though Judit is a fascinating chessplayer she is also able to lose overwiev under the strain. The correct 34...d8! would indirectly address the bishop on d3 and nearly equalize the chances. The game move is robbing her own king of the fleeing square f8.' Gelfand,Boris: 'Ribli: 'Ftacnik: 'Even though Judit is a fascinating chessplayer she is also able to lose overwiev under the strain. The correct 34...d8! would indirectly address the bishop on d3 and nearly equalize the chances. The game move is robbing her own king of the fleeing square f8.''''' Ein Fehler in passive Stellung. Dieser schablonenhafte Zug ist nicht die beste Fortsetzung für Schwarz.'Ribli,Zoltan: 'Ein Fehler in passive Stellung. Dieser schablonenhafte Zug ist nicht die beste Fortsetzung für Schwarz. Gelfand,Boris: 'Ribli: 'Ein Fehler in passive Stellung. Dieser schablonenhafte Zug ist nicht die beste Fortsetzung für Schwarz.''''} (34... Rd8 $142 {'!' Ftacnik. 'Ribli,Zoltan: '' Ribli,Zoltan: ''!' Ftacnik. Gelfand,Boris: 'Ribli: '' Ribli: ''!' Ftacnik. ''''} 35. Rh5 {'(Ribli,Zoltan) Gelfand,Boris: 'Ribli''} (35. Qg6 {Ftacnik Gelfand,Boris: '?''Ribli,Zoltan: 'Ftacnik Gelfand,Boris: '?' '?' Gelfand,Boris: 'Ribli: 'Ftacnik''''} Qxg3+ $1 36. Qxg3 Bxg3 $17 {'Ribli,Zoltan: '' '' Ribli,Zoltan: 'Gelfand,Boris: 'Ribli: '' '''''}) (35. Be4 {Ftacnik'Ribli,Zoltan: 'Ftacnik Gelfand,Boris: 'Ribli: 'Ftacnik''''} Qb2+ 36. Kh3 Qf6 37. Qh5 Qf1+ {'(Ribli,Zoltan) Gelfand,Boris: 'Ribli''} (37... Kf8 $11 {(Gelfand,Boris) Notkin,M Ribli,Zoltan: '(Gelfand,Boris) Notkin,M'}) 38. Kg4 Kf8 $13) (35. Qg6 Qxg3+ $1 36. Qxg3 Bxg3 $17) 35... Qf6 36. Qe4 Kf7 $16) (34... Kf8 {(Gelfand,Boris) Ribli,Zoltan: 'Gelfand,Boris'} 35. Qg6 Qf6 $14) 35. Qg6 $1 {[%csl Rg8][%cal Rh7h8,Rh8g8][%mdl 128] 'Ribli,Zoltan: '!' Ribli,Zol