. Bd3 (16. Rh7 $2 Nf5 $17 {[%csl Yf3,Rg5][%cal Gb7f3]}) 16... Bxf3 17. gxf3 Ng6 18. Bxg6 fxg6 19. Rh7 Qe7 20. f4 $44) 12... Qxf6 13. Qxf6 gxf6 14. Bd3 {/=} d6 $5 {Black's plan is:b8-d7 [ b8-d7]} (14... Ne7 $143 $6 {Golod,V: '' ''} 15. Ne2 c5 16. Kd2 $14) 15. Ne2 Nb8 {[%cal Gb8d7]} 16. Nc3 ({Senselessly: Golod,V: 'Senselessly:'} 16. c5 $6 bxc5 (16... dxc5 $5 17. dxc5 Rd8 18. Bb1 $11) 17. dxc5 Nc6 18. cxd6 cxd6 19. Ba6 Na5 20. Bxb7 Nxb7 $11) 16... Nd7 17. Be4 $6 {After this inaccuracy black equalizes. Probably could be recomended:17.d2!? or 17.e2.} (17. Ke2 $14) (17. Kd2 $5) 17... Bxe4 ({Badly:} 17... c6 $2 {in view of:} 18. Bf3 $1 {[%csl Rd6][%cal Gc3e4,Gc3b5]} (18. Nb5 $2 d5 19. Nd6 dxe4 20. Nxb7 f5 21. Nd6 Red8 $11) 18... d5 $8 (18... Kf8 $2 19. Nb5 {[%csl Rc7,Rd6][%cal Gb5c7,Gb5d6]} cxb5 20. Bxb7 Rab8 21. Bc6 $18 {[%csl Rb5,Rd7]}) 19. cxd5 cxd5 (19... exd5 $143 20. Ne2 $16 {[%cal Ge2f4]}) 20. Kd2 {/}) 18. Nxe4 f5 ({Too actively:} 18... e5 19. d5 $140 f5 $6 {because of:} 20. Ng3 f4 21. Nf5 Kh7 22. Ke2 Rg8 23. Rhg1 $14) 19. Nc3 $11 {½-½ (19) Golod,V (2566)-Polgar,J (2658) Israel 2000 CBM 77 [Golod,V]} (19. Nc3 a6 {[%csl Ya6,Rb5][%cal Ya6b5]} 20. Kd2 Kf8 {e7,g8=}) 1/2-1/2

