{[%mdl 256]} 1. d4 {Golod,V Golod,V Golod,V Golod,V: 'Golod,Vitali Golod,Vitali: 'Golod,V''} Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. Qc2 O-O 5. e4 d5 $5 ({Other options is:} 5... c5 $5 {See comments to Doroshkievich,V-Shishkov,A/St.Petersburg, 1999/CBM 74(1-0)(Golod,V)(30)}) (5... d6 $5 {See comments to Short,N-Karpov,A/Dortmund,1997/CBM 60 (1-0)(Tsesarsky)(44)}) 6. e5 Ne4 7. Bd3 c5 8. Nge2 $5 {Besides,white has several alternatives:} (8. a3 Ba5 (8... Bxc3+ 9. bxc3 cxd4 (9... Nc6 10. Bb2 $1 (10. Nf3 $2 cxd4 11. Bxe4 (11. cxd4 Qa5+ 12. Bd2 Nxd2 13. Nxd2 dxc4 14. Bxh7+ Kh8 $17) 11... dxe4 12. Qxe4 dxc3 13. Ng5 g6 14. Nf3 f5 15. Qe3 Bd7 16. O-O Qa5 $17 {Zitin,Yuri-Veingold,Aleksandr/Keres mem, 1998(0-1)(43)}) 10... f5 $132) 10. cxd4 Qa5+ 11. Kf1 Nc6 (11... f6 $6 12. Nf3 Nc6 13. Rb1 $14 {Berkovich,D-Tangborn,Eric/Kobanya,1992 (1-0)(48)}) 12. Bxe4 dxe4 13. Bb2 Qa6 14. Ne2 Na5 15. Rc1 $11 (15. c5 $2 b6 16. Qxe4 Bb7 17. Qg4 bxc5 $17 {[%csl Rf1][%cal Gb7g2] Zimmerman,Yuri-Belichev,Nikolai/Budapest,1999(0-1)(27)})) 9. Bxe4 (9. dxc5 Bxc3+ 10. bxc3 Nd7 11. Bxe4 dxe4 12. Be3 Nxe5 $132 {Zimmerman,Yuri-Wells,Peter/HUN,1998 (0-1)(39)}) 9... dxe4 10. dxc5 Qd4 (10... Nc6 11. b4 Bc7 12. Nxe4 Nxe5 13. Be3 f5 $44 {Zimmerman,Yuri-Lukacs,Peter/HUN,1999 (½-½)(21)}) 11. Nge2 Qxc4 12. O-O Qd3 (12... Bxc3 13. Nxc3 Qxc5 14. Qxe4 Nc6 $11) 13. Qa4 Bc7 14. Rd1 Bd7 15. Qb4 Qa6 16. Qxe4 Bc6 $44 {Olivera,Alfredo-Karastoichev,Emil Stefanov/Buenos Aires ol,1939(0-1)(24)}) (8. dxc5 Nd7 $1 {[%csl Rc5][%cal Gd7c5]} (8... Nc6 $2 9. Nf3 f5 $5 (9... Qa5 10. O-O Nxc3 11. bxc3 Bxc3 12. Rb1 dxc4 13. Bxh7+ Kh8 14. Qe4 Nxe5 (14... Re8 15. Qh4 $18 {Issakainen,Ari-Liitiainen,Elia/Helsinki op,1999(1-0)(22)}) 15. Nxe5 Bxe5 16. Qh4 Bf6 17. Qh3 Rd8 18. Be4+ Kg8 19. c6 $16) 10. exf6 Qxf6 11. O-O Bxc3 12. bxc3 $16) 9. Nf3 Ndxc5 10. O-O Bxc3 11. bxc3 Nxd3 12. Qxd3 b6 13. Ba3 Re8 14. Rfd1 Ba6 $19 {Kaidanov,Grigory S-Kharitonov,Andrei Y/Smolensk,1986(0-1)(20)}) (8. cxd5 $5 {See comments to Ahlander,B-Wedberg,T/Stockholm,1999/ CBM 73(1-0) (Golod,V)(43)}) 8... f5 (8... Nc6 $5 9. cxd5 exd5 {/=}) 9. cxd5 $146 {Except of this move white have also.} (9. a3 $5 Ba5 (9... Qa5 10. Rb1 Bxc3+ 11. bxc3 cxd4 12. Rb5 $14) 10. Bxe4 (10. cxd5 $2 Nxc3 11. bxc3 Qxd5 $17 {[%csl Rg2][%cal Gc5c4]}) 10... fxe4 11. O-O (11. dxc5 $2 d4 12. b4 Bc7 13. Nxe4 d3 $17) 11... Nc6 12. cxd5 exd5 13. dxc5 Bxc3 14. Nxc3 Nxe5 15. Qb3 Nc4 16. Nxe4 Qe7 $132) (9. exf6 $5 Qxf6 (9... cxd4 $1 10. Nxd4 Nxf6 11. Nb3 $132) 10. O-O cxd4 11. cxd5 (11. Nxe4 dxe4 12. Bxe4 $14) 11... Nxf2 12. Bxh7+ Kh8 13. Nf4 $36 {[%cal Gf4g6]}) 9... cxd4 10. Bxe4 $1 ({Badly:} 10. a3 $2 Ba5 $140 11. Nxd4 {because of:} Qxd5 $17 {[%csl Rc3,Rd4]}) (10. Nxd4 $6 Qxd5 11. Nf3 Nc6 $15) 10... fxe4 11. Nxd4 $1 (11. Qxe4 $2 exd5 12. Qxd4 Nc6 13. Qd1 d4 14. a3 Be7 $15) 11... Qxd5 (11... exd5 12. O-O Bc5 (12... Nc6 13. Nxc6 bxc6 14. Nxe4 $1 $14) 13. Nb3 Bb6 14. Be3 Nc6 (14... Bxe3 15. fxe3 $14 {[%cal Gf1f8,Gb3d4]} Rxf1+ 16. Rxf1 Nc6 17. Rd1 $14) 15. Bxb6 axb6 $132) 12. Be3 {White solved opening problems and equalized.} Nd7 13. O-O {[%csl Re4]} Bxc3 14. Qxc3 Nxe5 $44 {Black with  over, but white have enough compensation.} 15. Rfd1 (15. Rad1 $5) 15... Qc4 ({It deserves attention:} 15... Nd3 16. f3 Qe5 17. fxe4 Nf4 18. Qc2 (18. Bxf4 Qxf4 19. Rf1 Qxe4 20. Rxf8+ Kxf8 21. Rf1+ Kg8 22. Nb5 Bd7 23. Rf7 Qb1+ 24. Rf1 Qg6 $17) 18... Nd5 19. Bf2 Nf6 20. Rac1 Qxe4 21. Re1 Qd5 (21... Qxc2 22. Rxc2 $44 {[%csl Re6]}) 22. Qc4 {[%csl Re6]} Ne4 23. Nxe6 $1 $11) 16. Qxc4 Nxc4 17. Nb5 b6 (17... a6 18. Nc7 Nxe3 (18... Rb8 $2 19. Ba7 $18) 19. fxe3 (19. Nxa8 Nxd1 20. Rxd1 e5 21. Nb6 Be6 22. b3 Kf7 $15) 19... Ra7 20. Rac1 $11) 18. Nc7 Rb8 19. b3 Rb7 (19... Nxe3 20. fxe3 e5 21. Rd5 Bb7 (21... Rb7 22. Rc1 $44) 22. Rxe5 Rbc8 23. Nb5 $132) 20. Nb5 (20. Rac1 Rxc7 21. Rxc4 Rxc4 22. bxc4 $11) 20... Nxe3 21. fxe3 {White keep enough compensation.} Rd7 (21... e5 22. Nd6 Rd7 23. Nxe4 Rfd8 24. Rxd7 Rxd7 25. Rc1 Bb7 26. Ng3 (26. Ng5 Rd2 27. e4 h6 28. Rc7 hxg5 29. Rxb7 Rxa2 $15) 26... Kf7 (26... Rd2 27. e4 $1 $11) 27. Rc2 Ke6 28. Kf2 $11) 22. Rxd7 Bxd7 23. Nd6 Bc8 (23... Bc6 24. Rc1 $44) 24. Rc1 Ba6 25. Nxe4 {The material equality is restored.} Rf5 26. b4 Re5 27. Nd6 Rd5 {Avoiding a trap:} (27... Rxe3 $2 28. b5 Rd3 29. Rc6 Rxd6 30. Rxd6 Bxb5 31. Rxe6 $16) 28. b5 Rxd6 29. bxa6 (29. bxa6 Rd7 30. Kf2 Kf7 31. Kf3 $11) 1/2-1/2

