1. d4 {Stohl,I} Nf6 (1... d6 2. g3 e5 (2... Nf6 3. Bg2 e5 4. dxe5 dxe5 5. Qxd8+ Kxd8 6. Nd2 c6 7. Ngf3 Nfd7 8. Ng5 Ke8 9. Nc4 Nb6 10. Na5 Na6 11. O-O f6 12. Ne4 Bb4 13. Bd2 Bxd2 14. Nxd2 Ke7 15. a3 Kd6 16. b4 Kc7 17. c4 Rd8 18. Ne4 $36 {Bandza,A-Pribyl,M/Trnava op/1990/}) 3. Bg2 Nf6 4. c4 $6 {-A2} exd4 5. Qxd4 Nc6 6. Qd2 Be6 7. b3 d5 8. cxd5 Bb4 $1 9. Nc3 Nxd5 10. Bb2 Qf6 11. Bxd5 Bxd5 12. Qe3+ Qe7 13. Qxe7+ Kxe7 14. f3 Be6 15. a3 Bxc3+ 16. Bxc3 f6 17. h4 Rhd8 18. h5 Nd4 $17 {Teske,H-Zagorskis,D/Berliner Sommer/1994/}) 2. g3 g6 (2... e5 $5 3. d5 (3. dxe5 $142 Ng4 4. Nf3 Nc6 5. Bf4 Bc5 6. e3 Qe7 7. Nc3 Bb4 $132) 3... c6 4. Nc3 Nxd5 5. Nxd5 cxd5 6. Qxd5 Nc6 7. Nf3 d6 8. c3 Be6 9. Qd1 Be7 10. Bg2 d5 11. O-O O-O 12. Be3 h6 13. Ne1 d4 14. cxd4 exd4 15. Bd2 Bd5 16. Bxd5 Qxd5 17. Nd3 Rad8 $15 {,Li Manuel-Arencibia,W/CUB-ch Colon/1993/}) 3. Bg2 d6 (3... Bg7 4. e4 d6 5. Nc3 O-O 6. Nge2 Nbd7 7. O-O c6 8. a4 Qc7 9. h3 e5 10. Be3 Re8 11. f4 exd4 12. Bxd4 b6 13. g4 Ba6 14. Rf2 Rad8 15. g5 Nh5 16. Bxg7 Nxg7 17. Ng3 Bb7 18. h4 a6 19. Qd2 b5 20. axb5 axb5 21. Re1 Qb6 22. Nd1 d5 23. Ne3 dxe4 24. Ng4 e3 25. Rxe3 $36 {[%csl Rf6,Rh6] ×f6,h6,Hort,V-Polgar,J/Monaco Veterans-Women/1994/ In this game Judit Polgar also carelessly weakens the black squares.}) 4. Nc3 Na6 5. e4 c5 6. d5 (6. Nge2 cxd4 7. Nxd4 Bg7 8. O-O O-O $14 {-B7}) 6... Bg7 7. Bf4 (7. Nf3 O-O (7... Bg4 8. h3 Bxf3 9. Bxf3 Nc7 10. a4 Nd7 11. O-O a6 12. Be2 $14 {[%csl Gc1,Ge2,Yd4,Yd5,Ye4,Ye5] ,}) 8. O-O e6 $5 $132) 7... O-O 8. Nge2 Nc7 {[%cal Yb7b5] b5} 9. a4 b6 (9... a6 $6 10. a5 $14 {[%csl Rb6] ×b6}) 10. Qd2 Re8 (10... Bb7 11. Bh6 $1 $14) 11. O-O Bb7 12. Bh6 Bh8 {[%cal Rf6g4] g4} (12... e6 $6 13. Bxg7 Kxg7 14. dxe6 Rxe6 15. Nf4 Re8 16. Rfe1 $16 {[%csl Rd6,Rg7] עg7,d6}) 13. h3 Qd7 (13... a6 $142 $5 $132 {[%cal Yb6b5] b5}) 14. Rad1 Rad8 {[%cal Re7e6] e6} 15. Bg5 a6 (15... e6 $2 16. Qf4 $36) 16. g4 $5 {White can't play passively, as Black has already prepared counterplay on the side.} b5 17. Ng3 (17. axb5 $142 axb5 18.