1. d4 {Jussupow,Artur Hecht Ftacnik Jussupow,Artur Hecht Ftacnik Kharitonov: 'D29: Queen's Gambit Accepted: Classical main line: 7 Qe2 with early ...Nbd7 Hecht Ftacnik'} d5 2. c4 dxc4 3. e3 Nf6 4. Bxc4 e6 5. Nf3 c5 6. O-O a6 7. Qe2 b5 8. Bb3 Bb7 9. a4 Nbd7 (9... b4 $6 10. Rd1 Nbd7 11. Nbd2 Be7 12. Nc4 Bd5 13. Nfe5 $16 {Ionov,S-Ibragimov,I/Elista RUS-ch/1994/1:0/32/}) 10. axb5 axb5 11. Rxa8 Qxa8 12. Nc3 b4 13. Nb5 Qb8 (13... Qa5 $5 {Anakysis by Huebner in Huebner,R-Georgiev,Ki/Moscow olm/1994/ ;CBM 45}) 14. e4 Nxe4 $6 (14... cxd4 15. Nbxd4 $5 (15. Nfxd4 Nc5 16. e5 Nfd7 17. Bf4 Nxb3 18. Nxb3 Be7 19. Rd1 Ba6 20. Nc7+ Qxc7 21. Qxa6 O-O 22. Nd4 Nc5 23. Qc4 $14 {Kopylov,N-Flohr,S/Moscow URS-ch/1951/0,5/42/}) 15... Be7 (15... Bc5 $5) (15... Nc5 $6 16. Bc4 Be7 17. Bb5+ Nfd7 18. Rd1 O-O 19. Bxd7 Nxd7 20. Nxe6 fxe6 21. Rxd7 $16 {Huebner,R-GeorgievmKi/Koscow olm (09)/1994/1-0/ ;CBM 45}) (15... Bd6 16. Bc2 $11) 16. Rd1 (16. e5 Nd5 17. Rd1 O-O 18. Nf5 Bc5 19. Ng3 Bb6 $13 {Chernikov,O-Hohlovkin,G/Rostov/1961/0:1/35/}) 16... Bxe4 (16... O-O 17. Nxe6) 17. Ng5 Qb7 18. Nxf7 $1 Kxf7 19. Nxe6 Bd5 20. Ng5+ Ke8 21. Bxd5 Nxd5 22. Qe6 $40 {Uhlmann,W-Fichtl,G/Dresden/1959/1:0/57/}) (14... Bxe4 $6 15. Ng5 Bd5 (15... Bg6 16. d5 $40) 16. Bxd5 Nxd5 17. Nxe6 fxe6 18. Qxe6+ Kd8 19. Qxd5 Qxb5 20. Bf4 $40) 15. Ng5 Bc6 {Jussupow,Artur: 'N' Jussupow,Artur: 'Ü 48/(519)' Jussupow,Artur: 'N' Jussupow,Artur: 'Ü 48/(519)' Kharitonov: '??' Kharitonov: 'there were better ways to keep up the pressure'} (15... Nxg5 16. Bxg5 $40 (16. Bxg5 {Ftacnik} h6 (16... Be7 17. Bxe6 $1 Bxg5 (17... fxe6 18. Qxe6 Nf6 19. Re1 $18) 18. Bxd7+ Kxd7 19. Qg4+ Kc6 20. Qxg5 $16) 17. Bh4 (17. Bxe6 hxg5 18. Bh3+ Kd8 $19) 17... cxd4 (17... Be7 18. Bg3 $16) 18. Bxe6 $1)) (15... Ndf6 16. Ba4 Bc6 (16... Nxg5 17. Bxg5 Bc6 18. Bxf6 gxf6 19. d5 $1 $40) 17. Nxe4 Nxe4 18. Nc7+ Qxc7 19. Qxe4 Bxa4 20. Qa8+ Qd8 21. Qxa4+ $40) (15... cxd4 16. Nxd4 Nxg5 17. Bxg5 $14) 16. d5 $1 {Kharitonov: '??' Kharitonov: 'not a good decision, because now the opp