fer to 13.d1}) 14... Qb6 $15 15. Bg3 ({Can be recommended: Golod,V: 'What can be recommended is:'} 15. cxd5 exd5 16. Bd3 $15) 15... Bc6 $5 {[%cal Yc6a4] 16...d4} ({Badly right away: Golod,V: 'Playing'} 15... d4 {because of: Golod,V: 'right away is bad, because of:'} 16. exd4 cxd4 17. Na4 {[%csl Rd4]}) 16. f4 $6 {[%mdl 16384] ×e4;g4} ({Also dubious: Golod,V: 'Also dubious is:'} 16. f3 {in view of:} d4 17. exd4 cxd4 18. Bf2 e5 $36) ({Probably better is:} 16. Bd3 d4 17. Ne4 Nxe4 18. Bxe4 Bxe4 19. Qxe4 f5 20. Qc2 e5 $15) 16... Ng4 $1 {[%csl Re3]} ({Dubious: Golod,V: 'Dubious is:'} 16... d4 $2 {because of:} 17. exd4 cxd4 18. Bf2 {[%csl Rb6,Rd4]} Nc5 19. b4 (19. Bxd4 $4 Nb3+) 19... Qa6 {[%csl Ra3,Rc3]} 20. Bxd4 (20. Qa2 dxc3 21. Bxc5 Rfd8 $13) 20... Qxa3+ 21. Qb2 Nb3+ 22. Kc2 Nxd4+ 23. Rxd4 Qxb2+ 24. Kxb2 Rfd8 $11) 17. Bf2 ({Very weakly:} 17. Qe2 {because of: Golod,V: 'is very weak, because of:'} d4 18. exd4 cxd4 19. Qxg4 dxc3 $19) ({After:} 17. Qd2 $6 Rab8 {[%csl Rb2,Yd2,Re3][%cal Gg4e3,Yd2b2,Yd2e3] black has a strong initiative. Golod,V: 'Black has a strong initiative.'}) 17... Ndf6 {With the idea:18...xf2 19.xf2 g4 and 20...d4} 18. Bg1 (18. h3 $143 Nxf2 19. Qxf2 Rfd8 {20...ab8(קb2) and 21...d4}) 18... Rfd8 $5 19. h3 $140 Nxe3 $1 20. Bxe3 d4 {[%csl Rc3,Re3]} 21. Bd3 $2 ({It is necessary:} 21. Bd2 dxc3 22. Bxc3 Rxd1+ 23. Qxd1 Ne4 $15) 21... dxe3 $17 22. Rde1 (22. Qe2 $2 Rab8 $19 {[%csl Rb2,Rg2]}) ({More stubborn resistance after: Golod,V: 'More stubborn resistance is put up after:'} 22. Rhe1) 22... Nh5 $1 {[%csl Rf4]} 23. Rxe3 ({Loses right away:} 23. Rhf1 Ng3 24. Rg1 Qc7 {[%csl Rf4]} 25. Rxe3 Qxf4 26. Rge1 Rd4 $19) ({and} 23. f5 Nf4 {[%csl Rd3,Ge3,Rg2]} 24. Rxe3 $140 Nxg2 25. Rg3 Ne3 $1 26. Rxe3 Bxh1 $19) 23... Nxf4 {[%csl Rg2]} 24. Bh7+ Kh8 25. Rf1 ({Slightly better is:} 25. Be4) 25... Nxg2 26. Rg3 Qc7 $19 {[%csl Rg3,Rh7][%cal Yc7f7]} 27. Ne2 Qe5 ({Also win: Golod,V: 'Also winning is:'} 27... f5) 28. Qc3 {[%csl Rg7]} (28. Rxf7 {is refuted by:} Ba4 $1 29. Qxa4 