1. e4 {Anand Anand} c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 a6 6. Bg5 {A recent addition to Kamsky's arsenal} e6 7. f4 Be7 8. Qf3 h6 9. Bh4 Nbd7 10. O-O-O Qc7 11. Bd3 g5 12. fxg5 Ne5 13. Qe2 Nfd7 {This is new but maybe not good} (13... Nfg4 14. Nf3 Nxf3 15. gxf3 hxg5) 14. Qh5 Nc5 (14... Ng6 15. Nxe6 $18) 15. gxh6 Ncxd3+ 16. cxd3 Qc5 17. Nf5 $1 exf5 18. d4 Qb6 19. Bxe7 (19. dxe5 Qe3+ 20. Kb1 Rxh6 21. Bf2 Rxh5 22. Bxe3 dxe5) 19... Nc4 20. Qe2 Qxb2+ 21. Qxb2 Nxb2 22. Kxb2 $2 (22. Bf6 $1 $18 Nxd1 (22... Rxh6 23. Kxb2 Rxf6 24. Nd5 $18) 23. Bxh8 Nxc3 24. h7 Be6 (24... Ne2+ 25. Kb2 Nf4 26. Bg7 Ng6 27. h4 $1 $18) 25. Bg7 Kd7 26. d5 $1 $18 {White ends up with an extra rook}) 22... Kxe7 $14 23. Nd5+ Kd8 24. Nb6 Rb8 25. exf5 $6 (25. Nxc8 Rxc8 26. exf5 Rxh6 27. h4 {g4} d5 $14) 25... Bxf5 26. Rhf1 Bg6 27. Rf6 Rxh6 28. h3 Rh5 $1 29. d5 Rh4 30. Kc3 Kc7 31. Nc4 Re8 32. Rd4 Rxd4 33. Kxd4 Rd8 34. h4 b5 35. Ne3 Re8 36. Rf4 Rh8 37. a3 a5 38. g3 Kd7 39. Rf6 Ke7 {Anand: '=' '='} 40. Rf2 Kd7 41. Rf6 b4 $2 {Black has no reason to play for a win} (41... Ke7 $10) 42. axb4 axb4 43. Nc4 Rb8 44. Rxd6+ Ke7 45. Rb6 Rxb6 46. Nxb6 b3 47. Nc4 Kd7 48. Kc3 Be4 49. Ne3 Kd6 50. Kxb3 Kc5 (50... Bxd5+ 51. Nxd5 Kxd5 52. h5 $1 (52. Kc2 Ke4 53. Kd2 Kf5 (53... f5 54. h5 $18) 54. Ke3 Kg4 55. Ke4 f5+ 56. Ke5 Kxg3 57. h5 f4 58. h6 f3 $10) 52... Ke5 53. Kc4 Kf5 54. Kd5 Kg5 55. g4 f5 56. h6 Kxh6 57. gxf5 Kg7 58. Ke6 Kf8 59. Kf6 $18) 51. Kc3 Bg6 52. g4 f6 53. h5 Bh7 54. h6 Bg6 55. Nf5 Bh7 56. d6 Kc6 57. Kd4 Kd7 58. Kc5 Bg8 59. Ne7 Bh7 60. Nd5 Ke6 61. d7 Kxd7 62. Nxf6+ Ke6 63. Nxh7 Kf7 64. Ng5+ Kg6 65. h7 Kxg5 (65... Kg7 66. h8=Q+ $18) 66. h8=Q 1-0

