1. d4 {Golod,V Golod,V Golod,V Golod,V: 'Golod,Vitali Golod,Vitali: 'Golod,V''} Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. Qc2 O-O 5. a3 Bxc3+ 6. Qxc3 b6 7. Bg5 Ba6 $5 ({Other lines are:} 7... c5) ({and} 7... Bb7) 8. e3 d6 9. b4 {Besides,white has several options:} (9. Nf3 $5 {See comments to Ivanchuk,V-Adams,M/ Linares,1999/CBM 70(0-1)(Golod,V)(40)}) (9. f3) (9. Qc2) (9. Bd3 $5 {Is the main line.See comments to Jelen,I-Gyimesi,Z/Baden,1999/CBM 71 (½-½)(Golod,V)(25) Golod,V: 'Is the main line.See comments to     Jelen,I-Gyimesi,Z/Baden,1999/CBM 71 (½-½)(Golod,V)(25)''Is the main line.See comments to     Jelen,I-Gyimesi,Z/Baden,1999/CBM 71 (½-½)(Golod,V)(25) Golod,Vitali: 'Is the main line.See comments to Jelen,I-Gyimesi,Z/Baden,1999/CBM 71 (½-½)(Golod,V)(25) Golod,V: 'Is the main line.See comments to     Jelen,I-Gyimesi,Z/Baden,1999/CBM 71 (½-½)(Golod,V)(25)'''}) 9... Nbd7 10. f3 $5 $146 {[%csl Re4][%cal Yf3e4][%mdl 8]} (10. Bd3 $5 {Is the first game in this variation (9.b4)} c5 11. dxc5 bxc5 12. b5 Bb7 13. f3 d5 14. Ne2 Qb6 15. O-O dxc4 16. Bxc4 Nd5 17. Qb3 $13 {Johansen,T-Gausel,E/Oslo,1998(0-1)(43)}) 10... Re8 ({Also possibly:} 10... c5) ({Dubious:} 10... Ne4 {in view of:} 11. Bxd8 Nxc3 $140 12. Bh4 $1 {[%csl Rc3] and because of bad knight(c3) white has a big advantage.} (12. Bxc7 $143 Rfc8 13. Bxd6 Bxc4 14. Bxc4 Rxc4 $44)) 11. Nh3 {[%csl Yh3][%cal Yh3g5]} (11. Bd3 $6 e5 {[%cal Ge5e4]} 12. d5 $140 $2 e4 $15) 11... h6 12. Bh4 Rc8 {with the idea c5;d5 or e4} ({Again dubious:} 12... Ne4 13. Bxd8 Nxc3 14. Bxc7 (14. Bh4 $5 {[%csl Rc3]}) 14... Rac8 15. Bxd6 Bxc4 16. Bxc4 Rxc4 17. Kd2 $16) 13. Bf2 d5 $5 {[%csl Ga6,Gd5]} ({Another alternative is:} 13... c5 $5 14. dxc5 bxc5 (14... dxc5 $143 15. e4 {/=}) 15. b5 Bb7 16. Rd1 (16. Be2 d5 17. O-O e5 18. cxd5 Nxd5 19. Qc2 e4 $13) 16... d5 17. Be2 e5 18. cxd5 Nxd5 19. Qd2 $13) 14. b5 ({Worse is:} 14. c5 Bxf1 15. Kxf1 bxc5 16. bxc5 (16. dxc5 $143 e5 $15) 16... e5 {[%csl Rf1] =/}) 14... Bb7 15. cxd5 ({Badly:} 15. c5 {because of:} c6 {[%csl Rc3,Gc8]}) 15... Nxd5 $1 {Differently after:} (15... exd5 16. Bd3 c5 17. bxc6 Rxc6 18. Qb2 {white has a positional advantage.}) 16. Qb2 $140 e5 {[%csl Re1]} 17. e4 ({Much worse is:} 17. dxe5 Nxe5 18. Rd1 Qe7 $36) 17... exd4 18. Bxd4 {[%csl Rg7]} Nc5 $1 {[%mdl 576] Is the best practical chance.} ({After:} 18... N5f6 19. Be2 {white has a big positional advantage.}) 19. Bxc5 {This move better than:} (19. Bxg7 $6 Nxe4 20. fxe4 Qh4+ $44 {[%csl Re1]}) ({and} 19. O-O-O $2 {because of:} Na4 $1 20. Qb3 $140 {[%csl Ra4,Rd5]} c6 {[%csl Rc1,Gc8]} 21. exd5 (21. Qxa4 $4 cxb5+ {[%csl Ra4,Rc1,Gc8]}) 21... cxb5+ 22. Kb1 Bxd5 $17 23. Qxb5 $140 Bxf3 $1 24. gxf3 (24. Qxa4 Bxd1 25. Qxd1 Re4 26. Ba6 Rxd4 27. Qxd4 Qxd4 28. Bxc8 Qe4+ $19 {[%csl Rb1,Rg2]}) 24... Nc3+ 25. Bxc3 Qxd1+ 26. Kb2 (26. Ka2 Qxf3 $19 {[%csl Rc3,Rh1]}) 26... Re1 $1 {[%cal Gd1b1]} 27. Bxe1 (27. Qd3 Qxd3 28. Bxd3 Rxh1) 27... Qc2+ 28. Ka1 Qc1+ 29. Ka2 (29. Qb1 Qxa3+ 30. Qa2 Rc1#) 29... Rc2+ 30. Kb3 Rb2+ 31. Ka4 Qc2+ 32. Qb3 Qxb3#) 19... bxc5 20. O-O-O {[%csl Gd1,Rd5,Rd8]} c6 $8 21. bxc6 {Besides this move can be recommended:} (21. Bc4 {(right away)}) ({or after:} 21. exd5 cxd5 22. Bc4) 21... Bxc6 22. exd5 ({Dubious:} 22. Bc4 {in view of:} Rb8 23. Qa1 (23. Bxd5 $6 Rxb2 24. Bxf7+ (24. Bxc6 $4 Qf6 $19 {[%csl Rc1][%cal Gf6c3]}) 24... Kxf7 25. Rxd8 Rxd8 26. Kxb2 Rd2+ 27. Kc3 Rxg2 {=/}) (23. Qc2 $2 Qa5 {[%csl Rc1][%cal Ga5a3]}) 23... Qf6 24. Qxf6 Nxf6 25. Rd6 Bb5 $11) 22... Qa5 {with the idea 23...b8 weakness(c1;a3)} 23. dxc6 {Is the obligatory move.} (23. Nf4 $2 Rb8 24. Qa1 Rb3 $1 {[%csl Rc1][%cal Gb3c3,Gb3a3] with strong attack.}) (23. Nf2 $144 Rb8 24. Qa1 Rb3 $1 $17) 23... Rb8 24. c7 $6 ({In my opinion better is:} 24. Qa1 Rb3 $8 ({Loses:} 24... Re3 $2 {[%cal Ge3c3]} 25. Bd3 c4 (25... Rb3 $143 26. Bc2 Rxa3 27. Qb1 $18 {[%csl Rg8]} Ra1 $140 28. Rd8+ Qxd8 29. Qxa1) 26. c7 Qxc7 27. Bc2 Qc5 28. Rhe1 Rxa3 29. Qe5 $18 {[%csl Rg8]}) 25. Bd3 Rxa3 26. Qb2 Ra2 $1 {[%csl Rc1]} (26... c4 $2 27. Rhe1 $1 {[%csl Gb2,Rg8]} Ra1+ 28. Bb1 Rxb1+ (28... Qxe1 $2 29. Rxe1 Rxe1+ 30. Kd2 c3+ (30... Raxb1 31. Qxb1 $1 Rxb1 32. c7 c3+ 33. Kc2 Rb2+ 34. Kxc3 $18) 31. Qxc3 Raxb1 32. Qc2 $18) 29. Kxb1 (29. Qxb1 $4 Qc3+ 30. Qc2 Qa1+ 31. Qb1 Qc3+ $11) 29... Rxe1 30. Rxe1 Qxe1+ 31. Qc1 Qb4+ 32. Kc2 Qa4+ 33. Kc3 Qxc6 34. Qf4 $16 {[%csl Rc4] }) 27. Rhe1 {[%csl Rg8]} Rc8 $1 {[%csl Rc1]} 28. Qb3 Ra3 29. Qb2 Ra2 $11) 24... Rxb2 25. Kxb2 {Golod,V: 'After:''Golod,Vitali: 'After:' Golod,Vitali: 'Golod,V: 'After:'''} Qb6+ $5 ({Slightly worse is:} 25... Qxc7 26. Bc4 Qe5+ 27. Kc2 Rb8 28. Rb1 Rxb1 29. Rxb1 Qxh2 30. Bf1 $11) 26. Ka2 Qe6+ {Golod,V: 'equality''Golod,Vitali: 'equality' Golod,Vitali: 'Golod,V: 'equality'''} 27. Kb2 c4 $5 {[%csl Rb2]} ({After:} 27... Qb6+ 28. Ka2 Qe6+ {equality}) 28. Rd8 Qb6+ 29. Kc3 ({Loses right away:} 29. Ka1 $2 Rxd8 30. cxd8=Q+ Qxd8 $19 {[%csl Ra1,Rc4,Yd8]}) ({Also good enough for equality:} 29. Kc2 Qb3+ 30. Kd2 {Golod,V: 'transfer to 29.c2'} c3+ (30... Qb2+ 31. Kd1 $11) 31. Kd3 c2+ 32. Kd2 c1=Q+ 33. Kxc1 Qxa3+ 34. Kc2 Qa2+ {and see game after:35...a2+}) 29... Qb3+ {Golod,V: 'and see game after:29...b3+''Golod,Vitali: 'and see game after:29...b3+' Golod,Vitali: 'Golod,V: 'and see game after:29...b3+'''} 30. Kd4 $11 (30. Kd2 {transfer to 29.c2}) 30... Qb6+ ({Senselessly:} 30... Qd1+ 31. Kc5 Rxd8 32. cxd8=Q+ Qxd8 33. Kxc4) 31. Kc3 (31. Kd5 $144 Qe6+ 32. Kc5 Qb6+ $11) 31... Qa5+ 32. Kc2 Qa4+ 33. Kd2 (33. Kc3 Qb3+ {and see game after:29...b3+}) 33... c3+ ({Also draw after:} 33... Qa5+) 34. Kxc3 Qxa3+ {[%csl Ga3,Rc3,Rc7]} 35. Kc2 Qa2+ {Golod,V: 'and see game a'Golod,Vitali: 'Golod,V: 'and see game after:35...a2+''' fter:35...a2+'} 36. Kc1 (36. Kc3 $2 Qa5+ 37. Kc2 Rxd8 38. cxd8=Q+ Qxd8 $15) 36... Qa3+ 37. Kc2 Qa4+ {Golod,V: '=' '=' '=''Golod,Vitali: '=' Golod,Vitali: 'Golod,V: '='''} 38. Kc1 (38. Kb2 $144 Qb4+ 39. Kc2 (39. Ka2 $2 Qa5+ {[%csl Rd8]}) 39... Qa4+ $11) 38... Qa1+ 39. Kc2 1/2-1/2

