1. e4 {Anand Karpov,Anatoly Anand Ftacnik Donev Karpov doesn't usually do this but Judit had fended off both Ivanchuk and Gelfand in earlier rounds with the King's Indian (she was better when she agreed draws)and Anatoly decides it's time for a change Karpov,Anatoly: 'Anand Anand: 'Ftacnik Donev Karpov doesn't usually do this but Judit had fended off both Ivanchuk and Gelfand in earlier rounds with the King's Indian (she was better when she agreed draws)and Anatoly decides it's time for a change''} c5 2. c3 {Good psychology! Judit had showed herself vulnerable against this. Karpov,Anatoly: 'Anand: 'Good psychology! Judit had showed herself vulnerable against this.''} e6 3. d4 d5 4. exd5 exd5 5. Nf3 Nc6 6. Bb5 c4 $2 {This releases the tension too early. Black should play 6...d6 Karpov,Anatoly: 'N?!' Karpov,Anatoly: 'Anand: '?' Anand: 'This releases the tension too early. Black should play 6...d6''} (6... Bd6 {Ftacnik Karpov,Anatoly: 'Ü 57/278 Anand: 'Ftacnik''} 7. dxc5 {Karpov,Anatoly: 'Anand'} Bxc5 8. O-O Nge7) 7. Ne5 {Karpov,Anatoly: '!'} (7. O-O {Karpov,Anatoly} Bd6 { Ne7}) 7... Qb6 (7... Bd7 {Ftacnik Karpov,Anatoly: 'Anand: 'Ftacnik''} 8. Bxc6 (8. Nxd7 $6 {Karpov,Anatoly}) 8... Bxc6 9. O-O Bd6 10. Qg4 $1 $36 {Karpov,Anatoly: '!' Karpov,Anatoly: 'Anand: '!''}) 8. Bxc6+ (8. Qa4 $1 {Karpov,Anatoly: 'Anand: '!''} Nge7 {Karpov,Anatoly: '?!'} (8... Bd7 9. Nxd7 Kxd7 10. O-O (10. b3 {Karpov,Anatoly: 'Anand'} a6 11. bxc4 $2 Re8+ $1) (10. Bxc6+ {Karpov,Anatoly: 'Anand'} Qxc6 $10) 10... a6 11. Bxc6+ Qxc6 12. Qd1 $1 $14 (12. Qc2 $6 {Karpov,Anatoly} Qg6 $1)) 9. b3 $14 (9. b3 {Ftacnik Karpov,Anatoly: 'Anand: '' Anand: 'Ftacnik''} a6 10. bxc4 $1 $16)) 8... bxc6 9. O-O Bd6 10. b3 {Karpov,Anatoly: '!'} cxb3 11. axb3 Ne7 12. Ba3 Bxe5 $6 {Karpov,Anatoly: 'Anand: '?!''} (12... c5 $1 $14 {Karpov,Anatoly: 'Anand'}) (12... Bxa3 {Ftacnik Karpov,Anatoly: 'Anand: 'Ftacnik''} 13. Rxa3 (13. Nxa3 O-O 14. Re1 Bf5 $14 {Karpov,Anatoly: 'Anand: '''} 15. g4 $5 {Karpov,Anatoly}) 13... O-O