{ChessCalisthenics: 'D43: Semi-Slav: 5 Bg5 h6'} 1. d4 {ChessCalisthenics} Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nf3 d5 4. Nc3 dxc4 5. Qa4+ c6 6. Qxc4 b5 7. Qd3 Nbd7 (7... Bb7 {ChessCalisthenics} 8. e4 b4 9. Na4 Qa5 10. b3 {1-0 (40) Kortschnoj,V (2639)-Polgar,J (2686) Hoogeveen 2001 [ChessCalisthenics]} Ba6 {ChessCalisthenics} 11. Qc2 Bxf1 12. Rxf1 Be7 13. Bg5 h6 14. Bxf6 Bxf6 15. O-O-O O-O 16. Kb1 Nd7 17. Nd2 Nb6 18. Nc4 Qh5 19. Naxb6 axb6 20. Nxb6 Ra7 21. h3 Qb5 22. Na4 Bxd4 23. Qd3 e5 24. f4 Rc8 25. fxe5 {Kortschnoj,V (2620)-Gyimesi,Z (2624)/Warsaw 2005/CBM 110 ext/1/ 2-1/2 (46)}) 8. e4 b4 9. Na4 Qa5 10. b3 Bb7 (10... c5) (10... Nb6 $5) 11. e5 (11. Bg5 {ChessCalisthenics} c5 12. Bxf6 gxf6 13. Be2 O-O-O 14. O-O Kb8 15. d5 Nb6 16. Nxb6 Qxb6 17. Qe3 exd5 18. exd5 Rxd5 19. Bc4 Rd8 20. Rad1 Bd6 21. Rd3 Rhe8 22. Qh6 Be4 23. Re3 f5 24. Rfe1 Bc7 25. Qh5 {1/2-1/2 Kazhgaleyev,M (2599) -Erdos,V (2523)/Sibenik 2007/CBM 120 ext}) 11... Nd5 12. Bd2 (12. Ng5 $5 {Ü 58/456 Ü 58/456 Ü 58/456}) 12... N7b6 $5 $146 {ChessCalisthenics: 'N'} (12... c5 13. dxc5 Bxc5 14. Qb5 $14) (12... N5b6 {ChessCalisthenics} 13. a3 h6 14. Be2 Nd5 15. O-O Qc7 16. axb4 Nxb4 17. Qe4 a5 18. Rfc1 g6 19. Nc5 Nxc5 20. dxc5 Nd5 21. Ra4 Be7 22. Bd3 Kf8 23. h4 Kg7 24. h5 gxh5 25. Nd4 Kf8 26. Be2 Bd8 27. Bxh5 {Tregubov,P (2615)-Yagupov,I (2482)/Ubeda 2000/CBM 075/1-0 (40)}) 13. Ng5 $5 (13. a3 Nxa4 14. axb4 Nxb4 15. Qb1 Qb6 $1 16. bxa4 (16. Rxa4 c5 $11) 16... a5 $11) 13... Nxa4 14. Qf3 $6 (14. bxa4 Be7 15. Ne4 Qxa4 16. Be2 $44) 14... f6 15. exf6 gxf6 16. Qh5+ $2 (16. Nxe6 $142 Nac3 17. Bc4 { 0-0  0-0  0-0}) 16... Kd7 17. Qf7+ Be7 18. Nxe6 Rae8 $2 {ChessCalisthenics: '??'} (18... Nac3 {ChessCalisthenics: ''} 19. Bd3 (19. Nc5+ $2 Kc8 20. Qe6+ Kb8 $19) 19... Rag8 20. Bf5 Kc8 $17) 19. bxa4 $16 Kc8 20. Ng7 Rhf8 (20... b3 21. Qe6+ { a5+-  Ba5+-  a5+-}) 21. Qh5 b3 {ChessCalisthenics: '?'} (21... Rd8 {ChessCalisthenics} 22. Ne6 $16) 22. Be2 (22. Bxa5 $4 Bb4+ 23. Kd1 Re1# {#}) (22. Nxe8 $5 Bb4 23. Nd6+ Kd7 24. Ne4 Bxd2+ 25. Nxd2 Re