5 Rb8 47. Rfe5+ Kf7 48. c5 Rh6 49. b4 axb4 50. a5 $18) 46. Ke4 Rxb3 47. Rb5 $18) 44. Rb7 (44. Ke3 $5 h5 45. Rb7 h4 46. Rb5 Re6+ 47. Kf3 Rd8 48. R7xb6 Rd3+ 49. Kg2 h3+ 50. Kf2 Rd2+ 51. Kg3 Rd3+ 52. Kh4 Rxb6 53. Rxb6+ e6 $132 54. Rb5 Rf3) (44. Rb5 Rb8) 44... Rd6 {Junior 5.0 (5s): '+-'} (44... e6 45. Rxh7 Rd6 46. Re3 $16) 45. Ke3 {Junior 5.0 (5s): ''} (45. Rb5 $5 {Junior 5.0 (5s): '+-!?'} Rd3+ 46. Ke2 Rh3 $5 47. R7xb6+ e6 48. Rxa5 Rxh2+ 49. Kf3 Rd8 $132 50. Rd5 Rh3+ 51. Kg2 Rxb3) 45... Red8 $1 (45... h5 46. Rb5 Re6+ 47. Kf3 Rd8 48. R7xb6 Rd3+ 49. Kg2 $16) (45... e6 46. Rxh7 Red8 47. Kf3 $16) 46. Rbxe7 Rd3+ 47. Kf2 {Junior 5.0 (5s): 'Threatening mate: R5e6'} Rd2+ 48. Kg3 R8d3+ 49. Re3 Rxe3+ 50. Rxe3 Rd4 $1 $11 51. h3 h6 (51... h5 $5) 52. Rf3 Kf7 53. Kh4 (53. Kf2 Re4 $1) 53... Kg6 54. Kg3 (54. Rg3+ $5 Kf6 (54... Kh7 $5 $16) 55. Kh5 {Junior 5.0 (5s): ''} (55. Rf3 $11) 55... Rxf4 56. Rg6+ Ke5 57. Rxb6 {Junior 5.0 (5s): '+-'} Rf3 $11 58. h4 f4) (54. Re3 Rxf4+ 55. Kg3 Kg5 $14) 54... Kf7 55. Rc3 Ke6 (55... Rd6 56. Kh4 $16) 56. Kf3 (56. c5 $5 $16) 56... Kf6 (56... Kd6 57. Re3 $14) 57. Re3 (57. c5 bxc5 58. Rxc5 Rd3+ 59. Kg2 Rxb3 (59... Rd2+ 60. Kf1 Rd1+ 61. Ke2 Rb1 $16) 60. Rxa5 Rb2+ 61. Kg3 Rb3+ 62. Kh4 Rf3 $11) 57... Rd2 58. Kg3 (58. h4 $5 $14) 58... Rd4 59. Rf3 (59. h4 $5 $14) 59... Kf7 1/2-1/2

