 Kxg8 35. Bc2 {Threatening mate: Bxh7} f5 36. Qxd6 Qc8 37. Bb3 Be6 38. Bxe6 fxe6 39. Qe7 Qc4 40. Qe8+ (40. Kg3 Qe4 $11) 40... Kg7 41. Qe7+ Kg6 42. Qe8+ Kf6 43. Qf8+ Kg6 1/2-1/2

