{[%mdl 8192]} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. c3 (3. Bb5 d6 4. O-O Bd7 5. c3 Nf6 6. Re1 a6 7. Bf1 Bg4 8. d3 g6 9. Nbd2 Bg7 10. h3 Bxf3 11. Nxf3 O-O 12. d4 cxd4 13. cxd4 Rc8 14. a3 e6 15. Bg5 h6 16. Bh4 Qb6 17. Qd2 d5 {Smirin,I-Anand,V/Moscow PCA 1994/½-½ (79)}) (3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 d6 6. Bg5 e6 7. Qd3 Be7 8. O-O-O Nxd4 9. Qxd4 O-O 10. Bc4 Qa5 11. h4 Bd7 12. Bb3 Bc6 13. f3 Rfd8 14. g4 b5 15. Kb1 b4 16. Ne2 Qb5 17. Ng3 Rd7 {Kotsur,P-Kharlov,A/Moscow SU Cup 1998/1-0 (60)}) 3... d5 4. exd5 Qxd5 5. d4 Nf6 $146 (5... Bg4 6. Be2 $15) 6. Be3 cxd4 7. cxd4 e6 8. Nc3 Qd6 9. a3 Be7 10. Bd3 O-O 11. Qc2 a6 $14 (11... Bd7 12. Bg5 h6 13. Bxf6 Bxf6 14. Ne4 $11) 12. O-O $11 (12. Rc1 h6 $14) 12... g6 13. Rad1 Bd7 14. Ne4 (14. Qc1 Bc8 $14) 14... Nxe4 15. Bxe4 f5 16. Bd3 Rac8 17. Qe2 Bf6 {[%cal Rc6d4,Rd6d4,Rf6d4,Ge3d4,Gf3d4] The pressure on the isolated pawn grows} 18. g3 Ne7 (18... Nxd4 $2 19. Bxd4 Bxd4 20. Bc4 Rxc4 21. Qxc4 $18) 19. Bh6 Rfe8 20. Rfe1 Ba4 (20... Bxd4 $2 21. Nxd4 Nd5 22. Qe5 Qxe5 23. Rxe5 $18) 21. Rc1 Rxc1 22. Bxc1 Nd5 23. h4 Bc6 (23... Qb6 24. b4 $11) 24. Bc4 (24. Ne5 Rc8 $11) 24... f4 25. g4 Nc7 26. Rd1 $15 (26. b4 b5 (26... Bxd4 27. Nxd4 Qxd4 28. Bb2 $11) 27. Bb3 Bb7 $11) 26... b5 27. Bb3 $15 (27. Ba2 Bd5 28. b3 Rf8 $11) 27... Bb7 $11 (27... Bd5 28. Bc2 Bxf3 29. Qxf3 $11) 28. g5 Bg7 29. Bd2 Nd5 $14 (29... Bd5 $5 30. Bb4 Qc6 $11) 30. Rc1 (30. Ne5 Rf8 $14) 30... Qb6 31. Qd3 Rd8 32. h5 gxh5 33. Bc2 Ne7 $18 (33... Kf8 34. Qxh7 b4 $11 (34... Bxd4 $2 35. Nxd4 Qxd4 36. Rd1 $18)) 34. Qxh7+ Kf8 35. Be4 $15 (35. Bb4 $142 Qc7 36. Ne5 $18) 35... e5 $4 $18 (35... Bxe4 $142 36. Qxe4 Bxd4 37. Qxf4+ Kg8 $11) 36. Bb4 Re8 (36... Rd7 37. Nxe5 (37. dxe5 $6 Bxe4 38. Qxe4 Qe6 $18) 37... Bxe5 38. dxe5 $18) 37. Qf5+ (37. dxe5 $6 Bxe4 38. Qxe4 Qe6 $18) 37... Kg8 38. Qh7+ $11 (38. Qd7 $142 Rb8 39. Bc5 $18 (39. Qxe7 $6 Bxe4 40. Bd6 Bxf3 $18) (39. Bxe7 $6 Bxe4 40. Nxe5 Kh7 $18)) 38... Kf8 39. Bxb7 {The mate threat is Bd5} (39. dxe5 $6 Bxe4 40. Qxe4 Qe6 $18) 39... Qxb7 40. Nxe5 Bxe5 41. dxe5 a5