 Qg4 (41. Qf1 Rf8 42. Nxd6 Qg4) 41... Qxg4 42. Nf6+ Kf8 43. Nxg4 Bd2 44. Be4 (44. Nf6 Bxf4 (44... Bxf4 {Dolmatov} 45. Rd7 (45. Nh7+ Ke8 46. Nf6+ Kd8 47. Bh3 Nf5) (45. Nd7+ Ke8 46. Nb6 Ra6 47. Bh3 Nf5 48. Bxf5 gxf5 49. Kf2 $10) 45... Be5)) 44... Ne2+ $1 45. Kf2 Nxf4 46. Bc2 (46. Nf6 Bc3) 46... Re8 47. Nxh6 (47. Nf6 Re2+ (47... Re7 $2 48. Rxe7 Kxe7 49. Ng8+ $10) 48. Kf3 (48. Kf1 {Dolmatov} Bc3 $17) 48... Bc3 49. Bxg6) 47... Re2+ 48. Kf1 (48. Kf3) (48. Kf3 {Dolmatov} Re3+ 49. Kg4 Ne2 (49... Nh5 $2 50. Nf5 $10) 50. Rf7+ (50. Bxg6 Rg3+ 51. Kf5 Nd4+ $19) 50... Ke8 51. Rf3 Rxf3 52. Kxf3 Nd4+ $19) 48... Rh2 49. a5 (49. Ng4) 49... Be3 (49... Rxh6 50. a6 Be3 51. Be4 (51. Be4 {Dolmatov} Rh2 52. a7 Rf2+ $10)) 50. Be4 Ra2 51. Bxg6 $4 (51. Ng4 Bd4) 51... Rf2+ $19 52. Ke1 Ng2+ 53. Kd1 Bxh6 (53... Bxh6 {Dolmatov} 54. a6 Rd2+ 55. Kc1 Ra2+ $19) 0-1

