1. e4 {B48: Sicilian: Taimanov: 5 Nc3 Qc7 6 Be3 a6 without Be2} c5 2. Nc3 e6 3. Nf3 Nc6 4. d4 cxd4 5. Nxd4 Qc7 6. Be3 a6 7. Bd3 b5 8. Nxc6 Qxc6 9. O-O Bb7 10. Re1 Ne7 11. a4 b4 12. Na2 Ng6 13. Bd2 $146 Qb6 14. a5 Qxa5 15. Nxb4 {Clearance to allow a1-a4} Qb6 (15... Bxb4 16. Rxa5) 16. Na2 (16. Nd5 exd5 17. exd5+ Be7 18. Qe2 (18. Bxg6 hxg6 19. Qe2 Qf6) (18. Bg5 Kf8) 18... O-O 19. Bxg6 fxg6 20. Ba5 Qa7 21. Qxe7 Qxf2+ 22. Kh1 Bxd5) 16... Bd6 17. Qh5 Be5 (17... O-O $2 18. e5) ({Less advisable is} 17... Qxb2 18. Bc3 Qb6 19. Bxg7 $16) 18. Nc3 O-O 19. Ra2 (19. Re3 Bf4 20. Rh3 h6) 19... Qc6 20. Qg4 Bc7 21. Rea1 Ne5 (21... f5 $5 22. exf5 Ne5 23. Qe4 Qxe4 24. Bxe4 (24. Nxe4 Nxd3 25. cxd3 Rxf5) 24... d5 25. Bd3 Nxd3 26. cxd3 Rxf5) 22. Qe2 Nxd3 23. cxd3 f5 24. Rf1 (24. Rc1 $5 Qd6 25. f4 e5 $1) 24... fxe4 (24... a5 $1 { a6}) 25. Nxe4 (25. dxe4 a5) 25... Qd5 (25... Qb5 $5) 26. Raa1 Qe5 {Threatening mate... how?} 27. Ng3 (27. f4 Qb5 (27... Qxb2 28. Rab1 Qd4+ 29. Be3 Qd5 30. Rfc1)) 27... Qb5 28. Bc3 Rf4 29. Rae1 (29. Qh5 Bc6 $15) 29... Raf8 {''} 30. Qh5 $2 (30. Be5 Bxe5 31. Qxe5 Qxe5 32. Rxe5 Rb4 33. Re2 Rb8 $17) 30... Rxf2 {'!' Demolition of pawn structure} 31. Rxf2 Rxf2 32. Qe8+ (32. Qxb5 Rxg2+ 33. Kf1 axb5) 32... Rf8 33. Qe7 {Threatening mate: Qxg7} e5 (33... Qb6+ 34. Kh1 e5 35. Bxe5 Bxe5 36. Qxe5 Qf2 37. Rg1) 34. Bxe5 Bxe5 35. Qxe5 Qxd3 36. Rf1 Rxf1+ 37. Nxf1 {[ 8/e] [ 8/e] The mate threat is Qe8} Kf7 (37... Qe4 $5) 38. Qf4+ Ke6 39. Qg4+ Qf5 40. Qd4 (40. Qxg7 Qc5+ 41. Kh1 Qf2 42. Qg8+ (42. Qh6+ Ke5 (42... Kd5 43. Qg5+ Ke4 44. Qg4+ Ke5) 43. Qg7+ Kd6 {Ü 42.g8} 44. Qh6+ Kc7 45. Qc1+ Kb8 $17) 42... Kd6 43. Qg3+ Qxg3 44. Nxg3 Kd5 45. Ne2 Ke4) 40... g5 41. h3 Qe5 {Do you see the mate threat?} 42. Qf2 (42. Qb6+ Bc6 43. Qxa6 Qd4+ (43... Qe4 44. Qa2+ Bd5 45. b3) 44. Kh1 Qxb2) 42... h5 43. Ng3 h4 44. Nf1 (44. Ne2) 44... Qf4 45. Qb6+ Bc6 46. Ne3 (46. Qxa6 Qd4+ 47. Kh2 Qxb2) 46... Qe5 47. Kf2 a5 48. Qb3+ Ke7 49. Qa3+ Kd8 50. Qb3 Kc7 51. Qa3 $138 (51. Qb6+ Kxb6 52. Nc4+ Kc5 53. Nxe5 Kb4 $19) 51... a4 52. Kg1 Qd4 53. Kf2 Kb6 54. Ke2 (54. Kg1 $5 $17) 54... Bb5+ {'-+'} 55. Kf2 (55. Ke1 Kc6 $19) 55... d6 (55... Bd3 $5 56. Qe7 Qxb2+ 57. Kg1 $19) 56. Ke1 Ka5 57. Kf2 {'??' a blunder in a bad position} (57. Nd1 $19) 57... Bd3 $22 58. b4+ Kb5 59. Qc1 a3 {'!' it's all over} 60. Qxa3 Qf4+ 61. Kg1 Qxe3+ 62. Kh1 Qe1+ 63. Kh2 Qg3+ 64. Kg1 Be4 65. Qa5+ Kc4 66. Qa6+ Kb3 $19 {0-1 (66) Macieja,B (2542)-Polgar,J (2671) Batumi 77/175 1999 CI1-130 [Polgar,Judit]} 0-1

