1. e4 {Boensch,U Morovic Fernandez,Ivan Horvath,T} c5 2. Nf3 e6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 d6 6. g4 h6 7. h4 (7. Bg2 {Horvath,T} Nc6 8. h3 Bd7 9. f4 $1 (9. Be3 Ne5 10. Qe2 g5 $1 $13) (9. Ndb5 $2 Qb8 10. Bf4 Ne5) 9... Nxd4 $1 (9... a6 10. Be3 Qb6 $2 11. Qd2 Qxb2 12. Rb1 Qa3 13. Rb3 Qa5 14. Nxc6 Bxc6 15. Bb6 $18) 10. Qxd4 Bc6 11. Be3 Be7 12. O-O-O O-O {Horvath,T-Golod/Berlin/1994} 13. Bf3 $1 {h4;g5}) 7... Nc6 8. Rg1 Nd7 9. g5 hxg5 10. hxg5 (10. Bxg5 Qb6 11. Nb3 a6 12. Qd2 (12. h5 $1 Qc7 13. Qe2 $1 b5 14. O-O-O b4 15. Na4 $1 (15. Nd5 $6 exd5 16. exd5+ Ne7 17. Nd4 $13) 15... a5 16. f4 $16 {Cseshkovsky}) 12... Qc7 13. O-O-O b5 14. Kb1 Nce5 15. Rg3 b4 16. Ne2 f6 17. Be3 Rxh4 $44 {Anand,V-Polgar,J/Monaco Amber blind (01)/1994/1-0 (37)}) 10... g6 {Morovic Fernandez,Ivan: 'N'} (10... Nde5 {Morovic Fernandez,Ivan: 'Ü 33/(319)'} 11. Be3 Bd7 12. Be2 $14 (12. Be2 {Horvath,T} a6 13. f4 Nxd4 14. Qxd4 Nc6 15. Qd2 $14 {Matulovic-Simic/Smederevo/1981})) 11. Be3 a6 12. Qe2 (12. Qd2 $6 {Morovic Fernandez,Ivan} Nde5 13. Be2 Na5 $1) 12... Na5 $5 (12... Qc7) 13. O-O-O b5 14. f4 Qc7 {Morovic Fernandez,Ivan: '?!'} (14... Nc4 {Horvath,T} 15. f5 Nde5 16. fxe6 fxe6 $13) 15. Kb1 Nb6 (15... Nc4 $2 16. Ndxb5 $1 axb5 17. Nxb5 $18) 16. Nb3 {Morovic Fernandez,Ivan: '!'} Nac4 (16... Nxb3 17. axb3 $16 { f2}) 17. Bd4 Rg8 {Morovic Fernandez,Ivan: '??'} (17... e5 18. fxe5 dxe5 19. Nd5 (19. Bxb6 Qxb6 (19... Nxb6 20. Qf3 $16) 20. Rg3 $16) 19... Nxd5 20. exd5 Bf5 21. Bg2 O-O-O $13) (17... Rh7 $8 {Morovic Fernandez,Ivan}) 18. Qh2 {Morovic Fernandez,Ivan: '+-!'} Be7 19. Qh7 Rf8 20. f5 {Morovic Fernandez,Ivan: '!'} (20. Bg7 b4 21. Ne2 Na4 $132) 20... b4 21. fxg6 fxg6 (21... bxc3 22. g7 cxb2 23. gxf8=Q+ Bxf8 24. Bxc4 Nxc4 25. Bxb2 $18 { g6}) 22. Qxg6+ Kd8 23. Ne2 (23. Bxb6 $1 {Morovic Fernandez,Ivan} Nxb6 24. Ne2) 23... e5 {Morovic Fernandez,Ivan: ''} 24. Bxb6 Qxb6 25. Qh5 $18 {-g Morovic Fernandez,Ivan: '!'} a5 26. g6 Be6 27. g7 Re8 28. Bh3 {Morovic Fernandez,Ivan: '!'} Bg8 29. Qf5 Qc6 (29... Qc7 {Morovic Fernandez,Ivan} 30. Nc5 $1) 30. Rd3 {Morovic Fernandez,Ivan: '?'} (30. Ned4 $1 {Horvath,T} exd4 31. Nxd4 Qc8 32. Ne6+ {Morovic Fernandez,Ivan: '!'} Bxe6 (32... Kd7 33. Qb5+ Qc6 34. Nd4+) 33. Qxe6 $18 {Morovic}) 30... Kc7 31. Nd2 {Morovic Fernandez,Ivan: ''} a4 32. Nc1 a3 33. b3 Nxd2+ (33... Nb6 34. Ne2 $18 { c3}) 34. Rxd2 Qc3 35. Qd7+ Kb6 36. Rxd6+ {Morovic Fernandez,Ivan: '!'} Bxd6 (36... Ka5 37. Qa4#) 37. Qxd6+ Ka5 (37... Kb7 38. Nd3 Rad8 39. Nc5+ $18) 38. Nd3 Ra7 (38... Rad8 {Horvath,T} 39. Bd7 Be6 (39... Re6 40. Qd5+ Kb6 41. Bxe6 $1 Rxd5 42. Bxd5 $18 Qd4 43. Rg6+) 40. Qc5+ $1 Qxc5 41. Nxc5 Bxd7 42. Nb7+ {Morovic Fernandez,Ivan: '+-'}) 39. Rg6 Qd4 40. Qc6 $1 { a4} Bxb3 41. axb3 1-0

