1. e4 {Knaak,R Knaak} e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. Bg5 Bb4 5. e5 h6 6. Bd2 Bxc3 7. bxc3 Ne4 8. Qg4 g6 9. Bd3 Nxd2 10. Kxd2 c5 11. Nf3 Nc6 12. Rhb1 Qc7 13. Qf4 $6 {Simply overlooking the advance of the f-pawn?} cxd4 14. cxd4 f5 $10 15. h4 Bd7 16. a4 (16. g4 $5) 16... O-O-O $15 17. Ke2 Kb8 18. Ra3 Rdg8 $1 19. Rh1 Qd8 $17 20. Qd2 g5 21. Qc3 gxh4 22. a5 Rxg2 $2 (22... Ka8) 23. Rb1 Ka8 24. Rab3 $1 Nxa5 $6 25. Ra3 Nc4 26. Bxc4 dxc4 27. d5 $5 Rg4 $6 28. Qb4 $1 Bc8 29. d6 $5 (29. Qc5 $1 a6 30. d6) 29... b6 30. Nd2 Kb8 31. Nxc4 Rh7 32. Qc3 $2 (32. Qa4 $1 { b6} Rb7 33. Rxb6 $1 Qxb6 34. Nxb6 Rxa4 35. Nxa4 $18) 32... Rb7 33. Rab3 Rgg7 34. Qf3 Qg5 $17 35. Ne3 f4 36. Nc4 Qf5 37. Rc3 h3 38. Qxh3 Qe4+ 39. Kd2 Qd4+ 40. Kc1 b5 $4 (40... Bd7) (40... Rg3 $1) 41. Na5 Bd7 $8 42. Nxb7 b4 43. Rxb4 Qxb4 44. Nc5 Rg1+ 45. Kd2 Qd4+ 46. Nd3 Rd1+ 47. Kxd1 Qxc3 48. Qxh6 Ba4 49. Qh8+ Kb7 50. Qh7+ Ka6 51. Ne1 Qa1+ 52. Kd2 Qxe5 53. d7 Qa5+ $8 (53... Qd5+ $2 54. Qd3+ Qxd3+ 55. Nxd3 $18) 54. c3 Qd8 55. Nd3 Kb6 56. Ne5 Kc7 57. Qe4 Bxd7 58. Qxf4 Bb5+ 59. Kc1 Qd6 60. c4 Ba4 1/2-1/2

