1. e4 {Ftacnik,L Hecht} e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. Bg5 dxe4 5. Nxe4 Nbd7 6. Nf3 Be7 7. Nxf6+ Bxf6 8. h4 O-O 9. Bd3 c5 10. c3 cxd4 11. cxd4 e5 $1 12. Qc2 (12. dxe5 Nxe5 13. Nxe5 Qa5+ 14. Kf1 Bxe5 $15) 12... h6 13. Bh7+ Kh8 14. O-O-O Qa5 {The chess theory is often merciless, in the past the defenders tended to achieve good results in a sharp fight. Polgar also fails to impressed with her handling of the position.} (14... hxg5 $2 15. dxe5 (15. hxg5 Bxg5+ 16. Nxg5 Qxg5+ 17. Kb1 Re8 18. Qc4 $13) 15... g4 (15... Be7 16. hxg5 Bxg5+ 17. Nxg5 Qxg5+ 18. Kb1 g6 19. f4 $1 Qxf4 20. Bxg6+ Kg7 21. Rh7+ Kg8 22. Bxf7+ $18) 16. exf6 gxf3 17. fxg7+ Kxg7 18. gxf3 $15) 15. Kb1 (15. Bf5 Qxa2 $15) 15... exd4 16. Bd2 (16. Bxf6 $2 Nxf6 17. Bd3 Be6 $19) (16. Bf5 Nb6 17. Bd3 Be6 $17) (16. g4 {This is Short's suggestion just as he comes in front of the board}) 16... Qc5 17. Bf4 (17. Qxc5 Nxc5 18. Bb4 b6 19. Bc2 Bg4 $17) 17... a5 18. Rhe1 (18. Qxc5 Nxc5 19. Bd6 Kxh7 $1 20. Bxc5 (20. Bxf8 $2 Bf5+ 21. Ka1 Rxf8 $19) 20... Bf5+ 21. Ka1 Rfe8 (21... Bg4 22. Bxf8 Rxf8 23. Rd3 $13) 22. Bxd4 Be7 $15) 18... Ra6 19. Bd3 (19. Bf5 Qxc2+ 20. Kxc2 Ne5 21. Bxe5 Bxf5+ 22. Kd2 Bg4 $19) 19... Qxc2+ 20. Bxc2 (20. Kxc2 Rc6+ 21. Kd2 Nc5 22. Bb5 Rb6 23. a4 Bf5 $19) 20... Nc5 21. Ne5 $5 {[%mdl 4096] White believes in the activity of the pieces, but Kortschnoj will work his way to excellent prospects in the endgame.} (21. Nxd4 $5 Bxh4 22. g3 Bf6 23. Be5 $15) 21... Kg8 (21... Bxh4 $5 22. g3 Bf6 23. Rxd4 Ne6 24. Rde4 Nxf4 25. Rxf4 Re6 $17) 22. Bg3 (22. Rxd4 Ne6 (22... Bxh4 23. Be3 $1 Bf6 24. Rd5 $11) 23. Rde4 Nxf4 24. Rxf4 Re8 $15) 22... Rd8 23. Nd3 (23. f4 b5 24. Bf2 Rad6 $17) 23... Rc6 24. Re2 (24. Nxc5 Rxc5 25. Bd3 Be6 $17) 24... Bf5 25. Nxc5 Rxc5 26. Bxf5 Rxf5 27. Kc2 (27. Rd3 Rc5 28. Rc2 Rdc8 29. Rxc5 Rxc5 $17) 27... Rc5+ 28. Kd3 a4 29. Rde1 (29. Ree1 Rdc8 $17) 29... Kh7 30. Re8 (30. Be5 Bxh4 31. g3 (31. Bxd4 $2 Bf6 32. Re4 Rcd5 $19) 31... Bg5 32. f4 f6 33. fxg5 (33. Bxd4 Rcd5 34. Re4 f5 $19) 33... hxg5 34. Bxd4 Rcd5 35. Re4 f5 $19) 30... Rxe8 31. Rxe8 Rb5 32. Re2 (32. Kc2 d3+ 33. Kxd3 Rxb2 34. Rb8 b5 35. h5 a3 $19) 32... Kg6 $1 {It is crucial to improve the location of the king in order to keep chances for the success alive.} 33. f3 (33. Rc2 Kf5 34. f3 Ke6 $17) 33... Rc5 34. Bf2 (34. Rc2 Rxc2 35. Kxc2 Kf5 36. Kd3 Ke6 37. Ke4 g6 38. Bf2 Kd6 39. Bxd4 Bxh4 $17) 34... Rc1 35. Re1 (35. Rd2 Rh1 36. g3 Rh2 37. Bg1 Rh3 38. Bf2 Be5 $1 $19) 35... Rxe1 36. Bxe1 {Hecht: 'L + MB'} Kf5 37. Bf2 (37. Bd2 Ke5 (37... Bxh4 38. Kxd4 Bf6+ 39. Kc5 Bxb2 40. Kb6 h5 41. Kxb7 h4 42. Kb6 a3 43. Kc5 g5 $19) 38. g3 Kd5 $19) (37. h5 $5 {Hecht} Kg5 38. Ke4 Be7 (38... Kxh5 $140 $2 {Hecht} 39. Kf5 $1 {[%csl Rf6][%cal Rg2g4]}) 39. b3 axb3 40. axb3 Kxh5 41. Kxd4 Kg6 42. Ke5 h5 $17) 37... Kf4 $1 38. b3 (38. Bxd4 Bxd4 39. Kxd4 Kg3 $19) 38... axb3 39. axb3 h5 $1 {White pawn will remain fixed on the h4 and will become grateful object of an attack.} 40. Ke2 Ke5 41. Kd3 Kd5 42. Be1 (42. f4 {Hecht} g6 43. g3 Bg7 44. Bg1 f5 45. Bf2 Kc5 46. Be1 Bf6 47. Bd2 Bd8 48. Be1 Bb6 49. Bd2 Kb5 50. Be1 Ba5 51. Bf2 Bc3 $19 {Nach dem Nehmen auf d4 ist das Bauernendspiel um ein Tempo verloren. Und} 52. Bg1 Kb4 53. Kc2 b5 54. Bf2 d3+ 55. Kxd3 Kxb3 {scheidet auch aus.}) 42... g6 43. Bf2 Be5 44. Be1 f5 45. Bf2 Kc5 46. Be1 Bh2 47. g3 (47. Bf2 {Hecht} Kb4 48. Kxd4 b5 49. Kd5 Kxb3 50. Ke6 Kc4 51. Kf6 b4 52. Be3 Kd3 53. Bc5 b3 54. Ba3 Kc2 55. Kxg6 Bd6 $19) 47... Bg1 48. Ke2 Be3 49. Kd3 Kd5 50. Ke2 (50. f4 {Hecht} b5 51. b4 Bg1 $22) 50... f4 $1 51. gxf4 Bxf4 52. Bf2 g5 {Hecht: 'mit Bildung eines entfernten Freibauern'} 53. Kd3 gxh4 54. Bxh4 Be5 55. Bf2 Bf6 56. Bg3 h4 57. Bh2 Be5 0-1

