e6 47. Kh2 Kf5 48. Rb5 Ke5 49. g4 Ke6 50. Kg3 Bh1 51. Kf4 Bg2 52. g5 $1 fxg5+ {'?'} (52... Bc6 {is just about the only chance} 53. Rb8 Kf7 $14) 53. Rxg5 {'+-'} (53. Kxg5 $6 Kf7 $14) (53. hxg5 $6 Bc6 54. Rb8 Bh1 $14) 53... Bh1 54. Rxg7 Kf6 55. Rg1 Bd5 56. h5 Nc7 1-0

