. Qd6 Qc8 $17) 37. Nf4 {'='} Qd8 38. Nxg6+ Kh7 39. Nxe5 $2 (39. Nf4 $1 Qd1+ 40. Qg1 Qxc2 (40... Qg4 41. Nh3 $14) 41. Nxh5 $14) 39... Nxe5 {The knight likes it on e5} 40. h3 {Consolidates g4} (40. Qg1 $6 Qd7 41. Rb6 Ng4) (40. Qd5 Qg5) 40... Qd1+ 41. Qg1 (41. Kh2 Qd2 $1 {'='}) 41... Qd7 (41... Qxc2 $6 42. Qe3) 42. Rb6 Nf3 $1 {Demolishes the pawn shield} 43. Qf1 (43. gxf3 $2 {Theme: Deflection from h3} Qxh3+ 44. Qh2 Qf1+ 45. Qg1 Qxg1+ 46. Kxg1 Bd4+ $19) 43... Qc7 {Threatening mate... how?} 44. Qxf3 Qxb6 45. Qxh5+ Kg8 46. Qd5+ Kf8 47. b3 Qf6 (47... Qc7 48. Qc4 Qd7 49. Qc5+ Ke8 50. Qh5+ Ke7 51. Qc5+ Kf6 52. g4 $11) 48. Kg1 (48. Qf5 Ke7 49. Qxf6+ Kxf6 $14) 48... Qb6+ 49. Kf1 Ke7 50. Ke2 Qc7 51. c4 b6 1/2-1/2

