se. His future problem might have been caused by the time-trouble factor''} 22. h3 Re7 23. Ra2 Kf7 $6 {ChessCalisthenics: 'Huzman: '?!''} 24. Rb2 Nc4 25. Bxc4 dxc4 26. d5 $1 {ChessCalisthenics: 'Huzman: '!''} bxc5 $2 {[%mdl 16384] ChessCalisthenics: 'Huzman: '?'' Now, his  being let into the 7th rank, White starts enjoying some significant tactical opportunities ChessCalisthenics: 'Huzman: 'Now, his  being let into the 7th rank, White starts enjoying some significant tactical opportunities''} (26... Bd3 $5 {ChessCalisthenics: 'Huzman'} 27. d6 cxd6 28. cxd6 Re4 29. Bg3 f5 30. f3 Re6 $11) 27. Rb7 Qc8 $2 {ChessCalisthenics: 'Huzman: '?''} (27... Be4 $5 {ChessCalisthenics: 'Huzman'} 28. Rxa7 Qxd5 29. Qxd5+ Bxd5 30. Be3 $14) 28. Rxa7 Qb8 29. d6 $1 {ChessCalisthenics: 'Huzman: '!''} Qxa7 $2 (29... cxd6 {ChessCalisthenics: '!?'} 30. Qd5+ {ChessCalisthenics: 'Huzman'} (30. Qh5+ {ChessCalisthenics} Kf8 31. Bxd6 Qxa7 32. Qxf5 Kg8 33. Bxe7 Qxe7 $14) 30... Be6 31. Qh5+ Kf8 32. Ra6 Qc8 33. Rb6 $16 Kg8 34. Bxd6 Bf7 35. Qxc5 $16) 30. Qh5+ Bg6 31. Qd5+ Kf8 32. dxe7+ Kxe7 33. Be3 $1 $18 {ChessCalisthenics: 'Huzman: '+-!''} Qa6 34. Bxc5+ Ke8 35. Qg8+ Kd7 36. Qxg7+ Kc8 37. h4 Qc6 38. Qg8+ Kb7 39. Qxc4 Bc2 40. Qb4+ Kc8 41. Bd4 f5 42. Qe7 h6 43. f3 Kb7 44. Kh2 Bd3 45. Be5 Bc4 46. Qf6 Qxf6 47. Bxf6 h5 48. g4 fxg4 49. fxg4 hxg4 50. Kg3 1-0

