. d6) 44. Ke1 Kf3 (44... h4 45. d6 h3 $140 46. Rh8) 45. d6 Re2+ $5 (45... h4 46. Re8 $1 Rb1+ 47. Kd2 Rb6 $140 $6 48. Re3+ $1 Kg2 $8 49. d7 Rd6+ 50. Rd3 Rxd7 51. Rxd7 h3 $11) (45... f5 46. Rf8 $11) 46. Kf1 Ra2 47. Kg1 $6 (47. Ke1 $11) 47... h4 48. Rb8 (48. Rf8 Ra7 49. Rd8 $15) 48... Rd2 $2 (48... Rg2+ $1 49. Kh1 (49. Kf1 Rd2 50. Rb3+ Kg4 51. Rb4+ Kg5 52. Rb6 f5 $17 (52... h3 53. Kg1 f5 $17)) 49... Rd2 $17 50. Rf8 $140 Kg3 51. Rg8+ Kh3 52. Kg1 Rxd6) 49. Rf8 Rxd6 1/2-1/2

