{B53: Sicilian: 2...d6: Lines with Qxd4} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Qxd4 Nc6 5. Bb5 e6 6. Be3 $146 (6. O-O Nge7 7. c4 a6 8. Bxc6+ Nxc6 9. Qd3 Be7 10. Nc3 O-O 11. Rd1 Qc7 12. Be3 b6 13. Rac1 Ne5 14. Nxe5 dxe5 15. Na4 Rb8 16. c5 b5 17. Nb6 Rd8 18. Nxc8 Rxd3 19. Nxe7+ Kf8 20. Rxd3 Kxe7 {Vasiukov,E-Sakharov,Y/ Riga 1968/MCD/1-0 (41)}) (6. Bg5 Qc7 7. Nc3 Bd7 8. Bxc6 bxc6 9. O-O-O f6 10. Be3 Qb7 11. Rhe1 Ne7 12. Nd2 Nc8 13. f4 Be7 14. e5 c5 15. Qd3 fxe5 16. Nc4 d5 17. Nxe5 O-O 18. g4 Be8 19. Bd2 Rb8 20. b3 Nd6 {Belozerov,A (2450)-Kruppa,Y (2535)/St Petersburg 1997/CBM 062/1-0 (41)}) 6... Bd7 7. Qd2 Nf6 8. Nc3 a6 9. Bd3 b5 10. O-O Be7 11. a4 b4 12. Ne2 d5 13. Ng3 dxe4 14. Nxe4 Nd5 15. Bc5 O-O 16. Bc4 Bc8 17. Rad1 Bxc5 18. Nxc5 Nce7 19. Qe2 a5 (19... Qc7 20. Bxd5 (20. Nxa6 $143 Qd6 $17) 20... Nxd5 21. Qc4 $11) 20. Bb5 Qc7 21. Nb3 Bb7 22. Qe5 Qxc2 23. Nfd4 Qc7 (23... Qxb2 $143 24. Rd2 Ng6 25. Qe4 $16) 24. Qg5 Qf4 25. Qh5 Nf6 26. Qh3 Rfd8 (26... Bd5 $17) 27. Nxe6 fxe6 28. Qxe6+ Kf8 29. Rfe1 Rxd1 $4 (29... Ne4 $142 30. Qb6 Rxd1 31. Rxd1 Bd5 32. Nxa5 Rxa5 $19) 30. Qxe7+ Kg8 31. Qe6+ Kh8 32. Rxd1 h6 (32... Ng4 $142 33. Rd2 Qxh2+ 34. Kf1 Qxg2+ 35. Ke1 Qg1+ 36. Ke2 Qxf2+ 37. Kd3 Qg3+ 38. Kc2 Ne3+ 39. Kb1 Qe1+ 40. Ka2 Qxd2 41. Nxd2 Bd5+ 42. Qxd5 Nxd5 $19) 33. Qe7 Bd5 34. Nd4 Bxg2 (34... Ng4 $142 $5 35. Qh4 Rf8 $11) 35. Qxg7+ Kxg7 36. Ne6+ Kf7 37. Nxf4 Bf3 38. Bc4+ Ke7 $4 (38... Kg7 $5 39. Rd3 Be4 40. Rg3+ Kh7 $16) 39. Re1+ Kd7 40. Bb5+ Kc7 (40... Kc8 41. Re7 Bb7 42. Bd3 $18) 41. Re7+ Kd8 $4 (41... Kb8 $142 42. Rf7 Ng4 $18) 42. Rf7 Rc8 (42... Kc8 $18) 43. Ne6# 1-0

