 Ra1 Re8 $14 {/}) 24... Nxd5 25. cxd5 cxb4 26. Rxa7 Qc7 27. Raa1 f5 $1 28. e5 Qc4 29. Rad1 Ba4 30. Rd2 (30. Rd4 $1 Qb3 31. Rd2 $16) 30... Bc2 $1 {Black uses any chance to get counterplay.} 31. h4 (31. Ng5 $1 b3 32. Qh4 h6 33. Ne6 $16) 31... Be4 $13 32. Rd4 (32. h5 $5 Bxd5 (32... gxh5 33. exd6 Bxf3 34. Rxe8 Rxe8 35. Qxf3 Rd8 36. Re2 $16) 33. hxg6 hxg6 34. Ng5 dxe5 35. Qh3 Rf6 36. Bd4 $40) 32... Qb3 $6 (32... Qc7 $1 33. h5 gxh5 (33... Bxf3 34. Qxf3 dxe5 35. d6 Qf7 36. hxg6 hxg6 37. fxe5 Bxe5 38. Rd5 Bf6 39. Rxe8 Rxe8 40. d7 $16) 34. Rdxe4 fxe4 35. Rxe4 Kh8 $13) 33. Ng5 (33. Nd2 $1 Qxb2 (33... Qxg3 34. Bxg3 dxe5 35. fxe5 Bxe5 36. Bxe5 Rxe5 37. Nxe4 fxe4 38. Rexe4 Rxe4 39. Rxe4 $16) 34. Nc4 $18) 33... Qxb2 34. Nxe4 (34. Ne6 Rf7 $13) 34... fxe4 35. Rdxe4 dxe5 36. Qd3 (36. fxe5 Bxe5 37. Rxe5 Rxe5 38. Rxe5 Rxf2 39. Re8+ Rf8 40. Rxf8+ Kxf8 $14) 36... Qc3 (36... Rc8 37. d6 Rc2 38. R4e2 (38. Rxb4 Qxb4 39. Qxc2 Qxf4 $11) 38... Rxe2 39. Qc4+ Rf7 40. Rxe2 Qb1+ 41. Re1 Qf5 $132) 37. Qb5 b3 (37... Qd2 38. Bc5 Qxd5 39. Rxb4 Qd2 40. Ree4 $16) 38. R4e3 $2 {White misses the last chance to get an advantage.} (38. d6 $5 b2 39. Bd4 $16) (38. Bc5 $1 Rd8 39. Bxf8 Bxf8 40. fxe5 Qc5+ 41. Qxc5 Bxc5+ 42. Kf1 Rxd5 43. e6 $16) 38... Qc2 39. Rxb3 Rd8 40. Bb6 Qd2 (40... Rxf4 $6 41. Bxd8 Qf2+ 42. Kh2 Qxe1 43. Bg5 (43. d6 Rxh4+ 44. Bxh4 Qxh4+ 45. Rh3 (45. Kg1 Qd4+ $11) 45... Qf4+ $11) 43... Bf8 44. Qd7 $36) 41. Rbb1 Rxd5 {½-½ (41) Polgar,J (2735)-Morozevich,A (2707) San Luis 2005 CBM 110 [Huzman,Alexander]} (41... Rxd5 42. Qb3 Qd3 43. Qxd3 Rxd3 44. fxe5 Re8 $11) *

