xe2 Ne4 $36 { g5}) 22... Qf5 23. f4 { Topalov,Veselin: 'Polgar,J: '''} Qd3 $2 (23... g5 $5) (23... g5 $5 {Ambroz × b1 Topalov,Veselin: 'Polgar,J: 'Ambroz × b1''} 24. fxg5 Ng4 25. Rc1 e5 $5 26. Qb3 $140 exd4 27. Qxa2 d3 28. Rg2 Ne3 $44) (23... Ng4 {Ambroz} 24. Qe1 $13) (23... h5 $17) 24. Rf2 Rfa8 25. Qe1 Qf5 26. Rd1 Qg4 27. Kg2 (27. Bxf6 {Ambroz} gxf6 28. Ne4 dxe4 (28... Be7 $5) 29. Rxa2 Rxa2 (29... Bc5+ 30. Rf2 Bxf2+ (30... Ra2 31. Rd4) 31. Kxf2 Qh5) 30. Rxd6 Qh5 $17) 27... Nh5 28. Kh1 Rc2 29. Qe2 (29. Ne4 $5 Rxf2 30. Nxf2 (30. Nxf2 {Ambroz} Qf5 31. Qe2 Nf6 32. Re1 $14)) 29... Qh3 30. Qe3 Nf6 31. Re1 {} Bf8 (31... Raa2 $5 32. Qxe6+ (32. Bxf6 gxf6 $17) 32... Qxe6 33. Rxe6 Ba3 $15 (33... Bf8 {Ambroz} 34. Ree2 Ne4 35. Rxe4 dxe4 36. Nxe4 Rxf2 37. Nxf2 Ra5 $1 $17 38. b6 (38. c4 Ra4) 38... Bc5 $19)) 32. Bxf6 gxf6 33. Ne4 $1 Raa2 (33... Rxf2 34. Nxf2 $16) 34. Nxf6+ Kh8 $2 (34... Kf7 35. Nxh7 $1) (34... Kg7 35. Ne8+ Kf7 36. f5 $18) 35. Qe5 $1 $18 Rxf2 36. Ng4+ Kg8 37. Qxe6+ {Topalov,Veselin: '1-0 (37) Polgar,J (2630)-Topalov,V (2640) Dos Hermanas 1994 CBM 41 [Polgar,J]'} (37. Qxe6+ Kh8 (37... Kg7 38. Qe5+ Kg8 39. Qxd5+ Kg7 40. Nxf2) 38. Qe5+ Kg8 39. Qxd5+ Kh8 40. Nxf2 $18) 1-0

