Tom: 'Polgar,Judit'} 28. Rxb5 Rxd5 29. Rxd5 Nxd5 30. Qxd5 Qxc2 31. Qxe5 Qxd2 32. Qe8+ Kh7 33. Qxf7 Qc2) (27... Rb8 $5 {Wedberg,Tom: 'Polgar,Judit: '!?''}) 28. Bd1 $14 {Wedberg,Tom: 'Polgar,Judit: '''} Qc4 $4 (28... Ra8 {Wedberg,Tom: 'Polgar,Judit'} 29. Rxb5 Ra1 30. Be3 Ng4 $44) 29. Rc1 $1 $18 {Wedberg: 'Judit never misses shots like this one.'} Qxc1 (29... Qxd3 30. Rxc8+ Ne8 {Wedberg,Tom: 'Polgar,Judit'} (30... Kh7 {Wedberg} 31. Bc2 $18) 31. Bc2 $1) 30. Bxc1 Rxc1 31. d6 Nd7 (31... Rc3 {Wedberg,Tom: 'Polgar,Judit'} 32. Qd2 Rc8 33. f4 Ba1 34. Kg2 g6 35. d7 Rd8 36. Qa5) 32. Kg2 Bf6 33. Bc2 $1 {Wedberg,Tom: 'Polgar,Judit: '!''} g6 (33... Nf8 {Wedberg,Tom: 'Polgar,Judit'} 34. Bb3 {f7 Wedberg,Tom: '×f7'}) 34. Bb3 Kg7 (34... Ne5 {Wedberg,Tom: 'Polgar,Judit'} 35. Qd5 Rc8 36. Qxb5) 35. Qd5 1-0

