1. e4 {Wedberg Wedberg} e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 Nf6 4. O-O Bc5 5. c3 O-O 6. d4 Bb6 7. Re1 d6 8. h3 Qe7 (8... Ne7 {is the main alternative.}) 9. Na3 {Not an unusual path for the b1-, but the move is a novelty in this position.} (9. Bxc6 bxc6 10. dxe5 dxe5 11. Na3 Nh5 12. Nc4 Qc5 13. Nxb6 axb6 14. Nh4 Nf4 $13 {0-1 Barczay,L-Honfi,K/Budapest 1955/MCD (33)}) (9. a4 a5 (9... a6 10. Bxc6 bxc6 11. a5 Ba7 12. dxe5 dxe5 13. Na3 Rd8 14. Qe2 Ne8 15. Be3 $14 {1-0 Oltra Caurin,R-Mendoza,J/Valencia 1992/EXT 98 (41)}) 10. Bg5 (10. Qc2 exd4 11. Bxc6 d3 12. Qxd3 bxc6 13. Bg5 Ba6 14. Qc2 Qe6 $11 {1-0 Hellsten,J-Dworakowski,L/Hallsberg 1993/EXT 97 (39)}) 10... h6 11. Bh4 Kh8 12. Na3 g5 13. Bxc6 bxc6 14. dxe5 gxh4 15. exf6 $14 {½-½ Bednarski,J-Van Geet,D/Amsterdam 1970/MCD (44)}) (9. d5 Nd8 10. Bd3 Nh5 11. g4 Nf6 12. Na3 h5 $132 {0-1 Alexander,C-O'Kelly de Galway,A/Hilversum 1947/MCD (45)}) 9... Bd7 10. Bg5 h6 11. Bxf6 Qxf6 12. Nc4 Rad8 13. a4 exd4 14. Nxb6 (14. a5 Nxa5 15. Rxa5 Bxa5 16. Bxd7 Rxd7 17. Nxa5 dxc3 $15) 14... axb6 15. cxd4 Nb4 16. Qd2 c5 17. Bxd7 Rxd7 18. a5 $6 (18. Rad1 $14) 18... bxa5 19. dxc5 Nc6 $2 {This gives the game away.} (19... Qe7 $1 $13 {stops White´s centre attack.}) 20. e5 $1 $18 Qf5 21. cxd6 Re8 22. Qc3 f6 23. exf6 Rxe1+ 24. Qxe1 Rxd6 25. Qe8+ Kh7 26. fxg7 Kxg7 27. Re1 Qf6 28. Re4 1-0

