Kxb2 Kg3 50. Bf5 Kxh3 51. f4 (51. Kc2 Kg3 52. Be4 h3 53. f4 gxf4 $19) 51... Kg2 52. fxg5 fxg5 53. Be4+ Kg1 0-1

