1. d4 {Petursson Hecht} Nf6 2. Nf3 g6 3. g3 Bg7 4. Bg2 O-O 5. O-O d6 6. Nc3 Nbd7 7. e4 e5 8. h3 Re8 9. Re1 exd4 10. Nxd4 Nc5 11. Nb3 Nfd7 12. Bf4 a5 13. Qd2 Ne6 14. Bh6 Bh8 15. Be3 Ne5 16. Qe2 a4 17. Nd4 b6 18. b3 Ra5 19. Rad1 axb3 20. axb3 Ba6 21. Qd2 Nxd4 22. Bxd4 Nd3 23. Bxh8 Nxe1 24. Qd4 f6 25. Bxf6 Nxc2 26. Bxd8 Nxd4 27. Bxc7 Nb5 28. Nxb5 Bxb5 29. Rxd6 Ra1+ 30. Kh2 Bf1 31. Bxb6 Bxg2 32. Kxg2 Rxe4 { Hecht Mit zwei Bauern für die Qualität sucht Salov den Gewinn. Er bringt deshalb seinen König zum Damenflügel, weil sonst der b-Bauer nicht voranzubringen ist. Eine taktische Gemeinheit verwandelt abrupt seine Gewinnträume in einen realen Verlust. Eine Medaille für den taktischen Patzer.} 33. Bc5 $14 Rb1 34. Rb6 (34. b4 {Hecht} Rexb4 $11) 34... Ree1 35. h4 Re4 36. Rb8+ Kf7 37. Rb7+ Kg8 38. Kf3 Re5 39. Rb8+ Kf7 40. Rb7+ Ke6 41. Be3 Rf5+ 42. Ke4 Re5+ 43. Kd3 Rd1+ 44. Kc4 Re4+ 45. Kb5 Rd7 46. Rb6+ Kd5 47. b4 Ree7 48. Ra6 Rb7+ 49. Ka5 Rec7 50. Ra8 $2 (50. Bc5 $11) 50... Kc4 51. Bc5 {[%tqu "En","White has overpressed to win this ending. Can you find a win for BLACK here?","You want to force his king back to a4. So what do you need to do first?","Tak the square a6 away from his king and create a deadly threat!","c7c6","",10]} Rc6 $1 $19 { Weiß hat gar nichts erreicht, außer daß er seinen König schlecht gestellt hat. Schwarz "droht" im Remissinne bereits mit Txc5.} 52. Bf8 (52. g4 Rb5+ 53. Ka4 Rcxc5 54. bxc5 Rb1 55. Ka5 Ra1+ 56. Kb6 Rxa8 57. c6 Kd5 58. c7 Ke4 59. Kb7 Rf8 60. c8=Q Rxc8 61. Kxc8 Kf3 62. g5 Kxf2 63. Kd7 Kg3 $19) (52. f4 h5 $22 53. Ka4 Rxc5 54. bxc5 Rb1 55. Ka5 Ra1+ 56. Kb6 Rxa8 57. c6 Kd5 58. c7 Ke4 59. Kb7 Rf8 60. c8=Q Rxc8 61. Kxc8 Kf3 62. Kd7 Kxg3 63. Ke6 Kxf4 64. Kf6 Kg4 65. Kxg6 Kxh4 66. Kf5 Kg3 $19) 52... Rb5+ 53. Ka4 Rb8 ({[%tqu "En","Now finish him off!","Distract his rook from the defence of the mate on a6","Attack his rook and bishop simultaneously","b5b8","GOOD!   Salov resigns!  Now you understand why Judit is  smiling on her picture in the players library.",7]} 53... Rb8 $1 {WHITE RESIGNS because of} 54. Rxb8 Ra6#) 0-1

