1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 a6 6. Be2 e5 7. Nb3 Be7 8. O-O O-O 9. Be3 Be6 10. Qd2 Nbd7 11. a4 Rc8 12. a5 Qc7 13. Rfd1 Rfd8 14. Qe1 Qc6 15. Bf3 h6 (15... Bc4 {Ü 40/315}) 16. Nc1 Qc7 $146 (16... Ng4 17. Nd5 Bh4 18. Bxg4 Bxg4 19. Rd2 Re8 20. Na2 Bd8 21. Nab4 Qb5 22. b3 $36) (16... Ra8 17. Nd3 b5) 17. Nd3 {[ b4-d5]} d5 $5 18. exd5 Bf5 19. Bb6 (19. Ra4 $5 Bd6 20. h3 Re8 21. Be2 e4 22. Nc1 Ne5 $44 23. Nb3 $140 Qd7 $1 { 24...h3, 24...c3}) 19... Nxb6 20. axb6 Qxb6 21. Qxe5 Bxd3 22. Na4 (22. Rxd3 Qxb2 23. Ra2 Qb6) 22... Qb4 (22... Qd6 $1 23. Qxd6 Bxd6 24. cxd3 Rc2 25. Rac1 Rdc8 26. Rxc2 Rxc2 $15) 23. cxd3 Re8 24. Qe2 Bd6 25. Qd2 Qd4 26. Nc3 Bb4 27. Ne2 Qb6 (27... Qc5 28. Qf4 Nxd5 29. Qf5) 28. Nc3 Red8 29. d4 Rc7 30. Qd3 Rdc8 31. Ne2 Bd6 32. b3 Rc2 33. Rac1 $6 (33. h3 $5) 33... Rxc1 34. Rxc1 Rxc1+ 35. Nxc1 Qa5 (35... Qc7 36. Qc4 Bxh2+ 37. Kf1 Bd6 38. Qxc7 Bxc7 39. d6 Bxd6 40. Bxb7 $11) 36. Qd1 Qa1 37. g3 Ba3 38. Nd3 Qxd4 39. Nf4 $2 (39. Qc2 $1 Bd6 (39... Nxd5 40. Qc8+ Bf8 41. Qxb7 $11) 40. Nc1 { e2}) 39... Qxd1+ 40. Bxd1 Bd6 41. Nd3 (41. Bf3 Bxf4 42. gxf4 Ne8) 41... b5 42. Bf3 a5 43. Kf1 (43. Nb2 Be5 44. Nd3 a4) 43... a4 44. bxa4 bxa4 45. Bd1 (45. Ke2 a3 46. Nc1 Bc5 $17) 45... a3 46. Bb3 Ne4 47. Kg2 $2 (47. Ke1 $8 g5 $1 (47... Nc3 48. Nc1 Bb4 49. Kf1) 48. f3 Nc3 49. Nc1 Nb5 50. Kd2 Nd4 51. Bd1 h5 52. Kd3 Nf5 53. Ke4 Ne7 $17) 47... g5 48. f3 Nc3 49. Nc1 Kg7 (49... f5 $5) 50. Na2 Nb5 51. Bc4 Nd4 52. Kf2 Bc5 (52... Nf5 $5) 53. Ke3 f5 (53... Nf5+ 54. Kd3 Bg1 55. g4 Nd6 56. h3 Kf6) 54. g4 (54. Nc3 Kf6) 54... Kf6 55. gxf5 Kxf5 56. d6 (56. Nc3 Nb5+ 57. Kd3 Nxc3 58. Kxc3 Kf4 $19) 56... Ne6+ 57. Kd3 Bxd6 58. Nc3 Nf4+ (58... Bxh2 59. Nb5 Nf4+ 60. Kd2 h5 61. Nxa3 h4 62. Nc2 h3 63. Ne3+ Kg6 64. Nf1 Bg1 65. Ke1 h2 66. Ng3) 59. Kc2 Ng2 60. Kb3 Ne1 (60... Bxh2 { e1}) 61. Bd5 (61. Be2 h5) 61... Kf4 62. Ne4 Bf8 63. Nd2 Nd3 (63... Ke3 64. Nf1+ Kd4 65. Ba8 Nd3 $19) 64. Kc3 Nc1 (64... Nb4 65. Ba8 a2 66. Nb3 Ke3) 65. Nb3 a2 66. Na1 $8 Ne2+ (66... Bg7+ $2 67. Kd2 Bxa1