1. d4 {Huzman,Alexander Huzman,Alexander Huzman,Alexander Huzman,Alexander: 'Huzman' Huzman,Alexander Huzman,Alexander Huzman,Alexander Huzman,Alexander: 'Huzman' E92: King's Indian: Classical: 6 Be2 e5: 7 dxe5, 7 Be3 and Petrosian System without 7...Nbd7} Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. e4 d6 5. Be2 O-O 6. Nf3 e5 7. d5 a5 8. Bg5 Na6 9. O-O Qe8 10. Nd2 Bd7 11. Rb1 h6 (11... h5 12. Re1 Nh7 13. Be3 Bf6 14. Bh6 Bg7 15. Be3 Bf6 16. a3 Bg5 17. Bxg5 Nxg5 18. b4 axb4 19. axb4 Qe7 20. Qc1 $14 {1-0 Babula,V-Reschke,S/BL 1998 (41)}) 12. Be3 Nh7 (12... Qc8 13. f3 Nh5 14. g3 f5 15. f4 exf4 16. gxf4 fxe4 17. Ndxe4 Bf5 18. Bxh5 gxh5 19. Bd4 Qe8 20. Bxg7 Qg6+ 21. Kf2 Kxg7 22. Rg1 Bg4 23. Qd4+ Kh7 24. Ng3 Nc5 25. h3 Rxf4+ {0-1 Ladanyi,T-Farago,S/Budapest 1997/EXP 59 (25)}) 13. b3 f5 14. f3 (14. exf5 gxf5 15. f3 Qg6 16. Bd3 e4 $17 {0-1 Klimenko,S-Uchitel,S/St.Petersburg 1996/EXP 56 (50)}) 14... Nf6 15. a3 {Consolidates b4} Nc5 16. b4 axb4 17. axb4 Na4 $11 18. Nxa4 (18. Qc2 $5 Nxc3 (18... f4 19. Bf2 g5 20. Nb5 {[%csl Ra4]}) 19. Qxc3 f4 (19... Nh5 $5 20. Rfe1 Nf4 21. Bf1 g5 $132) 20. Bf2 g5 $132) 18... Rxa4 19. c5 {The thematic attack} Bb5 $1 20. Re1 (20. Bc4 $1 fxe4 (20... Ra3 21. Qe2) (20... Bxc4 21. Nxc4 fxe4 22. cxd6 b5 (22... exf3 23. dxc7 fxg2 24. Re1 $16)) 21. fxe4 Bxc4 22. Nxc4 Nxe4 23. Qd3 Nf6 24. cxd6 cxd6 (24... b5 25. Nb2 Rxb4 26. dxc7 $16) (24... e4 25. Qd2 cxd6 26. Bxh6 $13) 25. Nxd6 Qd7 26. Ne4 $14) 20... Ra3 21. Bxb5 Qxb5 22. Qe2 (22. Qc2 Rfa8 $11) 22... Qxe2 $1 23. Rxe2 fxe4 (23... Ra2 24. Kf1 $11) 24. fxe4 Ng4 25. Rbe1 (25. Nb3 Nxe3 (25... Rfa8 26. Bd2 Nf6 $11) 26. Rxe3 Ra2 $36) (25. Bf2 Ra2 (25... Nxf2 26. Rxf2 Rxf2 27. Kxf2 Ra2 28. Ke3 Bf8 29. Kd3 $11) 26. Bg3 h5 27. h3 Nf6 $36) 25... Ra4 $1 {''} ({Less advisable is} 25... Rxe3 26. Rxe3 Nxe3 27. Rxe3 $14) 26. cxd6 (26. Rb1 Ra2 $17) 26... cxd6 (26... Nxe3 $2 {is nothing because of} 27. dxc7 (27. Rxe3 $6 cxd6 28. Rg3 Kh7 $11) 27... Rxb4 28. Rxe3 $18) 27. Bb6 (27. b5 Nxe3 28. Rxe3 Rc8 $17) 27... Rc8 $1 $17 {White`s activity on Queen`s flank backfired and Judit got control of a and c lines.} 28. Ba5 {'?'} (28. Rb1 Rc2 $17 {''}) 28... h5 (28... Nf6 $5 29. Re3 Ra2 $19) 29. Rf1 (29. Nf3 Bh6 30. h3 Nf6 $17) 29... Bh6 (29... Rc2 $5) 30. h3 Ne3 31. Rfe1 (31. Rf6 Ra1+ 32. Kh2 Rc2 33. Rxg6+ Kh7 34. Rxh6+ (34. Rxd6 Nc4 $17 {-+}) 34... Kxh6 35. Rxe3 Rxd2 $17 {-+}) (31. Rb1 $5 $17) 31... Nc2 {'-+'} 32. Rc1 Kg7 (32... Ra3 33. Kh1 $19) 33. Kh1 h4 $1 34. Rf1 (34. Rd1 Bf4 $19) 34... Bf4 (34... Be3 $1 35. Bd8 (35. Rc1 $19 Nd4 $1 $19) 35... Rxd8 36. Nc4 Nd4 37. Rxe3 Rxb4) (34... Nd4 $5 35. Ref2 Ra2 36. Rf7+ Kg8 37. R7f6 Rxd2 38. Rxg6+ Bg7 39. b5 $19) 35. Nf3 g5 (35... Ne3 36. Rb1 Nc4 37. Rc2 $19) 36. Bd8 {'?'} (36. Rb1 {'-+!?'} Nd4 $19) 36... Nd4 $1 37. Nxd4 exd4 $19 38. Bb6 Rxb4 39. Ba5 d3 $1 40. Bxb4 (40. Ref2 {doesn't get the bull off the ice} Rxe4 41. Rd1 Rc2 $19) 40... dxe2 41. Re1 (41. Rb1 {hardly improves anything} Rc4 42. Be1 Kf6 $19) 41... Rc4 42. Bd2 Bxd2 43. Rxe2 Rc1+ 44. Kh2 Bf4+ 45. g3 Bxg3+ 46. Kg2 Rc3 $19 {0-1 (46) Zvjaginsev,V (2652)-Polgar,J (2671) Las Vegas 1999 CBM 72 [Huzman]} 0-1

