h5 36. Rd3 g4 $132) 34... Rh8 35. Kg1 Kg8 36. b3 (36. Be7 $5 Rhh7 (36... Rxe7 37. Rxf4 Rg7 38. Rd4 f4 39. Rg4 $16) 37. hxg5 hxg5 38. Qd2 $1 (38. Bf6 Nh5 39. Rh3 (39. Bxg7 Nxg3 40. fxg3 Rxg7 $14) 39... Nf4 $14) 38... g4 (38... b4 39. c4 $1 (39. Rxb4 Qd5 40. Qxd5 Ne2+ 41. Kf1 Nxg3+ 42. fxg3 exd5 43. Bf6 $14) (39. Bxg5 Nh5 40. Rf3 f4 41. Rdxf4 Nxf4 42. Qxf4 $16) 39... g4 40. Rxf4 (40. Bf6 Nh5 41. Rgd3 Nxf6 42. exf6 Rf7 43. Qxb4 Rxf6 $16) 40... Rxe7 41. Qxb4 $16) (38... Rh5 39. Bf6 Rgh7 40. f3 Nd5 (40... Rh1+ 41. Kf2 Kf8 42. Rxg5 Nh5 (42... Nd5 $2 43. c4 $1 bxc4 (43... Nxf6 44. Qb4+ Kf7 45. exf6 Kxf6 46. Rxf5+ exf5 (46... Kxf5 47. Qf8+) 47. Rd6+ $18) 44. Qa5 $18) 43. Rg6 $18 (43. c4 Qc5)) 41. Rxg5+ Kf7 42. Rxh5 Rxh5 43. g4 fxg4 44. fxg4 Rh7 45. Bg5 $16) 39. Qxf4 Rxe7 40. Qg5+ Kf8 41. Rgd3 $16) 36... axb3 37. axb3 Rhh7 38. h5 Rh8 39. Ba3 (39. Be7 $1 Rxe7 40. Rxf4 Kg7 41. Rd4 Rc8 42. Rgd3 Rc7 43. c4 $16) 39... Kh7 40. Bc1 Nd5 41. c4 bxc4 42. bxc4 Nb6 43. Rd6 (43. Rb3 $5) 43... Qa4 (43... Qc7 44. Rb3 Rb8 45. Qd3 $16) 44. Qxa4 (44. Qf1 Rb8 45. Rc3 Nc8 (45... Qb4 46. Rc2 $16) 46. Rd4 Qa5 47. Rcd3 Nb6 $14) 44... Nxa4 45. Ra3 Nc5 46. Ra7 Rc8 47. Be3 f4 $2 (47... Kg8 48. f3 f4 49. Bf2 Nb3 (49... g4 50. fxg4 Ne4 51. Rd4 $16) 50. Ra3 Nc1 51. c5 Ne2+ 52. Kf1 Ng3+ 53. Bxg3 fxg3 54. Rc3 $14) 48. Bxc5 (48. Bxc5 Rxc5 49. Rdxd7 Rxd7 50. Rxd7+ Kg8 51. Re7 Rxe5 52. f3 $16) 1/2-1/2

