1. e4 {B87: Sicilian Scheveningen/Najdorf: 6 Bc4, with early ...b5} c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 a6 6. Bc4 e6 7. Bb3 b5 8. O-O Be7 9. Qf3 Qc7 10. Qg3 Nc6 11. Be3 O-O 12. Nxc6 Qxc6 13. Bh6 $146 (13. Bd4) 13... Ne8 14. a4 (14. Nd5 Bd8 15. Bg5 Qd7 16. Bxd8 Qxd8 $11) 14... b4 (14... Bb7 15. axb5 axb5 16. Rxa8 Bxa8 17. Ra1 $15) 15. Nd5 $1 Bd8 16. a5 {White intends Ba4} (16. Rfe1 $5) 16... Qb7 17. Bd2 $1 {White threatens.... what?} exd5 (17... Bd7 18. Nxb4 Qxe4 19. c4 $11) 18. Bxd5 {'' ''} Qa7 19. Bxa8 Qxa8 20. e5 $1 (20. Rfe1 Nf6 21. Qxd6 $16) 20... dxe5 {'??' throwing away the advantage '??'} (20... Qb8 21. exd6 Nxd6 $16) 21. Bxb4 {'+-' '+-'} f6 22. Rfd1 $6 (22. Bxf8 $1 Kxf8 23. b4 $36) (22. Qd3 Be6) 22... Be6 {'?' '?'} (22... Bf5 23. Bxf8 Kxf8 24. c4 $16) 23. Bxf8 (23. Qd3 Bc7 24. Bxf8 Kxf8 25. Qxh7 Qb7 $18) 23... Kxf8 24. Qd3 Be7 25. Qxh7 Qc6 26. h4 (26. c3 Bb3 27. Rd2 Nd6 $18) 26... Nd6 27. Rd3 $6 (27. c3 $18 {would have given White the upper hand}) 27... Qxc2 {'' ''} (27... Bf5 28. Qh8+) 28. Rad1 (28. Qh8+ Bg8 29. Rg3 $16) 28... e4 (28... Qxb2 29. Qh8+ Bg8 30. Qh5 $11) 29. R3d2 (29. Rxd6 $2 Bxd6 30. Rxd6 Qc1+ 31. Kh2 Qf4+ $19) (29. Qh8+ $5 Bg8 30. R3d2 $16) 29... Qc5 {'' ''} 30. Qh8+ Kf7 31. Rd4 Bf8 (31... Bg4 32. b4 Qc3 $15) 32. b4 Qe5 33. b5 $1 (33. Qh7 Bg4 34. R1d2 e3 35. fxe3 Qxe3+ 36. Kh2 Nc4 37. Rxc4 Bd6+ 38. Rxd6 Qe5+ 39. Kg1 Qe1+ 40. Kh2 Qe5+ 41. Kh1 Qe1+ 42. Kh2 Qe5+ $11) 33... e3 (33... Nxb5 34. Rd8 Qc5 35. Rxf8+ Qxf8 36. Qxf8+ Kxf8 37. Rd8+ Ke7 38. Ra8 $14) 34. fxe3 Nxb5 (34... Qxe3+ $5 {is worth looking at} 35. Kh1 Ne4 $11) 35. Rd8 {'' White threatens strongly Qxf8 ''} Qxe3+ 36. Kh1 {Do you see the mate threat?} Qc5 37. Re1 Nc7 (37... Nd4 $2 38. Rxf8+ Qxf8 39. Qxf8+ Kxf8 40. Re4 $18) 38. Rxf8+ {'??' weakening the position '??'} (38. Rb1 $14 {and White can hope to live}) 38... Qxf8 {'' ''} 39. Qxf8+ Kxf8 40. Rc1 Nb5 (40... Nd5 $5 $17) 41. Rc6 {'' ''} Ke7 42. Rxa6 {[ 8/b5]} Nc7 43. Rb6 Bd5 $2 (43... Bc8 $16) 44. a6 $18 Kd7 45. a7 (45. h5 Bc6 $11) 45... Na8 {'' ''} 46. Rb8 Ke6 47. Kh2 Kf5 48. Rb5 Ke5 49. g4 Ke6 50. Kg3 Bh1 51. Kf4 Bg2 52. g5 $1 fxg5+ {'?' '?'} (52... Bc6 {is just about the only chance} 53. Rb8 Kf7 $14) 53. Rxg5 {'+-' '+-'} (53. Kxg5 $6 Kf7 $14) (53. hxg5 $6 Bc6 54. Rb8 Bh1 $14) 53... Bh1 54. Rxg7 Kf6 55. Rg1 Bd5 56. h5 Nc7 1-0

