Rc6 24. Re2 (24. Nxc5 Rxc5 25. Bd3 Be6 $17) 24... Bf5 25. Nxc5 Rxc5 26. Bxf5 Rxf5 27. Kc2 (27. Rd3 Rc5 28. Rc2 Rdc8 29. Rxc5 Rxc5 $17) 27... Rc5+ 28. Kd3 a4 29. Rde1 (29. Ree1 Rdc8 $17) 29... Kh7 30. Re8 (30. Be5 Bxh4 31. g3 (31. Bxd4 $2 Bf6 32. Re4 Rcd5 $19) 31... Bg5 32. f4 f6 33. fxg5 (33. Bxd4 Rcd5 34. Re4 f5 $19) 33... hxg5 34. Bxd4 Rcd5 35. Re4 f5 $19) 30... Rxe8 31. Rxe8 Rb5 32. Re2 (32. Kc2 d3+ 33. Kxd3 Rxb2 34. Rb8 b5 35. h5 a3 $19) 32... Kg6 $1 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'It is crucial to improve the location of the king in order to keep chances for the success alive.' It is crucial to improve the location of the king in order to keep chances for the success alive.} 33. f3 (33. Rc2 Kf5 34. f3 Ke6 $17) 33... Rc5 34. Bf2 (34. Rc2 Rxc2 35. Kxc2 Kf5 36. Kd3 Ke6 37. Ke4 g6 38. Bf2 Kd6 39. Bxd4 Bxh4 $17) 34... Rc1 35. Re1 (35. Rd2 Rh1 36. g3 Rh2 37. Bg1 Rh3 38. Bf2 Be5 $1 $19) 35... Rxe1 36. Bxe1 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Hecht: 'L + MB'' Hecht: 'L + MB'} Kf5 37. Bf2 (37. Bd2 Ke5 (37... Bxh4 38. Kxd4 Bf6+ 39. Kc5 Bxb2 40. Kb6 h5 41. Kxb7 h4 42. Kb6 a3 43. Kc5 g5 $19) 38. g3 Kd5 $19) (37. h5 $5 {Hecht} Kg5 38. Ke4 Be7 (38... Kxh5 $140 $2 {Hecht} 39. Kf5 $1 {[%csl Rf6][%cal Rg2g4]}) 39. b3 axb3 40. axb3 Kxh5 41. Kxd4 Kg6 42. Ke5 h5 $17) 37... Kf4 $1 38. b3 (38. Bxd4 Bxd4 39. Kxd4 Kg3 $19) 38... axb3 39. axb3 h5 $1 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'White pawn will remain fixed on the h4 and will become grateful object of an attack.' White pawn will remain fixed on the h4 and will become grateful object of an attack.} 40. Ke2 Ke5 41. Kd3 Kd5 42. Be1 (42. f4 {Hecht} g6 43. g3 Bg7 44. Bg1 f5 45. Bf2 Kc5 46. Be1 Bf6 47. Bd2 Bd8 48. Be1 Bb6 49. Bd2 Kb5 50. Be1 Ba5 51. Bf2 Bc3 $19 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Nach dem Nehmen auf d4 ist das Bauernendspiel um ein Tempo verloren. Und' Nach dem Nehmen auf d4 ist das Bauernendspiel um ein Tempo verloren. Und} 52. Bg1 Kb4 53. Kc2 b5 54. Bf2 d3+ 55. Kxd3 Kxb3 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'scheidet auch aus.' scheidet auch aus.}) 42... g6 43. Bf2 Be5 44. Be1 f5 45. Bf2 Kc5 46. Be