zai,Laszlo: 'Ftacnik: '?'''' The classical problem with schematic thinking, Acs subconciously drifts the king to his flank. Somewhat paradoxically the right approach was to move in the opposite direction to d1 with equal chances. 'The classical problem with schematic thinking, Acs subconciously drifts the king to his flank. Somewhat paradoxically the right approach was to move in the opposite direction to d1 with equal chances. Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'The classical problem with schematic thinking, Acs subconciously drifts the king to his flank. Somewhat paradoxically the right approach was to move in the opposite direction to d1 with equal chances. Acs,Peter; Hazai,Laszlo: 'Ftacnik: 'The classical problem with schematic thinking, Acs subconciously drifts the king to his flank. Somewhat paradoxically the right approach was to move in the opposite direction to d1 with equal chances. ''''} (26. Kd1 $1 {Ftacnik: 'Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Acs,Peter; Hazai,Laszlo: 'Ftacnik'''} Ne4 (26... f5 27. Bxf5 exf5 28. Nxf5 Ne4 29. Qh2 Qc4 30. Nxg7+ Kd7 31. Qh3+ Kc6 32. Ne6 Ba6 $11) 27. Qg2 Bg3 28. Qf3 Rc8 29. Bf1 f5 30. Bd3 $11) 26... Ne4 27. Qd1 (27. Qg2 {Ftacnik: 'Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Acs,Peter; Hazai,Laszlo: 'Ftacnik'''} Bg3 28. gxf7+ Qxf7 29. f5 Ba6+ 30. Kg1 Bf2+ 31. Kh2 exf5 $19) 27... Bf2 $1 {'Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Acs,Peter; Hazai,Laszlo: 'Ftacnik: '!''''} (27... f5 $5 {Acs,Peter; Hazai,Laszlo Ftacnik: '(Ftacnik,Lubomir) Acs,Peter; Hazai,Laszlo'}) 28. Qg4 {Acs,Peter; Hazai,Laszlo: '?' Ftacnik: 'Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Acs,Peter; Hazai,Laszlo: '?' '?'''} (28. gxf7+ {Ftacnik: 'Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Acs,Peter; Hazai,Laszlo: 'Ftacnik'''} Qxf7 29. Qg4 Bc8 30. Ke2 g5 (30... Bg3 31. f5 Ba6+ 32. Kf3 $13) 31. fxg5 Bg3 $17) (28. a3 $5 {Acs,Peter; Hazai,Laszlo Ftacnik: '(Ftacnik,Lubomir) Acs,Peter; Hazai,Laszlo'} Rd8 $1 (28... Bxe3 29. Bxe3 d4 30. Qxd4 $132 (30. Bxd4 Rd8 $40)) 29. axb4 Bxe3 30. Bxe3 d4 $40) 28... Bxe3 29. Bxe3 d4 {Acs,Peter; Hazai,Laszlo: '-+' Ftacnik: 'Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Acs,Peter; Hazai,Laszlo: '-+' '-+'''} 30. gxf7+ (30. Bg1 {Ftacnik: 'Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Acs,Peter; Hazai,Laszlo: 'Ftacnik'''} Qxc2 31. gxf7+ Kf8 32. Rd1 Nd2+ 33. Rxd2 (33. Kf2 Nf3+ 34. Kg3 Qxd1 $19) 33... Qxd2 34. Bf2 Rc8 $19) 30... Kf8 $1 {'Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Acs,Peter; Hazai,Laszlo: 'Ftacnik: '!'''' The key move of the tactical shoot out, black will be tempo ahead in the attack.'The key move of the tactical shoot out, black will be tempo ahead in the attack. Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'The key move of the tactical shoot out, black will be tempo ahead in the attack. Acs,Peter; Hazai,Laszlo: 'Ftacnik: 'The key move of the tactical shoot out, black will be tempo ahead in the attack.''''} 31. Qh4 (31. Bxd4 $2 {Ftacnik: 'Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Acs,Peter; Hazai,Laszlo: 'Ftacnik'''} Qc4+ 32. Ke1 Qxd4 $19) 31... Qc4+ 32. Kg1 dxe3 33. Bg4 (33. Qh8+ {Ftacnik: 'Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Acs,Peter; Hazai,Laszlo: 'Ftacnik'''} Kxf7 34. Qh5+ Kg8 35. Re1 Bd5 36. Rxe3 Qxc2 $19) 33... e2 0-1

