1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 e6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 a6 5. Nc3 Qc7 6. Bd3 Nf6 7. O-O d6 8. f4 (8. Kh1 g6 (8... Nc6 9. Be3 g6 10. f4 Bg7 11. Nf3 O-O 12. Qe1 b5 13. Qh4 Re8 14. e5 Nd5 15. Nxd5 exd5 16. f5 gxf5 17. exd6 Qxd6 18. Bf4 Qf6 19. Bg5 Qxb2 20. Rab1 Qa3 21. Bf6 Qd6 22. Bxg7 Kxg7 23. Ng5 {Tischbierek,R-Den Boer,B/Oostende op (09)/1991/½-½ (43)}) 9. f4 Bg7 10. f5 Nc6 11. Nxc6 bxc6 12. Bg5 Nd7 13. fxe6 fxe6 14. Qg4 Ne5 15. Qh4 Rb8 16. Rab1 c5 17. Qh3 Qd7 18. Be2 Nf7 19. Bf6 O-O 20. Bxg7 Kxg7 21. Qh4 Ne5 22. Rxf8 Kxf8 {Savova,S-Gheorghiu,F/Berlin op (02)/1988/0-1 (54)}) (8. Be3 Nbd7 9. f4 b5 10. a3 Bb7 11. Qf3 Be7 12. Qg3 g6 13. Nf3 Nc5 14. Bd4 O-O 15. Ng5 Nh5 16. Qg4 e5 17. fxe5 dxe5 18. Be3 Rad8 19. Rad1 Nf4 20. Bxf4 exf4 21. Nh3 Ne6 22. Nxf4 Nxf4 23. Qxf4 {Trkaljanov,V-Kovacevic,Sl/JUG-ch (05)/1991/0-1 (55)}) 8... g6 (8... Bd7 9. Nf3 Nc6 10. Qe2 g6 11. e5 Ng4 12. h3 Qb6+ 13. Kh1 h5 14. g3 Nh6 15. Be3 Qa5 16. Qf2 d5 17. Bb6 Qb4 18. a3 Qe7 19. Nh4 Rg8 20. Rae1 Nd8 21. Kh2 Bc6 22. Ne2 Bb5 23. f5 Nxf5 24. Nxf5 gxf5 {Zuse,P-Kurz,E/Mannheim BM (07)/1990/0-1 (51)}) 9. f5 $5 (9. Nf3 Nc6 10. Qe1 Bg7 11. Qh4 O-O 12. Kh1 b5 13. f5 b4 14. Ne2 exf5 15. exf5 d5 16. Bh6 Ne5 17. Bxg7 Kxg7 18. Nf4 Nxd3 19. Qxf6+ Kxf6 20. Nxd5+ Kxf5 21. Nxc7 Ra7 22. Nd4+ Kg4 23. Nd5 Ne5 24. Nf6+ Kh4 25. Rae1 Rd8 26. Re4+ {1-0 Akopian,V-Psakhis,L/Manila olm/1992/}) 9... Bg7 (9... Qb6 10. Be3 e5 11. fxg6 $1 exd4 (11... hxg6 12. Rxf6 exd4 13. Nd5 $16) 12. gxf7+ Kd8 (12... Kxf7 13. Rxf6+ Kxf6 14. Nd5+ $18) 13. Na4 Qa7 14. Bg5 $18) 10. Bg5 O-O 11. Kh1 Bd7 (11... Nc6 12. Nf3 Ne5 13. Nxe5 dxe5 14. Qd2 b5 15. a3 Bb7 16. Qe3 Rae8 17. Qg3 Qb6 18. fxg6 fxg6 19. Qh4 Nh5 20. g3 Bc6 {Ladisic,S-Martinovic,S/Chartres op (07)/1990/0-1 (56)}) 12. Qf3 Nc6 13. Nxc6 Bxc6 (13... bxc6 14. e5 dxe5 15. Bxf6 Bxf6 16. Ne4 Bg7 17. f6 $13) 14. Qh3 Rae8 15. Qh4 Qe7 {The disadvantage of the absence of the second  on d7. White is quite correctly pressing against the only vulnerable square f6.} 16. Rae1 h6 $2 (16... b5 17. Re3 b4 18. Rh3 h5 19. Ne2 exf5 20. Nf4 (20. exf5 Qb7 $132) 20... fxe4 21. Nxh5 gxh5 22. Bxf6 Bxf6 23. Qxh5 Bh4 24. Rxh4 f5 25. Bc4+ d5 26. Qh8+ Kf7 27. Rh7+) 17. Bxh6 Bxh6 18. Qxh6 exf5 19. Bc4 $1 {Black's combination in order to get relief and take advantage of the pressure along the e file has one weak point -it is not correct.} (19. exf5 $2 Qxe1 20. fxg6 Qe3 21. Qxe3 Rxe3 22. Rxf6 Re1+ 23. Rf1 Rxf1+ 24. Bxf1 fxg6 $17) 19... d5 $8 20. exd5 Qxe1 21. dxc6 Qxf1+ (21... Nh5 22. cxb7 Qe5 23. Qxg6+ Ng7 24. Qxa6 $18) (21... Qe5 22. Qxg6+ (22. cxb7 Ng4 23. Qxg6+ Qg7 24. Qxa6 Ne3 25. Rf2 $16) 22... Kh8 23. Qh6+ Nh7 24. cxb7 $18) 22. Bxf1 Re1 23. Kg1 bxc6 24. Qh4 Re6 25. Bc4 Rd6 26. Qg3 Ne8 (26... Rfd8 $2 27. Qxg6+) 27. Bxa6 Kg7 28. Bc4 Rd7 29. Qe5+ (29. Bd3 Nd6 30. Qf3 $18) 29... Nf6 30. h3 Re8 31. Qc5 Rd2 32. a4 f4 (32... Rxc2 33. Qxc6 Rd8 34. Qc7 Rd7 35. Qe5 $18) 33. Be2 (33. Qxc6 Re1+ 34. Kh2 Rxc2 35. Qb7 Rcc1 36. Qxf7+ Kh6 37. g4 Rc2+ 38. Ne2 Rcxe2+ 39. Bxe2 Rxe2+ 40. Kg1 Ne4 41. Qxf4+ $18) 33... Rxc2 (33... Rdxe2 34. Nxe2 Rxe2 35. Qxc6 $18) 34. Qd4 Rcxe2 (34... Rxb2 35. Bf3 $18) 35. Nxe2 Rxe2 36. a5 c5 37. Qc3 (37. Qxc5 Rxb2 38. a6 Ra2 39. a7 $18) 37... Re3 38. Qc1 (38. Qxc5 Re1+ 39. Kh2 Ne4 40. Qe5+ f6 41. Qxf4 $18) 38... Re4 39. Qa1 Rb4 40. a6 Nd5 41. Qa5 $1 (41. a7 Nb6 42. Qa5 $18) 1-0

