. f5 $1 $14 {Vogt,L-Hansen,LB/Altensteig 58/326 1993/1-0 (55)}) 18... Nxe5 19. dxe5 Qc5 20. g4 Bd7 21. Be3 Qc7 22. Qd4 b6 $14 {Sion Castro,M-De la Villa Garcia,J/Leon 1991 (48)}) (13... Qc7) (13... Qa5) 14. O-O (14. Qd2 $5 Rxf3 $8 15. gxf3 Qxf3 16. Rg1 $14) 14... c4 (14... Nf5 15. Ne5 Nxe5 16. dxe5 c4 17. Bxf5 gxf5 18. Bf6 Rxf6 19. exf6 Qxf6 20. Qd4 $16 {Tatai-Luce/Pau op 1988 (33)}) 15. Be2 h6 16. Bc1 (16. Be3 Bd7 17. Qd2 Kh7 18. h3 Nf5 19. Nh2 Qg7 20. f4 Raf8 21. Bf2 Nd6 $10 {Timoshchenko,G-Berelovich,A/Berliner Sommer (05) ,EXP 47 1995 (39)}) (16. Bh4 Nf5 17. Bg3 g5 18. Qd2 Bd7 19. h4 (19. Ne5 $6 Nxg3 20. hxg3 Nxe5 21. dxe5 Qg7 22. Qd4 Rf5 23. f4 g4 $10) 19... Qe7 (19... g4 20. Ne5 Nxg3 21. fxg3 Nxe5 22. dxe5 $40) 20. hxg5 Nxg3 21. fxg3 hxg5 22. Qe3 (22. Nxg5 Rg7 23. Nf3 Rxg3 24. Qf4 Qg7 $132) 22... Raf8 23. Nxg5 Rxf1+ (23... Rg7 $2 24. Rxf8+ Kxf8 25. Nh3 $16) 24. Bxf1 (24. Rxf1 Rxf1+ 25. Kxf1 Qxa3 26. Nxe6 $6 Qe7 27. Qg5+ Qxg5 28. Nxg5 Bf5 $15) 24... e5 25. dxe5 (25. Re1 e4 $44) 25... Qxe5 26. Qxe5 Nxe5 $44 {Timman,J-Yusupov,A/Novgorod (08) ;CBM 48 1995 (35)}) 16... Qg7 (16... Bd7 17. a4 Be8 18. Qd2 g5 19. Ba3 Rd8 20. Rae1 Qg7 21. Bd1 Rf6 22. h4 Bh5 $10 {Howell,James-Edelman,Danny/New York op (04) 1990 (44)}) 17. Qd2 Nf5 18. h4 (18. g4 Nd6 19. Qxh6 Qxh6 20. Bxh6 Ne4 $132 {[%csl Rc3]}) 18... Bd7 19. Bb2 {[%cal Ya1e1,Ye2d1,Ye1e6] ae1,d1,e} Qf6 20. g3 e5 {[%csl Rb2]} 21. dxe5 Nxe5 22. Nxe5 Qxe5 {[%cal Yf5g3] xg3} 23. Bf3 Nxh4 24. Bxd5 Be6 $15 25. Bh1 Nf3+ 26. Bxf3 Rxf3 27. Rae1 (27. Qxh6 $4 Rxg3+ 28. fxg3 Qxg3+ 29. Kh1 Bd5+) 27... Qf6 28. Qxh6 Rf8 29. Bc1 $1 {King: Both sides strive for the initiative, and with opposite coloured bishops, and the kings a little exposed, the stakes are high.} Rf7 {[%csl Rh1][%cal Yf7h7,Ye6d5,Yd5h1,Yh7h1] h7,d5,h1#} (29... Rxf2 30. Bf4 $10 (30. Qxf8+ {King} Qxf8 31. Rxf2 $16)) 30. Bf4 Rh7 31. Qg5 Qxg5 32. Bxg5 Bd7 {[%csl Re8] ×e8} (32... Bd5 33. Re8+ Kf7 (33... Rf8 34. Rxf8+ Kxf8 35. f3 $14) 34. Re7+ Kg8 35. Rxh7 Kxh7 36. Bd2 $10) 33. Re7 {King: Black was threatening ...Bc6, so this simplification is forced and the game fades to a draw.} Rxe7 34. Bxe7 Rxc3 35. Rc1 Bf5 36. Bb4 Rxc2 37. Rxc2 Bxc2 {Hecht: Ungleiche L; blockierte sB-Mehrheit am Damenflügel} 38. Kf1 Kf7 39. Ke2 Ke6 40. Kd2 Ba4 41. Bc5 b6 42. Be3 Kd5 43. Kc3 Bb3 44. Kd2 Kc6 45. Kc3 Kb5 46. Bg5 1/2-1/2

