1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nd2 c5 4. Ngf3 Nc6 5. exd5 Bd6 6. Bb5 exd5 7. dxc5 Bxc5 8. O-O Nge7 9. Nb3 Bd6 (9... Bb6 10. Re1 O-O 11. Be3) 10. Bg5 (10. Re1 O-O $5 11. Bd3) 10... O-O 11. Re1 $1 {I think that the position is in White's favour.} Bg4 12. Bh4 $1 Qc7 (12... Re8 13. Bg3 $11 Bxg3 14. hxg3 Qb6 15. a4 $1 {Black can try to get an advantage.} h6 16. Qd2 a6 17. Bxc6 Qxc6 18. Ne5 Qc8 19. Nd4 Be6 20. Ra3 $17 {0-1 (53) Afshari,M (2304)-Mahjoob,M (2335) Iran 2000}) 13. Bg3 $16 Rad8 14. Bd3 (14. c3 Ng6 15. Bxd6 Rxd6 $1 16. h3 Bc8 17. Qd2 Rf6 18. Nbd4 Nf4 $16 19. Bf1 $4 a6 $18 20. Re3 $2 Ne6 21. Rae1 Nc5) (14. Be2 Nf5 15. Bxd6 Qxd6 16. h3 Bxf3 $13 17. Bxf3 Nh4 18. c3 Qf6 19. Bg4 d4 $11 {1/2 (53) Khalifman,A (2656)-Gunawan,R (2507) Bali 2000} 20. Nxd4 Nxd4 21. cxd4 Rxd4 22. Qe2 Qc6 23. Qf1 Rd2) 14... Ng6 $2 15. Bxd6 Rxd6 16. h3 Bh5 (16... Bxf3 17. Qxf3 Nce5 18. Qg3 $1 {The computer recommends the novelty, which changes the evaluation of the line.} Nxd3 19. cxd3 Qb6 20. Rac1) 17. Bxg6 (17. g4 $5 Nf4 18. gxh5 Rh6 $2 19. Bf1 $18 Rxh5 $2 20. Re3 $18) 17... Bxg6 18. Nfd4 Nxd4 19. Nxd4 Qb6 20. Re3 $2 Rc8 $11 (20... Qxb2 21. Rb3 $18) 21. Qe2 h6 (21... Be4 $18 22. c3 f5) 22. c3 Qa6 23. Re1 Kh7 (23... Qxa2 24. Re8+ Rxe8 25. Qxe8+ Kh7 26. Qf8 $18 Rb6 $11 27. Re8 $18 Be4 28. Qh8+ Kg6 29. Rg8 $18) 24. a3 (24. Qxa6 Rxa6 25. a3 Rb6 26. R1e2 $14) (24. Qg4) 24... Qc4 25. Re8 (25. Qg4 Be4 26. f3 Bg6 $4 27. h4) 25... Rxe8 26. Qxe8 Rb6 27. Qe2 (27. Qb8 Be4 (27... Rxb2 28. Re8 Be4 29. Rh8+ $2 Kg6 30. Qg3+ Kf6 31. Rg8) 28. f3 Rxb2 29. fxe4 Qxc3 30. Rd1) 27... Qa2 28. b3 $16 Qxa3 29. Qe5 Rf6 30. Qg3 (30. Qxd5 Qb2 31. Nf3 Qxc3) 30... Qb2 31. Re7 (31. Qe3) 31... Be4 32. Qe3 (32. f3 Qxc3 33. Qf2 Qc8 $18) 32... Rg6 33. g4 (33. Nf3 Qb1+ 34. Kh2 $11 Qf1 35. g4 Rf6 36. Rxe4 dxe4 37. Qxe4+ $2 g6) 33... Qb1+ 34. Kh2 Qh1+ 35. Kg3 Qg1+ 36. Kf4 Rf6+ 37. Ke5 $18 {Black's king doesn't have any moves. White is completely winning.} Rxf2 38. Rxf7 Qh2+ 39. Ke6 (39. Rf4 Rf1) 39... Rxf7 40. Kxf7 Qd6 41. h4 (41. Nf5 Qd7+ 42. Kf8 Bxf5 43. gxf5 Qxf5+ $2) (41. h4 Bg6#) 0-1

