1. e4 c5 2. Nc3 d6 3. f4 g6 4. Nf3 Bg7 5. g3 (5. Bc4 Nc6 6. d3 e6 7. a3 Nge7 8. Ba2 d5 9. Bd2 b6 10. O-O O-O 11. Qe1 Nd4 12. Nxd4 cxd4 13. Nd1 dxe4 14. dxe4 Ba6) 5... Nc6 6. Bg2 Nf6 (6... e5 7. O-O Nge7 8. d3 O-O 9. Be3 Nd4 10. Qd2 exf4 11. Bxf4 Nxf3+ 12. Rxf3 Qb6 13. Rb1 Be6 14. Bh6 Rae8 15. Bxg7 Kxg7 16. Kh1 f6 17. a3 d5) 7. O-O O-O 8. d3 Bd7 (8... Rb8 9. Nh4 (9. h3 b5 10. a3 (10. g4 b4 11. Ne2 c4 12. Be3 Ba6 13. Ned4 Nxd4 14. Bxd4 Qc7) 10... a5 11. Be3 b4 12. axb4 axb4 13. Ne2 Ne8 14. Rb1 Nc7 15. f5 Nb5 16. Qd2 Nbd4 17. Nh4 Nxe2+ 18. Qxe2 Ne5 19. Nf3 Nxf3+ 20. Qxf3 Bb7) 9... Nd4 10. f5 b5 11. Bg5 b4 12. Nb1 Nd7 13. Nd2 Ne5) 9. h3 {Not an unusual path for the b1-, but the move is a novelty in this position.} Qc8 (9... Rb8) 10. Kh2 Nd4 (10... Ne8 $11 {1-0 Hellsten,J-Dworakowski,L/Hallsberg 1993/EXT 97 (39)} 11. Be3 Nc7 12. g4 Ne6 13. f5 Ned4 14. Qd2 Nxf3+) (10... Rb8 11. Be3 b5 12. e5 $14 {1-0 Oltra Caurin,R-Mendoza,J/Valencia 1992/EXT 98 (41)} Ne8 13. exd6 exd6 14. d4) (10... e5 11. Be3 Rb8 12. Qd2 $132 {0-1 Alexander,C-O'Kelly de Galway,A/Hilversum 1947/MCD (45)} b5 {is the main alternative.} 13. fxe5 Nxe5) 11. Nxd4 cxd4 12. Ne2 e5 13. c3 dxc3 14. Nxc3 Bc6 (14... Be6 15. Qf3) 15. f5 (15. Be3 Qe6 $14 {½-½ Bednarski,J-Van Geet,D/Amsterdam 1970/MCD (44)} 16. Qd2 d5 17. fxe5 Qxe5 18. d4 Qe6 19. e5) 15... Qd7 16. g4 h6 17. g5 hxg5 18. Bxg5 $6 Nh7 19. Be3 g5 $2 {This gives the game away.} (19... Nf6) 20. h4 $1 $18 (20. Qf3) 20... f6 (20... gxh4 21. Qg4 Qe7 22. Bf2 Qg5) 21. Bf3 Kf7 22. Qb3+ Ke7 23. h5 Bh6 24. Bg4 Rfd8 25. d4 b6 26. Rac1 Qb7 27. Be2 exd4 28. Bxd4 Kf8 $1 $13 {stops White´s centre attack.} 29. Nd5 $14 Re8 30. Rxc6 Qxc6 31. Bb5 Qc8 32. Bxe8 Qxe8 33. Qf3 $15 Rc8 34. Bc3 Rc4 35. Re1 Bg7 36. Kg2 Qa4 37. h6 Bh8 (37... Bxh6 38. Qh5 Bg7 39. Qxh7) 38. Qd3 Rc6 39. Nb4 $13 {0-1 Barczay,L-Honfi,K/Budapest 1955/MCD (33)} 1-0

