{This was the last but one round game of the Israeli League.} 1. d4 e6 2. c4 Nf6 3. Nf3 b6 4. g3 Ba6 5. b3 Bb4+ 6. Bd2 Be7 7. Bg2 d5 $5 8. Ne5 $5 {[%csl Ra8,Gf3,Rf6,Gg5][%cal Gf3a8,Gf3f6,Gg5f6][%mdl 4]} O-O 9. O-O (9. Bc3 c5 10. Nd2 Bb7 11. O-O (11. dxc5 Bxc5 12. O-O Qe7 13. e3 Rd8 14. Qc2 Na6 15. Rad1 Nb4 16. Qb1 a5 17. Bb2 Rac8 18. a3 Na6 19. Qa1 Bd6 20. cxd5 exd5 21. Nef3) 11... Nbd7 12. Ndf3 Rc8 13. Bb2 dxc4 14. Nxc4 b5 15. Nce5 Nxe5 16. Nxe5 Bxg2 17. Kxg2 Qd5+ 18. Kg1 Rfd8 19. dxc5 Qxc5 20. Nd3 Qh5) 9... Bb7 $5 10. Bc3 $5 ({Pretty dubious:} 10. Nc3 Na6 $1 {[%csl Yf8,Rg8][%cal Yg8f8,Gh6g5]} (10... Nbd7 11. Bf4 {I have a slight positional advantage in the endgame.} {Interestingly from the beginning:} c5 $5 {You can see comments to Beliavsky,A-Kortschnoj,V/Lviv,2000/CBM 77 (½-½)(Golod,V) (33)} 12. cxd5 $5 {It's main line.See comments to Gabriel,C-Wells,P/Pulvermuehle,2000/CBM 75(½-½) (Golod,V)(22)} {Besides,white has three options:} Nxd5 13. Nxd5 {and} exd5 $6 {See comments to Golod,V-Dgebuadze,A/ Hoogeveen,1998/CBM 68 (1-0)(Golod,V)(52)} 14. Rc1 Re8 15. Qd3 Nxe5 16. Bxe5 Qd7 17. Rc2 Rac8 18. dxc5 Rxc5 19. Rxc5 bxc5 20. Rd1 Bf8 21. Bb2 Rd8 22. e3 h6) 11. cxd5 exd5 12. Qc2 h6 (12... Qc8 $5 13. Bg5 Rd8 14. Rfd1 h6 15. Be3 Qe6 $13 16. Nd3 $143 Bf8 17. Nf4 Qe8 18. Qf5 c6 19. Nh5 Nh7 {/=} 20. Nf4 $5 Nf6 $5 $13 {[%csl Rg8,Gh1,Gh3] An interesting idea which was mentioned by Smirin,I after the game:} {After:} 21. Nh5 Nh7 22. Nf4) 13. Rfd1 {[%csl Rg7][%cal Gh1h7]} (13. Rad1 Qc8 $13 {Was checked in the previous game:} 14. Rfe1 {[%cal Gc6d4]} c5 $6 15. Be3 Rd8 {½-½ Golod,V-Psakhis,L/London,1999(12)} 16. f4 cxd4 17. Bxd4 Ne4 18. Qb2 Bc5 19. Nb5 f6 $11 {[%csl Rg2][%cal Gf8g8]} 20. Nd3 $5 Qd7 21. a4 $11 Qe7 $5 22. Rc1 {[%csl Yb8][%cal Yb8b7,Gc6d4]}) 13... Qc8 14. Nd3 c5 15. Qb2 Rd8 16. Rac1 Qd7 17. Be3 g5 18. Na4 $44 Ng4 $2 19. Bh3 $17 {[%csl Yf3,Rg5][%cal Gb7f3]} Bf6 $5 20. Ne1 Bc8 21. Qd2 Qe7 {=/} 22. Bxg4 {See comments to Dias,P-Miralles,G/Escaldes,1998/CBM 68(½-½)(Rodriguez,Am) (18)} {It deserves attention:} Bxg4 $5 23. Nc2) 10... Na6 11. Bb2 $5 $146 {[%csl Yc1] From my point of view this move better,than:} c5 {[%csl Gb7,Rf3]} 12. cxd5 {Most probably,this obligatory move.} (12. Nc3 Rb8 13. cxd5 Nxd5 14. dxc5 $11 (14. Nxd5 Bxd5 15. Nc6 Bxc6 $11 16. Bxc6 $5 Bf6 17. e3 cxd4 $11 18. Bxd4 $143 Bxd4 19. exd4 Nb4 $14) {Senselessly:} 14... Nxc3 15. Bxc3 Nxc5 16. Nc6 Bxc6 17. Bxc6) 12... Nxd5 13. Nc3 Nxc3 14. Bxc3 {/=} Bxg2 $5 {Black's plan is:b8-d7} 15. Kxg2 Qd5+ {[%cal Gb8d7]} 16. Nf3 Bf6 17. Qd3 $6 {After this inaccuracy black equalizes. Probably could be recomended:17.d2!? or 17.e2.} Qb7 (17... Nc7 18. Rac1 Rfd8 {/} (18... Rac8) 19. dxc5 $143 (19. Rfd1) 19... Qxd3 $16 {[%cal Ge2f4]} 20. exd3 $2 Bxc3 {[%csl Rc7,Rd6][%cal Gb5c7,Gb5d6]} 21. Rxc3 Nb5 22. Rcc1 Rxd3 $18 {[%csl Rb5,Rd7]} 23. c6 $2) 18. dxc5 Nxc5 19. Qe3 $11 Bxc3 20. Qxc3 {[%csl Ya6,Rb5][%cal Ya6b5]} Rac8 (20... Qe4 $1 {[%csl Rd6][%cal Gc3e4,Gc3b5]} 21. Qe5 $8) 21. Rac1 {e7,g8=} {Too actively:} Rfd8 22. Rfd1 $140 Rxd1 $6 {because of:} 23. Rxd1 Ne4 24. Qe5 h6 25. Rd4 Nf6 26. Qe3 $14 {Badly:} b5 $2 {in view of:} 1/2-1/2

