1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. g3 Bg7 4. Bg2 O-O 5. Nc3 d6 6. Nf3 c6 7. O-O Bf5 (7... Nbd7) (7... Qa5) 8. Bf4 (8. Ne1 Qc8 (8... e5 9. d5 cxd5 10. cxd5 Na6 11. e4 Bd7 12. Nd3 Qa5 13. Bd2 Rfc8 14. b4 (14. Rc1 Qd8 15. Qb3 Qb6 (15... Rab8 16. Qa3 Qf8 17. f3))) 9. e4 Bh3) 8... Ne4 (8... Na6 9. Qd2 Ne4 10. Nxe4 Bxe4 11. Bh6 d5 12. c5 Re8 13. Bxg7 Kxg7 14. Rac1 Bxf3 15. exf3 e5 16. dxe5 Rxe5 17. f4 Re8 18. Rc3 Qf6 19. g4 Kg8 20. g5 Qe7 21. Rfc1 Rad8 22. f5 d4 23. Rd3 Nxc5 24. Rxd4 Ne4 25. Re1 gxf5 26. Rxd8 Rxd8 27. Qa5 Rd5 28. Qxa7 Qb4 29. Rb1 Kg7 30. h4 Qd2 31. Qe3 Rd3 32. Qxd2 Rxd2 33. a4 Rd4 34. a5 Rb4 35. Rc1 Rxb2 36. a6 bxa6 37. Rxc6 Nxf2 38. Rxa6) 9. Nxe4 (9. Rc1 Nxc3 10. Rxc3 c5) 9... Bxe4 10. Qd2 (10. Qb3 Qb6 11. Rfd1 Nd7 (11... Bxf3 12. Bxf3 Bxd4 (12... Nd7) 13. Rxd4 Qxd4 14. Qxb7) 12. Rac1 e5) 10... Nd7 (10... Qb6) 11. Bh6 Bxh6 12. Qxh6 Bxf3 (12... Qb6 13. Ng5) 13. Bxf3 e5 14. Rfd1 Qe7 (14... Qb6) 15. dxe5 (15. Qd2 e4 $17 16. Bg2 f5 17. b4 Nf6 18. c5 dxc5 $1 $17 19. dxc5 Rad8 20. Qb2 h5 21. e3 Ng4 22. Qb3+ Qf7 $15 23. Qxf7+ Kxf7 $11 24. Bf1 $5 Ne5 25. Be2 $11 {[%csl Rc3][%cal Ye8c8,Yc8c3]} Ke7 26. h4 Rxd1+ 27. Rxd1 Ra8 28. a4 a5 29. b5 Rd8 $11 30. Rd4 Nf3+ 31. Bxf3 Rxd4 32. exd4 exf3 $11 33. d5 cxb5) (15. Rd2 Rad8 16. Rad1 f5 $11 17. dxe5 dxe5) 15... dxe5 16. Qd2 Rfd8 17. Qd6 $5 {White give Black advantage of two bishops.As compensation their pawn centre becomes stronger.} Qxd6 18. Rxd6 Nc5 19. Rxd8+ (19. Rad1 Rxd6 20. Rxd6 a5 21. Kf1 $36 e4 $2 22. Bg2 $1 Kf8 23. Ke1 $18 Ke7 $5 24. Rd1 Rd8 {[%cal Yh6h2]}) 19... Rxd8 20. b4 (20. Kf1 Kf8 $16 21. Ke1 Ke7 22. Rd1 Rxd1+ $1 23. Kxd1 Kd6 (23... a5) 24. Kc2 f5 25. b4 Ne6 $17) 20... Na4 (20... Ne6) 21. Rc1 f5 $36 22. e3 (22. e4 Rd2 (22... Rd3 23. Kg2 Nc3 $3 $40 24. Re1 (24. Rc2 Nxe4) 24... Nxa2 $3 25. exf5) 23. exf5 {Black missed nice tactical idea} gxf5 $1 24. Rd1 Rxa2 $1 25. Rd8+ Kg7 $1 {[%cal Yc6g2,Yg6c2]} 26. Rd7+) 22... Kf7 {Not many pieces defend g1 now and Black start to attack its position.} 23. Rd1 (23. Kf1) 23... Ke7 24. Rxd8 (24. Kf1 Rxd1+ (24... Nc3 $1) 25. Bxd1 $1 Nc3 26. Bb3 Kd6 27. Ke1 $44 a5 28. a3 (28. bxa5 Kc5 29. a3 $1 $44 Nb1 $140) 28... Nb1) 24... Kxd8 25. Bd1 Nc3 26. Bb3 c5 $1 27. bxc5 $1 (27. a3 Nb1) (27. b5 $11 Kc7 28. Kf1 Kb6 29. Ke1 Ka5 30. Kd2 Kb4) 27... Kc7 $6 28. f4 e4 29. Kf2 Kc6 30. Ke1 Kxc5 31. Kd2 Nb1+ $2 {[%mdl 8192]} 32. Kc2 $1 {Saving e3 will cost Black a pawn now.} Na3+ 33. Kc3 $16 a5 34. h3 ({Black had to escape from a pin by} 34. Kb2 Kb4) (34. h4 $11 h5 (34... b6 35. h5 gxh5)) 34... b6 35. g4 a4 36. Bxa4 Nxc4 37. gxf5 gxf5 38. Bd7 $1 Nxe3 39. Kd2 $1 {The endgame will be winning for White because they can improve position of g2 very quickly.} Kd4 40. Ke2 h6 41. a4 Nd5 (41... Ng2 $18) 42. Bxf5 Nxf4+ 43. Kd2 $1 e3+ 44. Ke1 Ke5 45. Bd7 Kf6 46. Kf1 Kg5 47. Ke1 Kh4 48. Kf1 {[%cal Ge3g4]} Kg3 49. Ke1 h5 50. Be8 h4 51. Bd7 Nxh3 52. Ke2 Nf2 53. Kxe3 Ng4+ 54. Ke2 h3 55. Bc6 Ne5 56. Ba8 h2 57. Bh1 Nc4 58. Kd3 $18 Nb2+ 59. Kc3 $18 Nxa4+ 60. Kb4 Nc5 61. Kb5 Nd7 $18 62. Kc6 Kf2 (62... Kf2 63. Kxd7 Kg1 64. Bc6 (64. Kc6 Kxh1 65. Kxb6 Kg1) 64... b5) 1-0

