1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bc4 Nf6 4. d3 Be7 (4... Bc5) 5. Bb3 O-O 6. O-O d6 (6... h6 7. c3) (6... d5 7. exd5 Nxd5 8. h3) 7. c3 h6 8. Re1 (8. Nbd2 Nh7 9. Nc4) 8... Nh7 (8... Be6 $11 9. Nbd2 a6 10. Nf1 Re8 11. Ng3 Bf8 $132 12. d4 $5 {This move looks like a logical development of the idea of the previous Whites move.} Bxb3 13. Qxb3 Qd7 14. h3 b5 15. a4 Na5 $1 16. Qc2 c5 17. axb5 axb5 18. dxe5 dxe5 $11 {½-½ Nisipeanu,L-Landa,K/Muelheim Nord GER 2005/(31)} 19. Nf5 Qe6 $11 20. Nh2 Nc4) 9. h3 (9. Nbd2 Bg4 $1 10. h3 Bh5 $36 11. g4 Bg6 12. Nf1 Ng5 13. Kg2 Nxf3 14. Qxf3 Bg5 15. Ng3) 9... Ng5 10. Nbd2 Kh8 11. Nxg5 Bxg5 12. Nf3 Bxc1 13. Rxc1 f5 14. d4 fxe4 15. Rxe4 Qf6 (15... Bf5 16. Re3 $1 e4 17. Nd2 d5 18. Nf1 {[%csl Rd5]} Ne7 19. Ng3 Qd6 20. c4 c6 21. cxd5 $11 cxd5 22. Rc5 Be6 23. Qd2 Rf7 24. Rc2 $11 {White misses the tactical chance to get an advantage} Raf8 $1 25. Qa5 Ng6 $1 26. Qxa7 $5 Nf4 27. Qc5 Qd7 28. Nh1 Qd8 29. Qc3 h5 30. f3 Bf5 31. fxe4 Bh7 32. Rf2 Rc7 33. Qd2 $14 dxe4 34. Rc3 Rxc3 35. bxc3 $16 Qg5 36. Qe3 h4 37. Kh2 Qf6 38. Bc2 Qd6 39. Kg1 $11 Nd5 40. Rxf8+ $1 $16 Qxf8 41. Qe1 Qf4 42. Bb3 Nf6 43. Nf2 $36 Qg3 44. Bc4 Bf5 45. Kf1) 16. Qe2 Bxh3 17. dxe5 dxe5 18. Nxe5 Bxg2 (18... Bf5) 19. Kxg2 Qg5+ 20. Qg4 Qxc1 21. Ng6+ Kh7 22. Nxf8+ Rxf8 23. Re3 (23. Be6) 23... Qd2 24. Re2 $1 {[%cal Gc4c5]} Qg5 25. Bc2+ Kg8 26. Qxg5 hxg5 27. Bg6 Rf6 28. Re8+ Rf8 29. Re2 Rf6 30. Re8+ Rf8 1/2-1/2

