3. Qh8+ Kg6 34. Nf3 Rc8 35. Ne5+ Kh5 36. g4+ $13 {Pantovic,X-Garcia Martinez,S/Roma op/1990/} Kh4 37. Kh2 Nxg4+ 38. hxg4 Rxh8 39. f4 Nxe3 40. Rxe3 $14 {Gollain,M-Rene,B/Paris-ch/1991/}) 33. d5 $6 Nxe3 (33... exd5 $14 34. Nf3 $5 {Ribli} Re6 {Ribli} 35. Qh8+ $10 Kg6 $5 {Ribli} 36. g4 {Ribli} Nxe3 $14 37. Nh4+ $2 Kg5 38. Qxg7+) 34. Nf3 Nxc4 35. Qh8+ Kg6 {h8} 36. Nh4+ $5 {Ribli} Kh5 $5 37. Qxg7) 31... Rc8 32. Ne5 Rdc7 (32... Rdd8 33. Ra7 $44) 33. Rb4 (33. Qd3 Nd7 34. Bf4) 33... Nd7 34. Nxd7 (34. c5 $19 Rxc5 35. Nxd7 (35. dxc5 $16 Nxe5 $6) 35... Rc3 36. Qa4 $14 Nxe3 37. fxe3 $17 Qf3) 34... Rxd7 35. d5 (35. c5 {h8+h3} Qf3 (35... Qe4 36. cxb6 $13 Nxd4 $2) 36. cxb6 Nxg3) 35... Nxe3 $19 36. Qxe3 exd5 {e2} 37. Rxb6 Qa8 {gxf2} 38. cxd5 Rxd5 39. Qb3 (39. Rb2 $13 Ra5 40. Ree2 Ra3 41. Qf4 Ra4 42. Qd2 $5 Rd4) 39... Re5 40. Rd1 Re2 41. a4 (41. Rb7 Qxa2) 41... Qe4 $6 42. Rb8 Rxb8 43. Qxb8+ Kh7 44. Qb3 (44. Qb1 $19 Qxb1 45. Rxb1 {f2+/f3+} Ra2 $17 {Ribli} 46. Rb4 g5 $13) (44. Qb5 Qf3 $19 45. Rf1 g6 $40 46. a5 $5 {Ribli} Ra2 47. a6 Qf6) 44... Qf5 45. Rf1 Rd2 (45... Qxh3 46. Qd3+) 46. h4 h5 47. Qb6 Ra2 48. Qd4 Qg4 49. Qd5 (49. Qd3+ f5 (49... g6 50. Qd5 {Ribli})) 49... Rxa4 50. Qxf7 Qg6 $17 51. Qe7 Re4 52. Qd8 Re2 53. Rc1 $19 Qf5 54. Qd4 Qe4 0-1

