1. e4 {Notes by Judit Polgar} e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. e5 b6 5. a3 Bf8 6. Nf3 (6. b4 c5 7. Rb1 Nc6 8. Bb5 Bd7 9. Nge2 Nxd4 10. Nxd4 cxd4 11. Bxd7+ Qxd7 12. Ne2 Ne7 13. O-O Rc8 14. Bb2 Nc6) 6... Ne7 7. h4 (7. b4 c5 8. Bg5 a6 9. bxc5 bxc5 10. dxc5 h6 11. Bd2 Nd7 12. Bd3 Nc6 13. Qe2 Nxc5) 7... h6 (7... h5 8. Bg5 Ba6 9. Bxa6 Nxa6 10. O-O Qd7 11. Qd3 Nb8 12. Ne2 Nbc6 13. c4 dxc4 14. Qxc4 Nd5 15. Rac1) (7... c5 8. Ne2 (8. Bg5) 8... Ba6 9. c3) 8. b4 (8. h5 a5 9. Bb5+ {Lobron,E-Polgar,J/TV-match/Cologne/1989/} c6 10. Ba4 Nd7 11. Ne2 b5 12. Bb3 c5 13. c3 Nc6 14. O-O Qc7 15. Re1 c4 16. Bc2 Nb6) 8... c5 9. Bd3 {A popular manouver nowdays} (9. bxc5 bxc5 10. Nb5 Nf5 11. dxc5 Bxc5 12. c4 Bb7) 9... Nec6 10. b5 (10. O-O Nxd4 11. Nxd4 cxd4 12. Bb5+ Bd7 13. Qxd4 Bxb5 14. Nxb5 Nc6) (10. h5 Nxd4 11. Nxd4 cxd4 12. Ne2 a5 {Hansen,LB-Schussler,H/Vejstrup/1989/ played in the same round and black was fine} 13. b5 Bc5 14. Bb2 Qg5) 10... Nxd4 11. Nxd4 $14 cxd4 12. Ne2 a6 (12... Nd7 13. f4 Nc5 14. Nxd4) (12... Qc7 13. f4 $13 {Gelfand,B-Polgar,Zsu/New York op/1989/  CBM 12} a6 14. Bb2) 13. Bb2 (13. Nxd4 Qc7) (13. bxa6 Bxa6) 13... axb5 14. Bxb5+ (14. Nxd4 b4) 14... Bd7 15. Nxd4 (15. Bd3 Nc6 $16 16. f4 Bc5 17. h5) 15... Bc5 (15... Bxb5 16. Nxb5 Ra4) 16. Bd3 Bxd4 (16... O-O $2) 17. Bxd4 Nc6 $5 18. Bb2 $6 { 18.bd5} Ra4 19. c4 $6 (19. Qh5 g6 20. Bxg6 fxg6 21. Qxg6+ Kf8 22. Rh3 Rf4 $16 23. Bc1 Nxe5) 19... dxc4 $1 $10 (19... Ne7) 20. Bc2 (20. Qxa4 Nxe5 $19 21. Qc2 Nxd3+ 22. Kf1 $14 O-O) 20... Ra5 21. Qg4 Kf8 $1 (21... O-O 22. Qe4 g6 23. h5 Qg5 24. hxg6 $1 $19 Nxe5 $2 25. gxf7+ Rxf7) (21... g6 $44 22. Bxg6 Rg8 { ...h3, ...g5}) 22. O-O $2 {Anything else would have been better} Ne7 $5 {22...h6} (22... Nxe5 $6 23. Qg3 $1 f6 24. Rad1) 23. Bc3 $8 Rd5 24. Be4 Bc6 $1 $17 25. Bxd5 Bxd5 $1 26. Rfd1 Nc6 { ...b5} (26... Kg8 27. Qxc4 $19) (26... Qc7 $1) 27. Rxd5 exd5 $2 (27... Qxd5 28. Rd1 Qb5 29. Rd6) 28. Rd1 h5 29. Qf3 Rh6 30. Rxd5 Qe7 31. Rb5 {White had only 5 minutes for 9 moves left.} Kg8 32. Rxb6 Qxa3 $2 33. Rb7 Qf8 34. Rc7 Qe8 35. Qf5 $1 Re6 36. Qxh5 (36. f4 g6 37. Qe4 Ne7) 36... Nxe5 37. Qf5 Nc6 (37... f6) 38. h5 { 39.c3} Rd6 $1 39. Qg4 Ne5 40. Qg3 Rd5 41. h6 $1 (41. f4 Rd1+ $13 42. Kh2 $1 Rd3 43. Qg5 (43. Qe1 Ng4+) 43... Nf3+ 44. gxf3 Qe2+ 45. Qg2 Qxg2+ 46. Kxg2 $19 Rxc3) 41... Ng6 $1 (41... g6 42. h7+ Kxh7 43. Qh3+ {Judit Polgar} Kg7 $2 (43... Kg8 44. Rc8) 44. f4 $1 $17) 42. Qxg6 $5 {42.f2!} (42. hxg7 Rd3 43. Qg4 Rxc3 $1 44. Rc8 Qxc8 45. Qxc8+ Kxg7) (42. Qxg6 fxg6 $1 43. Rxg7+ Kf8 44. Bb4+) 1/2-1/2

