1. c4 {Notes by Judit Polgar} e5 2. Nc3 c5 3. g3 Nc6 4. Bg2 g6 5. a3 (5. Nf3 Bg7 6. d3 Nge7 7. Nd2 (7. Bg5 O-O 8. O-O h6 9. Bxe7 Nxe7 10. Nd2 d6 11. Rb1 Rb8 12. a3 Be6 13. Qa4 a6 14. Rfc1) 7... d6 8. Nf1 Be6 9. Ne3 O-O 10. O-O Rb8 11. Rb1 a6 12. Ned5 b5 13. b3 Qd7) 5... a5 6. Nf3 Bg7 {One of L.B.Hansen's pet lines} 7. d3 Nge7 {7...g6 is more usual} 8. Nd2 (8. O-O d6 9. Rb1 Rb8 10. Nd5 O-O 11. Bg5 f6 12. Bd2 Be6 13. Ne1 b5 14. Nc2 f5 15. b3) 8... d6 9. Nf1 Be6 10. Ne3 O-O 11. Ned5 Rb8 12. O-O h6 (12... f5 13. Bg5 h6 14. Bxe7 Nxe7 15. Nxe7+ Qxe7 16. Bd5) 13. Rb1 Kh7 14. Bd2 f5 {14...g8!?  h6} 15. b4 $1 axb4 $8 16. axb4 cxb4 17. Nxb4 f4 (17... Nxb4 18. Rxb4 d5 19. cxd5 Nxd5 20. Rb5 Nxc3 21. Bxc3 Qc7 22. Qa1) 18. Ncd5 Nd4 19. Bc3 (19. Nxe7 $16 {Nunn,J-Hansen,LB/Lugano/1989/   TD 1989/1} Qxe7 20. Nc2) 19... Nef5 $1 20. Nc2 Nxc2 21. Qxc2 h5 22. e4 $5 {against 22...ab8 23.c7 hc8} Nh4 23. f3 (23. gxh4 f3) 23... Nxg2 24. Qxg2 $6 (24. Kxg2 Qc8) 24... Qc8 $1 {× e4} 25. gxf4 Bxd5 (25... Bh3 26. Qg5 {8...c5!?} Bxf1 27. f5) 26. exd5 Rxf4 27. Rb5 $5 {Start of an interesting plan} Ra8 (27... Qf5 28. Qe2 e4 29. Bxg7 exf3 30. Qe7 Qg4+ 31. Kf2 Qg2+ $13 {Lgumina-Hansen,LB/Lugano/1989/  TD 1989/1} 32. Ke1 Rf7) 28. Bb4 Ra6 29. Kh1 Qa8 30. Rg1 Rf6 $8 31. f4 Ra2 32. Qg5 $1 Ra1 $4 {Black overlooks a pretty combination in a heavy timetrouble} (32... Qc8 33. fxe5 (33. f5 Qxf5 34. Qxf5 Rxf5 35. Bxd6 Rff2 36. Rd1 Rxh2+ $10 37. Kg1 h4 38. Rxb7 h3 39. Rxg7+ Kh6) 33... Qh3 $1 34. Qg3 Qxg3 35. Rxg3 Rf1+ 36. Rg1 Rff2 {/}) 33. fxe5 $3 {Judit Polgar} Rxg1+ (33... dxe5 $14 34. Bc5) 34. Qxg1 dxe5 35. Rb6 Rxb6 36. Qxb6 Qa1+ 37. Qg1 Qb2 38. Qe1 e4 39. dxe4 $13 Be5 40. Bd2 Qc2 41. Qe3 g5 $10 42. Qe2 Kg6 (42... Kg7 $10 43. Qe3) 43. Qe3 Kf7 44. Qf3+ (44. Qe2 g4) 44... Kg7 45. Qe3 Kh7 46. Qf3 Kg8 47. Qxh5 Qxe4+ 48. Kg1 Bd4+ 49. Kf1 Bf6 $10 50. Qe2 Qh1+ 1-0

