rsuch einer besseren Verteidigung:} (59... Kg7 $1 {Hecht} 60. Rf6 (60. e6 Kf8 61. Ra7 Rd6 (61... Rb4 62. Rf7+ Ke8 63. Rf6 Ke7 64. Rxg6 Ra4 65. Kg3 (65. Rf6 Rb4 66. Rf4 Rxf4+ 67. Kxf4 Kxe6 68. Kg4 Kf7 69. Kh5 Kg7 $10) 65... Re4 $10) 62. e7+ (62. Rf7+ Ke8 63. Rf6 Ke7 64. Rxg6 Rxe6 65. Rxe6+ Kxe6 $10) 62... Kf7 63. Ke4 Rd1 $10 (63... Re6+ 64. Kd5 Rxe7 65. Rxe7+ Kxe7 66. Ke5 $18)) 60... Rd1 61. Ke4 Re1+ 62. Kd5 Rg1 (62... Rd1+ 63. Ke6 Rg1 64. Rf7+ Kg8 65. Ra7 Rxg5 66. Kf6 Rg1 (66... Rf5+ 67. Kxg6 $18 {Gewiin für Weiß in 9 Zügen (ENDSPIEL-CD)}) 67. e6 Rf1+ 68. Kxg6 Kf8 69. Rf7+ Rxf7 70. exf7 $18) 63. Kd6 Rxg5 64. Rf1 Rg2 $10) 60. Rf6+ Kg7 61. e6 {Oder Remis? - Analyse!} Rd1 62. Rf7+ Kg8 63. Ke4 Rg1 64. Rf3 Re1+ 65. Kd5 Kg7 66. Rf7+ Kg8 67. Kd6 1-0

