1. e4 {Fritz5} c5 2. c3 d5 3. exd5 Qxd5 4. d4 Nf6 5. Nf3 Bg4 6. Nbd2 Nc6 7. Bc4 Bxf3 8. Qb3 (8. Qxf3 {Fritz 5.00ß (30s)} Qxf3 9. Nxf3 cxd4 10. Nxd4 (10. cxd4 $11 {Fritz 5.00ß (30s)}) 10... Nxd4 11. cxd4 e6 12. Bb5+ Kd8 13. Bg5 Be7 14. Bc4 Nd7 15. Bd2 Rc8 16. Bb3 Nf6 17. Bg5 Kc7 18. O-O Rhd8 19. Rfd1 Kb8 20. Rab1 Rc7 21. Bxf6 Bxf6 22. d5 exd5 23. Rxd5 Rxd5 24. Bxd5 Rc2 25. Bxf7 Bd4 26. Rf1 Rxb2 27. g4 g5 28. Kg2 Kc7 29. Kg3 b5 30. h3 Be5+ 31. Kf3 Rb4 32. Rd1 Rf4+ 33. Kg2 Rxf7 {0-1 De Kleuver,E-Kadimova,I/EU-chTW 1997/EXP 57/[NED - AZE]}) (8. gxf3 {Fritz 5.00ß (30s)} Qg5 (8... Qf5 9. Qb3 O-O-O 10. Bxf7 Nd5 11. Bxd5 Rxd5 12. dxc5 e6 13. O-O Ne5 14. Qa4 Bxc5 15. Qe4 Qh5 16. f4 Qg4+ 17. Kh1 Nd3 18. Qf3 {Feoktistov,A-Belov,V/RUS-Cup2 1996/EXP 56/½-½ (30)}) 9. Ne4 Qf5 10. Qe2 e6 11. Ng3 Qh3 12. d5 Nd8 13. Bb5+ Nd7 14. Bf4 a6 15. Bxd7+ Kxd7 16. O-O-O Ke8 17. Rhe1 Be7 {Adams,M-Huebner,R/Wijk 1996/CBM 51/[Blatny,P]/1-0 (31)}) 8... Na5 (8... Bxg2 {Fritz 5.00ß (30s)} 9. Rg1 (9. Bxd5 Bxd5 10. Qb5 Bxh1 $17) 9... Na5 10. Qa4+ Qd7 11. Qxa5 $17) 9. Bxd5 (9. Qb5+ {Fritz 5.00ß (30s)} Qd7 10. Nxf3 Nxc4 11. Qxc4 cxd4 12. Nxd4 e6 $11) 9... Nxb3 10. Nxf3 (10. Bxb3 $142 {Fritz 5.00ß (30s)} Bxg2 11. Ba4+ Nd7 12. Bxd7+ Kxd7 13. Rg1 $15) 10... Nxd5 {gibt den Vorteil aus der Hand} (10... Nxa1 {Fritz 5.00ß (30s)} 11. Bxb7 Rd8 12. Bc6+ Nd7 $17 13. Ne5 cxd4) 11. axb3 cxd4 12. Nxd4 e5 13. Nf5 a6 14. Ke2 O-O-O 15. Rd1 f6 {Deckt g5} 16. b4 (16. c4 {Fritz 5.00ß (30s)} Nc7 $11) 16... g6 17. Ne3 Nxe3 (17... Nf4+ {Fritz 5.00ß (30s)} 18. Kf3 $15) 18. Bxe3 ({Und nicht} 18. fxe3 {Fritz 5.00ß (30s)} Rxd1 19. Kxd1 e4 $15) 18... Rxd1 19. Rxd1 { bessere schwarze Bauernstruktur; Bildung eines Mittelfreibauern. Gute weiße Verteidigung mit aktivem Turm.} Kc7 20. Kd3 Bd6 21. Kc4 Kc6 22. Kb3 Rd8 23. g4 Bc7 24. Rg1 Rd3 25. Rg3 e4 26. Rh3 Rd7 27. Bd4 Rf7 28. Re3 Kd5 29. h3 Be5 30. Bc5 f5 31. Re1 Kc6 32. gxf5 gxf5 33. f3 Bg3 34. Rg1 Bd6 35. fxe4 fxe4 36. Bd4 Rf3 37. Rg4 Bf4 38. Kc2 Rf1 39. Rg7 Rh1 (39... h5 {Fritz 5.00ß (30s)} 40. Rh7 $14) 40. Rxh7 Rh2+ 41. Kd1 (41. Kb3 $5 $14 {Fritz 5.00ß (30s) ist zu beachten}) 41... Rd2+ 42. Ke1 Rxb2 43. Re7 Kd5 44. Rxb7 Kc4 {Aktiver König im Endspiel} 45. Re7 Kd3 46. Rd7 Bd2+ 47. Kf1 e3 (47... Bxc3 {Fritz 5.00ß (30s)} 48. Be5+ Kc2 49. Rc7 Rb1+ 50. Ke2 Re1+ 51. Kf2 e3+ 52. Kg2 $18) 48. Bg7+ Kc2 49. Re7 Rb1+ 50. Kg2 Kd3 {Droht e2} 51. Bh6 Re1 {Will e2 spielen} 52. h4 (52. Rd7+ {Fritz 5.00ß (30s)} Kxc3 53. Bg5 Kc4 $11 (53... Kxb4 $2 {ist ein Schlag ins Wasser} 54. Rxd2 Kc4 55. Ra2 $18)) 52... Bxc3 53. Rd7+ Kc4 (53... Ke2 {Fritz 5.00ß (30s)} 54. Rd6 $15) 54. h5 (54. Kf3 $142 $11 {Fritz 5.00ß (30s) ist noch spielbar}) 54... e2 55. Re7 Bd4 (55... Bxb4 $5 56. Re4+ Kb3 (56... Kd5 57. Rxb4 $2 (57. Re8 a5 $2 (57... Bc3 58. Bg5 {[%cal Rg5h4]} Bd4 59. Bh4 $2 (59. Bd2 $1 Rg1+ 60. Kf3 $11) 59... Rg1+ 60. Kh2 Rg4 61. Be1 (61. Kh3 Rxh4+ 62. Kxh4 Be5 $19) 61... Re4 $17) 58. Bg7 {[%cal Rh5h6,Rh6h7,Rh7h8]}) 57... Rg1+ $19) (56... Kd3 {Fritz 5.00ß (30s)} 57. Re3+ (57. Rxb4 $4 {Weiß muß den Läufer stehen lassen} Rg1+ 58. Kxg1 e1=Q+ 59. Kg2 Qxb4 $19) 57... Kc2 58. Kf2 $17) 57. Rxb4+ Kxb4 58. Bd2+ $18) (55... Kxb4 56. Re4+ Kb3 57. Kf2 Rh1 58. Kxe2 Rxh5 59. Bf8 $15) 56. Be3 Rf1 57. Bxd4 e1=Q 58. Rxe1 Rxe1 59. Bg7 Re4 60. Kg3 Re1 (60... Re7 $5 {Fritz 5.00ß (30s)} 61. h6 Rf7 $15 (61... Kxb4 $4 {das Schlagen des Bauern ist schlecht} 62. Bf8 $18)) 61. Kg2 Re4 (61... Re7 {Fritz 5.00ß (30s)} 62. h6 $15) 1/2-1/2

