{Polgars choice, 4.d4 and 5.xc6, against Ivanchuks surprice 3. - f5 is not White's most ambitious. Ivanchuk tries a new move that results in an even ending.} 1. e4 {Wedberg} e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 f5 4. d4 fxe4 5. Bxc6 dxc6 (5... bxc6 6. Nxe5 Nf6 7. Bg5 (7. O-O Bb7 8. Qe2 d5 9. Bg5 Be7 10. f3 O-O 11. Bxf6 Bxf6 12. fxe4 dxe4 13. c3 Qd5 14. Nd2 c5 $15 {0-1 Brunner,M-Pennekamp,M/Weihnachts Open-B 1996/EXP 56 (19)}) 7... Bb7 8. O-O Be7 9. Nc3 O-O 10. Qe2 Qe8 11. h3 d6 12. Ng4 Nxg4 13. Qxg4 Bxg5 14. Qxg5 d5 15. Nd1 Bc8 $13 {Mortensen,E-Saavedra,C/Novi Sad olm 1990/TD 90\06/½-½ (43)}) 6. Nxe5 Bf5 $146 (6... Qh4 7. O-O (7. Qe2 Be6 8. O-O O-O-O 9. Be3 Bd6 10. Nd2 Nf6 11. f4 exf3 12. Ndxf3 Qh5 13. Rae1 Rhe8 $15 {½-½ Stean,M-O'Kelly de Galway,A/London 1973/MCL 05 (23)}) (7. Nc3 Nf6 8. h3 (8. Qe2 Bb4 9. Qc4 Bxc3+ 10. bxc3 Nd5 11. Ba3 {1-0 Marco,G-Trenchard,H/Wien ;HCL 01-33 1898 (22)} Qg5 $1 $13) 8... Nd5 9. O-O Nxc3 10. bxc3 Bd6 11. Qe1 Bxe5 12. dxe5 Bf5 13. c4 c5 14. Qe3 b6 15. f4 h5 16. Bb2 O-O-O 17. Rad1 {½-½ Short,N-Piket,J/Dortmund 1995/CBM 48/[Survey]}) 7... Nf6 8. f3 Bd6 9. Qe1 Qh5 10. Nc3 Bxe5 11. dxe5 Qxe5 12. Nxe4 O-O 13. Nxf6+ Qxf6 14. c3 {½-½ Rellstab,L-Tolush,A/EU-chT Wien\Baden 1957/EU-chT}) (6... Nf6 7. Bg5 Be7 (7... Bf5 8. O-O h6 9. Bh4 g5 10. Bg3 h5 11. h4 Ng4 12. Nc3 gxh4 13. Bf4 Qf6 $13 {1-0 Mortensen,E-Sylvan,J/Copenhagen op 1993/EXT 93op (20)}) 8. Nc3 O-O 9. O-O Bf5 10. Ne2 h6 11. Ng3 Bh7 12. Be3 Bd6 13. Qe2 Qe7 $11 {Sasaki,K-Handoko,E/ASIA-chT 1993/EXT 93b/0-1 (73)}) 7. O-O (7. Qh5+ g6 8. Nxg6 $2 Bxg6 9. Qe5+ Kf7 10. Qxh8 Bg7 $19) 7... Bd6 8. Qh5+ g6 9. Qe2 Qh4 10. Nc3 Nf6 11. f3 Bxe5 12. dxe5 exf3 13. Rxf3 Qd4+ 14. Kh1 (14. Qf2 Qxf2+ 15. Rxf2 Nd7 (15... Ne4 16. Nxe4 Bxe4 17. Bg5 h6 18. Bf6 O-O 19. Re1 Bd5 20. e6 $16) 16. Bg5 O-O 17. Re1 Rae8 $11) 14... Ne4 15. Nxe4 Qxe4 16. Rf2 Qxe2 17. Rxe2 Bg4 18. Re1 Rf8 19. Kg1 Be6 20. Bg5 a5 21. a3 Rf5 22. Bf6 Rf4 23. Rad1 b5 24. c3 b4 25. axb4 axb4 26. cxb4 (26. Ra1 Rxa1 27. Rxa1 bxc3 28. bxc3 Kd7 $11) 26... Rxb4 27. Rd2 Ra2 28. Rd8+ Kf7 29. Re2 Rbxb2 30. Rxb2 Rxb2 31. Rh8 $11 h5 32. Rh7+ Kf8 33. Rxc7 Rc2 34. Re7 Bd5 35. e6 Re2 (35... Rxg2+ 36. Kf1 Rxh2 37. Rf7+ Ke8 38. Re7+ Kf8 39. Rf7+ $11) 36. Rf7+ Ke8 37. Re7+ Kf8 1/2-1/2

