1. e4 {Ftacnik Donev Karpov doesn't usually do this but Judit had fended off both Ivanchuk and Gelfand in earlier rounds with the King's Indian (she was better when she agreed draws)and Anatoly decides it's time for a change} c5 2. c3 {Good psychology! Judit had showed herself vulnerable against this.} e6 3. d4 d5 4. exd5 exd5 5. Nf3 Nc6 6. Bb5 c4 $2 {This releases the tension too early. Black should play 6...d6} (6... Bd6 {Ftacnik} 7. dxc5 Bxc5 8. O-O Nge7) 7. Ne5 Qb6 (7... Bd7 {Ftacnik} 8. Bxc6 Bxc6 9. O-O Bd6 10. Qg4 $1 $36) 8. Bxc6+ (8. Qa4 $1 Nge7 (8... Bd7 9. Nxd7 Kxd7 10. O-O (10. b3 a6 11. bxc4 $2 Re8+ $1) (10. Bxc6+ Qxc6 $10) 10... a6 11. Bxc6+ Qxc6 12. Qd1 $1 $14) 9. b3 $14 (9. b3 {Ftacnik} a6 10. bxc4 $1 $16)) 8... bxc6 9. O-O Bd6 10. b3 cxb3 11. axb3 Ne7 12. Ba3 Bxe5 $6 (12... c5 $1 $14) (12... Bxa3 {Ftacnik} 13. Rxa3 (13. Nxa3 O-O 14. Re1 Bf5 $14) 13... O-O 14. Re1 $16) 13. dxe5 Be6 $6 (13... c5 $1 14. b4 {Ftacnik} c4 15. b5 $1 $36) 14. Qd4 $1 $16 {× c5 } Nf5 (14... Qxb3 {Ftacnik} 15. Nd2 Qb6 16. Rfb1 $40) 15. Qc5 h5 (15... Qxc5 {Ftacnik} 16. Bxc5 a5 17. Nd2 { g4}) 16. Nd2 f6 $2 (16... Kd7 17. Bb4 Rhb8 $16) 17. exf6 gxf6 18. Bb4 $1 (18. Qxb6 {Ftacnik} axb6 19. Bc5 $1 Kf7 20. Bxb6 $16) 18... Kf7 19. Ra4 Qxc5 20. Bxc5 a6 21. f3 $18 h4 (21... Rhg8 $16 {Ftacnik}) 22. Rfa1 Bc8 23. Kf2 (23. Rb4 {Ftacnik} Re8 24. Kf2 a5 25. Rb6 Ba6 $132) 23... Rb8 24. b4 Re8 25. Nb3 Bb7 26. Na5 (26. Ba7 {Ftacnik} Ra8 27. Bb6 Nd6 $16) 26... Ba8 27. R4a2 Re6 28. Ba7 $1 Rb5 (28... Rbe8 29. Nb3 Bb7 (29... Re5 {Donev} 30. Nc5 Re3 31. Rc1 h3 32. g3 d4 33. Ne4 $1 $16) 30. Nc5 {Ftacnik} R6e7 31. Nxb7 Rxb7 32. Bc5 $1 $16 (32. Rxa6 d4 $1 $132)) 29. Nb3 Bb7 30. g4 $1 hxg3+ 31. hxg3 Re8 32. g4 Nd6 33. Nd4 1-0

