1. c4 Nf6 2. Nc3 c5 3. g3 Nc6 4. Bg2 e6 5. Nf3 d5 6. cxd5 exd5 7. d4 Bg4 8. Ne5 cxd4 9. Nxc6 bxc6 10. Qxd4 Be7 11. Bg5 Be6 12. O-O O-O 13. Qd3 (13. Rfd1 Re8 14. b4 Qb6 $11) 13... h6 14. Bf4 Qb6 15. Na4 {Psakhis plays with the hope of getting control of the c5 square.} (15. b3 Rfe8 16. Rac1 Qa5 $13) 15... Qa5 16. b3 c5 17. Rac1 (17. Bd2 Qd8 18. Rac1 c4 19. bxc4 dxc4 20. Qc2 Rc8 21. Rfd1 $11) 17... c4 18. Qd4 Rac8 19. Be5 Rfd8 20. Rfd1 (20. e3 Bf5 21. Nc3 Bd3 22. Rfd1 $11) 20... Qa6 21. Bf3 (21. e3 Ng4 22. Bxg7 f6 23. f3 Nxe3 24. Qxe3 Kxg7 25. Bh3 Rc6 26. Bxe6 Rxe6 27. Qf4 $11) 21... Bf5 22. Qb2 (22. e3 Be4 $15) 22... Bd7 $1 23. Bxf6 (23. Nc3 $2 Ba3 $17) 23... Bxf6 24. Qa3 d4 {White is clearly fighting the dangeorus position as black central pawn seem pretty strong.} 25. Qb4 (25. Kg2 Rc7 26. Kg1 Rb8 $19) 25... Bxa4 26. Qxa4 (26. bxa4 Qe6 27. a5 Rc7 $17) 26... Qxa4 27. bxa4 d3 (27... Rc7 28. Rc2 Kf8 29. Rdc1 c3 30. Rb1 Ke7 $17) 28. exd3 c3 29. d4 $6 (29. Be4 Bd4 30. Rc2 g6 $15) 29... Bxd4 30. Kf1 (30. Rc2 Kf8 $17) 30... Rb8 31. Be2 Kf8 32. Rc2 Ke7 33. Bc4 Rb2 34. Bb3 Be5 35. Rxd8 (35. Re2 Rxd1+ 36. Bxd1 Kd6 $19) 35... Kxd8 36. Rxb2 (36. f4 Bf6 37. Ke2 Ke7 38. Kd3 g6 39. h3 $17) 36... cxb2 {[%mdl 4096] The defender must have hoped for qood survival chances with bishops on different colour of squares, but the need to protect b1 square is tying his hands.} 37. Bc2 h5 38. h3 g5 39. g4 $2 (39. Ke2 $5 Ke7 40. Kd3 f5 (40... Kd6 41. Ke4 g4 42. hxg4 hxg4 43. Kf5 Bd4 44. Kxg4 Bxf2 45. Kf3 $15) 41. Bb1 Ke6 42. a5 Bc7 43. Kc2 g4 44. hxg4 hxg4 45. Kxb2 Bxa5 46. Kc2 Be1 47. f3 gxf3 48. Kd3 Bxg3 49. Ke3 f2 50. Ke2 $15) 39... h4 $1 40. Ke2 Kc7 41. Kd3 Kd6 42. Ke4 f6 43. Bb1 Kc5 44. Kd3 Bd4 (44... f5 45. f3 (45. gxf5 g4 46. Ke2 gxh3 47. Kf1 Kb4 $19) 45... fxg4 46. fxg4 Kb4 47. Bc2 Ka3 48. Bb1 a5 49. Kc2 Kxa4 50. Kd3 $11) 45. f3 Kd5 46. a5 Ke5 $1 {Polgar is targetting h3 pawn and it can not be defended.} 47. a6 Bb6 48. Kc2 (48. Bc2 Kf4 49. Ke2 Kg3 $19) 48... Kf4 49. Kxb2 Kg3 50. Bf5 Kxh3 51. f4 (51. Kc2 Kg3 52. Be4 h3 53. f4 gxf4 $19) 51... Kg2 52. fxg5 fxg5 53. Be4+ Kg1 0-1

