1. c4 e6 2. Nf3 d5 3. b3 Be7 4. Bb2 Bf6 5. Qc2 Bxb2 6. Qxb2 Nf6 7. g3 O-O 8. Bg2 c5 9. O-O b6 (9... Nc6 10. cxd5 Nxd5 11. Rd1 $5 (11. Nc3 Qf6 12. Rac1 (12. Rab1 Nxc3 13. Qxc3 Qxc3 14. dxc3 Bd7 15. Rfd1 Rfd8 16. Ng5 Be8 17. Ne4 Rxd1+ 18. Rxd1 b6 19. f4 Rd8 20. Rxd8 Nxd8 21. Nd6 Bd7 22. Kf2 {1/2 Hickl,J (2575)-Novikov,I (2601)/Saint Vincent/1999/}) 12... b6 13. Rfd1 Bb7 14. d4 Nxc3 15. Qxc3 Rfd8 16. e3 cxd4 17. Nxd4 Nxd4 18. Rxd4 Rxd4 19. Qxd4 Qxd4 20. exd4 Rc8 $11 {1/2,Bricard,E (2485)-Marciano,D (2455)/Paris/1995/}) 11... Bd7 (11... b6 12. d4 Ba6 $5 $132) 12. Na3 Qe7 13. d4 cxd4 14. Nxd4 Nxd4 15. Rxd4 Bc6 16. Nc4 Nb4 17. Rad1 Rfd8 18. R4d2 h6 19. a3 Bxg2 20. Kxg2 Nc6 21. Nd6 $1 $36 {Hickl,J (2540)-Rabiega,R (2525)/GER-ch Bremen/1998/}) 10. cxd5 exd5 $5 {Black is willing to accept the potentially weak hanging , for this she can freely develop her forces.} (10... Nxd5 11. d4 (11. Nc3 Bb7 $11) 11... Nd7 $5 $11 {/} (11... cxd4 12. Nxd4 Bb7 13. Nc3 $14)) 11. d4 Bb7 12. Nc3 Nbd7 (12... Qe7 13. Rfd1 Na6 $5 {[%cal Ya6c7,Yc7e6] c7-e6}) 13. Rfd1 Qe7 14. Rac1 ({Probably this was the right moment for} 14. dxc5 $5 bxc5 (14... Nxc5 15. Nd4 $14) 15. Ne1 Nb6 16. Qa3 $1 Rab8 17. e3 $14 {[%csl Rc5,Rd5][%cal Ya1c1,Ye1d3] ac1,d3 and the  are under unpleasant pressure.}) 14... Rfd8 15. e3 Rac8 16. Rc2 (16. dxc5 bxc5 17. Qa3 a6 18. Ne1 Nf8 $132) 16... h6 17. Rdc1 Ba6 18. Bh3 Rb8 19. Rd1 (19. Qa3 Bd3 20. Rd2 Be4 $13) 19... Bb7 20. Ne2 Re8 21. Bg2 Ne4 22. Nf4 Ndf6 $132 {Black has restored the harmony in his set-up and the position is roughly equal again.} 23. Nd3 Rbc8 24. Nfe5 Ba6 25. Rdc1 Ng4 26. Bh3 (26. h3 Nxe5 (26... Nxe3 27. fxe3 Qg5 28. Nf4 Qxg3 29. Nf3 $14) 27. Nxe5 Kh7 $11 {f6}) (26. Nf4 Nxe5 27. Nxd5 Qd7 28. Bxe4 Bd3 $1 29. dxe5 Bxe4 $36) 26... h5 $5 ({Polgar wants more than} 26... Nxe5 27. Nxe5 Rc7 $11) 27. Nf4 Nxe5 28. dxe5 (28. Bxc8 $2 Nf3+ 29. Kg2 Rxc8 30. Kxf3 Ng5+ 31. Kg2 Qe4+ $19) 28... Rcd8 29. e6 Bc8 $5 (29... d4 30. Bg2 Ng5 31. exf7+ Qxf7 $13) 30. Nxh5 $2 (30. exf7+ Qxf7 31. Bxc8 Rxc8 32. h4 $11) 30... fxe6 31. Bg2 (31. Nf4 e5 $17) 31... e5 $1 $40 {[%csl Gc5,Gd5,Ge5,Rh5] ,פh5} 32. f3 Ng5 33. f4 (33. h4 Nf7 {[%cal Rg7g6] g6-+}) 33... exf4 34. Nxf4 (34. gxf4 Nh3+ 35. Bxh3 Bxh3 36. Rc3 d4 37. exd4 Qh4 38. Ng3 Rxd4 $17 {/-+}) 34... Qxe3+ 35. Kh1 (35. Rf2 Ne4 36. Bxe4 Qxe4 $19) 35... Bg4 $1 36. Rf1 (36. Nxd5 Qe1+ $1 37. Bf1 (37. Rxe1 Rxe1+ 38. Bf1 Rxf1+ 39. Kg2 Bh3#) 37... Bf3+ 38. Rg2 (38. Kg1 Nh3#) 38... Rxd5 39. Rxe1 Rxe1 40. Qf2 Rdd1 $19) 36... d4 $19 37. h3 Bf5 38. Kh2 (38. Rcf2 Ne4 $19) 38... Bxc2 39. Qxc2 d3 40. Qc4+ Kh7 41. h4 Rd4 42. Qb5 Nf7 43. Rf3 d2 $1 44. Rxe3 Rxe3 0-1

