1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. Bg5 dxe4 5. Nxe4 Nbd7 6. Nxf6+ Nxf6 7. Nf3 h6 8. Be3 Nd5 (8... Bd6 9. Bd3 Nd5 10. Bd2 c5 11. dxc5 Bxc5 12. Qe2 a6 13. O-O-O Qc7 14. Kb1 Bd7 15. Ne5 $14 {Lutz,C-Gurevich,M/Belgium 2002}) 9. Bd2 c5 $1 10. Bb5+ (10. Ne5 a6 11. c4 Nf6 12. Bc3 cxd4 13. Qxd4 Qxd4 14. Bxd4 Nd7 15. Bd3 Nxe5 16. Bxe5 Bd7 $11 {Polgar,J-Kortschnoj,V/Enghien les Bains 2003}) (10. dxc5 $6 Bxc5 11. Bd3 Qc7 $11 {and black earned tempo compring to the game Lutz-Gurevich sinc he didn't have to waste time on d6.}) 10... Bd7 11. Bxd7+ (11. Qe2 Bxb5 12. Qxb5+ Qd7 13. Qe2 O-O-O 14. c4 Nf6 15. dxc5 Bxc5 16. O-O Qd3 $11 {Perunovic,M-Kosic,D/Herceg Novi 1999}) 11... Qxd7 12. c4 Nb6 13. Rc1 (13. dxc5 Nxc4 14. Bc3 Qxd1+ 15. Rxd1 Bxc5 16. b3 Nb6 17. Bxg7 Rg8 18. Bxh6 Rxg2 19. Rc1 Nd7 $15) 13... Rc8 (13... cxd4 $2 14. c5 Nd5 15. Ne5 Qb5 16. Qf3 {[%csl Rf7]} Nf6 17. a4 $1 Qa6 (17... Qxb2 18. Nc4 Qa2 19. Qxb7 $18) 18. b4 Rb8 19. Ra1 $16) 14. O-O $6 (14. dxc5 Bxc5 15. O-O O-O 16. b4 Be7 17. c5 Nd5 $11) 14... cxd4 15. Ne5 Qd8 16. Re1 $6 (16. Ba5 Rc5 17. Bxb6 axb6 18. Re1 Bd6 $11 19. Qxd4 $140 $6 Bxe5 20. Qxd8+ Kxd8 21. b4 Bxh2+ 22. Kxh2 Rc6 $17) 16... Bd6 17. Qg4 Qf6 18. Bf4 O-O $17 19. b3 Rfd8 20. Rcd1 Bb8 21. Bg3 Nd7 22. f4 Nxe5 23. fxe5 Qf5 24. Qxf5 exf5 25. Bf2 d3 26. Re3 a6 27. Rexd3 Rxd3 28. Rxd3 Bxe5 29. Bb6 Bc7 30. Bxc7 Rxc7 31. Rd6 Kf8 32. Rd5 g6 33. Rd6 b5 34. cxb5 axb5 35. a4 bxa4 36. bxa4 Rc2 37. a5 Ra2 38. a6 Kg7 39. g3 h5 40. h4 Ra4 41. Kg2 f4 42. gxf4 Rxf4 43. Kg3 Rg4+ 44. Kh3 Ra4 45. Rb6 Ra3+ 46. Kg2 Kf8 47. Rb8+ Ke7 48. Rb6 Rc3 49. Rb8 Ra3 50. Rb6 Kf8 51. Rb8+ Kg7 52. Rb6 Ra5 53. Kg3 Ra1 54. Kh3 Rg1 55. Rb8 Ra1 56. Rb6 f5 57. Rb7+ Kf6 58. Rb6+ Ke5 59. Rxg6 Ke4 60. Rg5 f4 61. Rxh5 Ra3+ 62. Kg2 Rxa6 63. Rb5 Ra2+ 64. Kf1 Kf3 65. Rb3+ Kg4 66. Rc3 f3 1/2-1/2

