1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. Bg5 dxe4 5. Nxe4 Nbd7 6. Nf3 h6 7. Bxf6 {Rare continuation promising white nothing special.} (7. Nxf6+) 7... Nxf6 8. Bd3 Nxe4 9. Bxe4 c5 10. c3 (10. Qe2 Qa5+ 11. c3 cxd4 12. Nxd4 Be7 13. Qb5+ Qxb5 14. Nxb5 O-O 15. O-O-O f5 $11 {Webb,L-King,D/Dublin 1991}) (10. O-O cxd4 11. Nxd4 (11. Ne5 Be7 12. Qf3 O-O 13. Bxb7 Bxb7 14. Qxb7 Qd6 15. Rfe1 Qb4 $15 {Korbut,E-Bistrikova,E/St Petersburg 2001}) 11... Bc5 (11... Be7 12. c3 O-O 13. Qe2 a6 14. Bc2 Bf6 15. Rfd1 $14 {Karaklajic,N-Marinkovic,S/Kladovo 1996}) 12. Nb3 Qxd1 13. Rfxd1 Be7 (13... Bb6 $11) 14. a4 g5 15. g3 $14 {Barthel,B-Sautter,E/Germany 1993}) (10. d5 $5 Qc7 11. Qe2 Be7 12. O-O-O O-O 13. Ne5 Bd6 14. Nc4 exd5 15. Bxd5 Bf4+ 16. Kb1 Be6 17. Bxe6 Rae8 {½-½ Zhelnin,V-Dolmatov,S/Krasnodar 1997/EXT 2000 (17)}) (10. Qd2 cxd4 11. O-O-O Bc5 12. h4 Qb6 13. Ne5 Qc7 14. f4 $36 {Moreno Carnero,J-Prasca Sosa,R/Isla Margarita 1998}) 10... cxd4 11. Qa4+ (11. Ne5 Qc7 12. Qxd4 Bc5 13. Qa4+ Kf8 (13... Bd7 14. Qxd7+ Qxd7 15. Nxd7 Kxd7 16. Bxb7 Rab8 17. Bf3 Rhc8 (17... Rxb2 $4 18. O-O-O+ $18) 18. O-O-O+ Ke7 19. Rd2 $16) 14. Nd3 Bd6 $13) 11... Qd7 $5 (11... Bd7 12. Qxd4 Bc6 13. Bxc6+ bxc6 14. Qa4 {[%csl Rc6]} Qc7 15. O-O Be7 16. Rad1 O-O $11) 12. Qc4 {Inviting Bareev to enter complications after 12...d:c3} Bd6 (12... dxc3 13. Rd1 Bd6 14. Qd4 Bf8 15. Qc4 (15. Qxc3 Qb5 16. a3 Qc5 17. Qd2 Be7 18. Bxb7 Rb8 19. Bxc8 (19. Rc1 Bg5 20. Nxg5 Qe5+ 21. Be4 hxg5 22. Qe3 Bd7 $13) 19... Qxc8 20. O-O O-O $11) 15... Bd6 $11) 13. Qxd4 O-O 14. O-O-O Bf4+ 15. Kb1 Qxd4 16. Nxd4 $14 {Black is still facing some problems with his queenside pieces.} a6 (16... f5 $6 17. Bf3 e5 18. Bd5+ Kh7 19. Ne2 Bg5 20. f4 Bxf4 21. Nxf4 exf4 22. Rhe1 $36 {[%csl Rc8][%cal Ge1e7]}) 17. c4 Bg5 18. Rhe1 (18. c5 Be7 19. Rc1 $14) 18... Be7 19. f4 Rd8 20. Nf3 a5 21. Ne5 $6 ({After correct} 21. Rxd8+ Bxd8 22. c5 Be7 23. Rc1 a4 24. Ne5 $14 {[%csl Rc8][%cal Gc5c6] black's defensive task would have remained pretty tough.}) 21... a4 22. c5 Rxd1+ 23. Rxd1 f6 24. Nd7 (24. Nd3) 24... Bxd7 25. Rxd7 Bxc5 26. Bxb7 Ra7 27. Bc8 (27. Kc2 Kf8 28. Kd3 Be7 $11 29. Kc4 $140 $2 Ke8 30. Rc7 Kd8 31. Rc8+ Kd7 $19) 27... e5 28. fxe5 fxe5 29. Rxa7 Bxa7 30. Kc2 e4 31. Bd7 a3 32. b4 Bd4 33. Kb3 Bb2 34. b5 Kf8 35. b6 Ke7 36. Bc6 e3 37. b7 Be5 38. Bf3 Bxh2 1/2-1/2

