1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 e6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Qb6 5. Nb3 a6 6. Nc3 Qc7 7. Bd3 Nf6 8. O-O b5 9. f4 b4 10. Nb1 Bb7 (10... d6 $5 11. Qe2 Be7 12. N1d2 Nc6 {1/2 Hoffman,M-Horvath,C 1999. Black has got an excellent position.}) (10... d5 $6 {Vlad Nevednichy won two games, so Black has great statistics. After 11.e5 d7 or even 11....e4 we get the French Defence. However, with Black's king stuck in the centre, White has an excellent opportunity to play f5.} 11. e5 $1 Ne4 (11... Nfd7 12. Be3 Nc6 13. N1d2 a5 14. Nf3 a4 15. Nbd4 Nxd4 16. Nxd4 $1 {White has better development, he wants to play f5 or c3 bxc3 c1.} (16. Bxd4 $2 Nc5 $1 $11 17. Kh1 Be7 18. Bb5+ $6 Bd7 19. Bxd7+ Qxd7 20. Bxc5 Bxc5 $15 21. f5 exf5 22. Nd4 Bxd4 23. Qxd4 O-O 24. Qxb4 Rab8 25. Qd4 Rfc8 $17 {0-1 (45) Bilguun,S (2376)-Nevednichy,V (2549) Arad 2015}) 16... g6 17. f5 $5 (17. Kh1 Ba6 18. Bxa6 Rxa6 19. Rc1 a3 20. b3 $1 $16) 17... gxf5 18. Qh5 Qxe5 (18... Nxe5 $2 19. Bb5+) 19. Rae1 f4 20. Qf3 $1 $16) 12. Qe2 (12. Be3 $1 Nd7 13. N1d2 $16) 12... Nc5 13. Nxc5 $2 Bxc5+ 14. Be3 Bxe3+ 15. Qxe3 Qa7 16. Qxa7 Rxa7 17. Nd2 Nc6 18. Nf3 Ke7 $11 {0-1 (31) Van Foreest,J (2519)-Nevednichy,V (2574) Vaujany 2015}) 11. Qe2 (11. e5 Nd5 12. c4 $1 {The only way to fight for an advantage.} (12. Qe2 Nc6 13. c4 (13. N1d2 $2 d6 $2 (13... a5 $1 14. Nc4 a4 15. Nbd2 Nd4 16. Qd1 f5 17. exf6 Nxf6 $15) 14. Nc4 Be7 15. exd6 Bxd6 16. Nxd6+ Qxd6 17. Qf2 O-O 18. Nc5 $14 {1/2 (49) Nijboer,F (2580)-Hoffmann,M (2430) Germany 1998}) 13... bxc3 14. bxc3 d6 15. c4 Ndb4 16. exd6 $2 (16. Be4 dxe5 17. a3 f5 18. Bf3 e4 19. Bh5+ g6 20. axb4 gxh5 21. b5 Nb4 22. Na3 $13) 16... Qxd6 17. Rd1 Nd4 $19 18. Qf1 Nxb3 19. axb3 Qd4+ 20. Qf2 Bc5 {0-1 (20) Kosashvili,Y (2535)-Gofshtein,L (2498) Israel 2002}) 12... bxc3 13. Nxc3 Nxc3 (13... Bc5+ $2 14. Nxc5 Qxc5+ 15. Kh1 (15. Rf2 $1 Nxc3 16. bxc3 Nc6 17. Rb1 Na5 18. c4 O-O 19. Bd2 $18) 15... Nxc3 16. bxc3 O-O 17. Rb1 $16 {1/2 (49) Markantonaki,H (2192)-Sandu,M (2278) Heraklion 2017} (17. Qb3 $1 Qc6 (17... Bd5 18. c4 Bc6 19. Ba3 $18) 18. Qc2 g6 19. Rb1 $18)) (13... Be7 14. Ne4 $2 (14. Nxd5 Bxd5 15. Be3 Nc6 16. Rc1 $14) 14... Nc6 15. Kh1 Ncb4 16. Bb1 Rc8 17. Bd2 O-O $15 {0-1 (25) Milovic,A (2173)-Bojkovic,N (2429) Novi Sad 2009}) 14. bxc3 Nc6 $1 (14... Be7 15. Be3 Nc6 16. Rb1 $1 d6 $2 17. exd6 Bxd6 18. Nc5 Bxc5 19. Bxc5 Ne5 20. Ba3 $18 Nxd3 21. Qxd3 f5 22. Rfe1 Kf7 23. Qd6 {1-0 (23) Cuhendi,S (2406)-Ikeda,J (2398) Budapest 2017}) 15. Qe2 Ne7 $1 16. Ba3 (16. Qf2 Nf5 17. Bd2 (17. g4 $4 Qc6 $19) 17... h5 $13) 16... Ng6 17. Bxf8 Nxf8 $1 18. h4 Ng6 19. h5 Ne7 20. c4 O-O $11) 11... Nc6 12. c4 h5 (12... a5 $1 13. Be3 a4 14. Nd4 Nxd4 15. Bxd4 Bc5 $17) 13. N1d2 a5 14. e5 Ng4 15. Ne4 a4 16. Nbd2 Nd4 17. Qe1 f5 $1 18. exf6 gxf6 $19 19. Nf3 Nxf3+ 20. gxf3 f5 21. fxg4 fxe4 22. Bxe4 Bc5+ 23. Kg2 hxg4 24. a3 b3 25. Bd2 Rh3 26. Qe2 O-O-O 27. Rae1 Rdh8 28. Rh1 Be3 29. Reg1 Bxg1 {0-1 (29) Ye,J (2676)-Polgar,J (2677) Prague 2002 CBM 202 [Sumets, Andrey]} 0-1

