 Ba3 Rxc2 24. Bxc5 b6 25. Bd4 c5 26. Be5 Bxe5 27. Rxe5 Rxc3 $19) 23... Qf8 (23... Rxh2+ 24. Kxh2 Qf2+ 25. Kh3 Qxe1 $19) 24. Rb1 (24. Bd2 $142) 24... b5 (24... Rxh2+ $19) 25. a4 Rf3 26. Qe2 Rf2 27. Qd3 Rxh2+ 28. Kxh2 Qf2+ 29. Kh3 Qxe1 30. axb5 Qxe6+ 31. Kg2 c5 (31... d4 $1 32. cxd4 (32. c4 cxb5 33. Rxb5 Qe1 $19) 32... Qd5+ 33. Kf2 Rf8+ $19) 32. Ba3 c4 33. Qf3 Bb6 34. Rd1 Qe2+ 35. Qxe2 Rxe2+ 36. Kh3 $17 Re5 37. Rf1 Re8 38. Kg4 Rd8 39. Kf5 Kf7 40. Rh1 (40. g6+ $1 hxg6+ 41. Ke5+ Kg8 42. Bd6 $132) 40... d4 $1 41. cxd4 Rxd4 42. Rxh7 Rd5+ 43. Kg4 Kg6 44. Rh8 Rxg5+ 45. Kf4 Rxb5 $19 46. Rc8 Rf5+ (46... Rb3 $1) 47. Ke4 Rg5 48. Bd6 $17 Rh5 49. Rxc4 Rh1 50. Be5 Re1+ 51. Kd5 $11 {[%cal Gc4g4]} Kg5 52. Bxg7 Rd1+ 53. Ke6 Bf2 $4 (53... Re1+ 54. Be5 a5 $11) 54. Bf6+ Kg6 55. Rg4+ Kh5 (55... Kh7 56. Kf7 Rd7+ 57. Be7 Be3 (57... Rd4 58. Rg5 Kh6 59. Rf5 $18) 58. Rh4+ Bh6 59. g4 $18) 56. Rg8 Bxg3 (56... Bd4 57. g4+ Kh6 58. g5+ Kh5 59. Rh8+ Kg4 60. Bxd4 Rxd4 61. g6 $18) 57. Rg5+ Kh6 58. Rxg3 Re1+ 59. Kf7 Kh5 60. Rg5+ Kh6 61. Rg4 Rh1 62. Rg8 1-0

