1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 d6 4. c3 Nf6 5. Qe2 Bd7 6. d4 cxd4 7. cxd4 a6 8. Bxc6 (8. Bd3 e5 9. d5 Nb4 10. Bc4 b5 11. Bb3 a5 12. O-O Be7 13. a4 bxa4 14. Bxa4 Bxa4 15. Rxa4 O-O 16. Nc3 Na6 17. Ra3 Nc5 18. Nd2 {1-0 Conquest,S-Grivas,E/Corfu/1991/ (34)}) (8. Ba4 d5 (8... e5 9. Bxc6 Bxc6 10. Nc3 Qb8 11. O-O Be7 12. Bg5 O-O 13. Rfd1 Re8 14. dxe5 dxe5 15. Bxf6 Bxf6 16. Nd5 Bd8 17. Rac1 a5 18. Rc3 Qa7 {0-1 Nevednichy,V-Tiviakov,S/Ohrid/2001/ (59)}) 9. exd5 Qa5+ 10. Nc3 Nxd5 11. Bd2 Nxc3 12. Bxc6 Bxc6 13. bxc3 e6 14. c4 Bb4 15. d5 Bxd2+ 16. Nxd2 Bd7 17. O-O O-O 18. d6 Rfd8 19. Qe3 Rac8 20. Rfc1 Qc5 {½-½ Cicak,S-Babula,V/CZE 2001/ (43)}) 8... Bxc6 9. d5 (9. Nc3 d5 10. exd5 Nxd5 11. O-O e6 12. Ne5 Be7 (12... Nxc3 13. bxc3 Be7 14. f4 O-O 15. Nxc6 bxc6 16. f5 exf5 17. Rxf5 Qd7 18. Qd3 {1-0 Rahl,V-Petrik,S/SVK/1996/ (72)}) 13. Qg4 Bf6 14. Ne4 Qc7 15. Qh5 Nb4 16. Nxf7 Bxe4 17. Nd6+ Ke7 18. Nxe4 Nc2 19. Ng5 g6 20. Qg4 Nxd4 21. Be3 {1-0 Heintze,M-Domsgen Hoelzlein,C/Halle/1975/ (47)}) 9... Bd7 10. Nc3 g6 (10... e5 11. dxe6 Bxe6 12. O-O Be7 13. Nd4 $14) 11. O-O Bg7 12. Be3 O-O 13. Bd4 {[%mdl 32] Polgar has chosen positional compensation for the opponent's bishop's pair, white pieces have excellent control of the center.} Bg4 (13... Ne8 14. Bxg7 Nxg7 15. Rac1 $14) (13... Rc8 14. Rac1 b5 15. a3 $14) 14. h3 Bxf3 15. Qxf3 Rc8 16. Rac1 b5 17. Qe3 (17. a3 Rc4 18. Rfd1 Qa5 $14) 17... Qd7 (17... b4 18. Ne2 Rxc1 19. Rxc1 e6 20. dxe6 fxe6 21. Qb3 $14) 18. Ne2 e6 19. dxe6 Qxe6 20. f3 Rxc1 $6 {Tiviakov would love to take the pawn, but giving up the c file is too dangerous.} (20... Qxa2 21. Ra1 Qc4 22. Rfc1 (22. Rxa6 Nd5 23. exd5 Rfe8 24. Rc6 Bxd4 25. Qxd4 Qxe2 26. Rfc1 $14) 22... Qe6 23. Rxa6 Rxc1+ 24. Qxc1 $14) 21. Rxc1 Qxa2 22. Rc6 $1 (22. Qc3 Ne8 23. Bxg7 Nxg7 24. Nf4 f5 25. Nd5 fxe4 26. fxe4 h6 $13) 22... Rd8 (22... Ne8 23. Bxg7 Kxg7 24. Qc3+ Kg8 25. Nf4 $40) 23. Qc3 Ne8 (23... Qe6 24. Rxa6 Rc8 25. Qd2 $16) 24. Bxg7 Nxg7 25. Nf4 $1 {The crowning of the white's positional strategy, all white pieces are stronger than their counterparts.} Ne6 (25... Ne8 26. Nd5 a5 27. Ra6 b4 28. Qd4 $16) 26. Qf6 Re8 27. Nd5 a5 (27... Ng7 28. Qc3 $18) 28. Rxd6 Qc4 29. Rd7 Qc5+ 30. Kh2 (30. Kh2 Qf8 31. Ne7+ (31. Qe5 Qg7 32. Nf6+ Kh8 33. Qxe6 Rxe6 34. Rd8+ Qf8 35. Rxf8+ Kg7 36. Nd7 Rd6 37. Rd8 a4 $132) 31... Rxe7 32. Qxe7 $18) 1-0

