1. d4 Nf6 2. Nf3 e6 3. c4 b6 4. a3 Bb7 5. Nc3 d5 6. Bg5 Be7 7. Qa4+ Qd7 8. Qxd7+ Nbxd7 9. Nb5 O-O 10. cxd5 Nxd5 11. Bxe7 Nxe7 12. Nxc7 Rac8 13. Nb5 Rc2 14. Rb1 Be4 15. Ng5 Nf6 16. Nxa7 (16. f3 Bd5 17. Nc3 Bc4 18. Nge4 Nfd5 19. Nd1 Nf5 20. Nd2 Nfe3 21. Nxc4 Nxc4 22. e4 Nde3 {½-½ Delemarre,J-Psakhis,L/Vlissingen 2000/ (27)}) 16... Bg6 $1 (16... Ra8 17. e3 Bg6 18. Nb5 Rac8 19. Be2 Rxe2+ 20. Kxe2 Rc2+ 21. Ke1 h6 22. Nh3 Bd3 23. Nc3 Rxc3 24. bxc3 Bxb1 25. f3 Ne8 26. Kd2 {1-0 Bacrot,E-Gershon,A/Linares op/2001/ (73)}) 17. f3 Rd8 18. e4 (18. e3 $2 Rd5 (18... Nf5 $5) 19. h4 Rc7 20. e4 Rxa7 21. exd5 Bxb1 $15) 18... Rxd4 $2 {Polgar misses the great defense with 21.Rd1!, black can hope for full compensation after the initial 18...h6!} (18... h6 $1 19. Nh3 Rxd4 20. Nf2 Rdd2 21. Nd3 Nfd5 $11) 19. Nb5 Rdd2 20. b4 h6 21. Rd1 $1 (21. Nh3 Nd7 22. Rd1 Rxd1+ 23. Kxd1 Ra2) 21... Rxd1+ 22. Kxd1 Ra2 23. Nh3 Nd7 (23... Nc6 24. Nf4 Kh7 25. Ne2 $16) 24. Kc1 (24. Nf4 Ne5 25. Kc1 N7c6 26. Kb1 Rf2 27. Nxg6 Nxg6 28. Nd6 Nd4 $132) 24... Ne5 25. Kb1 Rd2 26. Kc1 Ra2 27. Kb1 Rd2 28. Nc3 f5 (28... Rd8 29. Kc1 $16) 29. Kc1 Rd8 30. Nf4 Bf7 (30... fxe4 $2 31. Nxg6 N7xg6 32. Nxe4 $16) 31. Bb5 Rc8 32. Kb2 {Karpov has consolidated the position and now has to manage the technical part.} fxe4 33. fxe4 (33. Nxe4 $5 Nd5 34. Nd6 Rd8 35. Nxf7 Kxf7 36. Rd1 $16) 33... Be8 34. Bxe8 Rxe8 35. Kb3 (35. Nxe6 $1 Nc4+ (35... N7c6 36. Nc7 $18) 36. Kb3 Nd2+ 37. Kc2 Nxe4 38. Nxe4 Nd5 39. N6c5 bxc5 40. Nxc5 Re2+ 41. Kb3 Rxg2 42. b5 $18) 35... g5 36. Nfe2 (36. Nxe6 $5 N7c6 37. Nc7 Nd4+ 38. Kb2 (38. Ka4 Nd3 39. Rb1 Rf8 40. N3b5 Rf1 41. Nxd4 Rxb1 42. Nf5 $16) 38... Rf8 39. N3b5 (39. N3d5 Rf2+ 40. Kc3 Ne2+ 41. Kb3 Nd4+ 42. Ka4 Nc4 43. b5 Rc2 $14) 39... Rf2+ 40. Kc3 Nxb5+ 41. Nxb5 Rxg2 42. Kd4 $16) 36... N7c6 37. h4 g4 (37... Kg7 38. hxg5 hxg5 39. Rd1 $16) 38. Rf1 Kg7 39. g3 (39. Na4 Nd7 40. b5 Nce5 41. Nf4 $16) 39... Rc8 40. Rd1 Kf6 41. Na4 Rb8 (41... b5 42. Nc5 Na5+ 43. bxa5 Rxc5 44. Kb4 Rc4+ 45. Kxb5 Rxe4 46. Nf4 Re3 47. a6 $16) 42. Rd6 Ke7 43. Rd1 Kf6 44. Rd2 Ke7 45. b5 Na5+ 46. Kb4 Nac4 (46... Rb7 47. Nd4 Rb8 48. h5 Rb7 49. Rd1 Rb8 50. Nxb6 Rxb6 51. Kxa5 $18) 47. Rc2 Ne3 48. Rc7+ Kd6 (48... Kf6 49. Nf4 Nf1 50. Rh7 Nxg3 51. Rxh6+ Kf7 52. Nc3 Re8 53. Rh7+ Kf6 54. Rb7 $18) 49. Rh7 Nd3+ 50. Kc3 (50. Kb3 Nf2 51. Rxh6 Nxe4 52. Nf4 Re8 53. Nxb6 Nxg3 54. Nc4+ Nxc4 55. Kxc4 Nf5 56. Rg6 $18) 50... Nf2 51. Rxh6 Ke5 (51... Nxe4+ 52. Kd3 Nf5 53. Rg6 Ke5 $14) 52. Rg6 Nxe4+ 53. Kb3 Nd2+ 54. Ka2 (54. Kc3 Ne4+) 54... Ndc4 55. Nac3 (55. Nb2 Nxb2 56. Kxb2 Kf5 57. h5 Rd8 $132) 55... Ra8 56. a4 Nd2 57. Kb2 Rd8 58. Rg5+ $2 (58. Nf4 $142 $16) 58... Kf6 59. Ka2 Nf3 60. Ne4+ Kf7 61. Rh5 Nd5 $2 {[%mdl 2048] Polgar misses golden chance to exploit the unfortunate location of white rook.} (61... Kg7 $1 62. Nf4 Ra8 $1 63. Nxe6+ (63. Kb3 e5 $1 64. Ne6+ Kg6) 63... Kf7 64. N4g5+ Nxg5 65. Nxg5+ Kg6 66. Rh7 Rxa4+ 67. Kb3 Ra5 68. Kb4 Nd5+ 69. Kc4 Ne3+ $11) 62. Rh6 Ra8 (62... Rg8 63. Kb3 $16) 63. Kb3 Rg8 64. h5 Ng5 65. N2c3 (65. Nd6+ Ke7 66. Nc4 $18) 65... Nxc3 66. Nxc3 Rd8 $6 (66... Ke7 67. Ne2 $16) 67. Rg6 Nf3 (67... Rg8 68. Rxg8 Kxg8 69. a5 bxa5 70. b6 Nf3 71. Ka4 Ne5 72. Kxa5 $18) 68. Rxg4 Nd4+ 69. Kb2 e5 70. Rg5 Kf6 (70... Re8 71. Ne4 Re6 72. Kc3 $18) 71. Ne4+ Ke6 72. Rg6+ Kd5 (72... Kf5 73. Nd6+ $18) 73. Rd6+ $1 {The h pawn decides, so white can use small combinations.} Rxd6 74. Nxd6 Ne6 (74... Kxd6 75. h6 $18) 75. h6 Ng5 76. Nc8 e4 77. Kc2 Kd4 78. Nd6 e3 79. a5 $1 Kc5 (79... bxa5 80. b6 e2 81. Kd2 $18) 80. a6 1-0

