1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. Bg5 dxe4 5. Nxe4 Be7 6. Bxf6 Bxf6 7. Nf3 Nd7 8. Qe2 (8. Bc4 Be7 (8... a6 9. O-O O-O 10. Re1 b5 11. Bb3 Bb7 12. c3 Bxe4 13. Rxe4 c5 $11 {Mestrovic,Z-Ong Yok Hwa/Sarajevo 1966/EXT 98}) 9. Qe2 (9. O-O O-O 10. Qe2 c6 11. Rad1 Qc7 12. Rfe1 Qf4 13. g3 Qc7 14. c3 $14 {Clarke,P-Troeger,P/Budapest 1960/EXT 2001}) 9... c6 10. O-O-O Qc7 11. Kb1 b6 12. h4 h6 13. Ng3 $36 {Short-Nikolaiczuk/Dortmund (3) 1986 (23)}) (8. Bd3 $142 {(ChessBase) c3, De2/Dc2,0-0/0-0-0}) (8. Qd3 O-O 9. O-O-O b6 10. h4 Bb7 11. g4 Be7 12. Bg2 Qc8 13. Nfg5 g6 $13 {Mudelsee,M-Haefner,T/Germany 1988/GER-chT2 (42)}) 8... O-O (8... Qe7 9. O-O-O O-O 10. g4 g6 11. h4 Bg7 12. h5 b6 13. Qe3 Bb7 14. Bg2 c5 $15 {Vesely,J-Fichtl,J/Prague 1953/MCD (25)}) 9. O-O-O b6 (9... Be7 $1 {ChessBase} 10. Kb1 b6 11. g4 Bb7 12. Rg1 c5 13. g5 (13. dxc5 {ChessBase} Bxe4 14. Qxe4 Nxc5 $10) 13... Qc7 14. Bh3 Kh8 15. Rg4 {[%cal Yg4h4] Th4} f5 $1 16. gxf6 Nxf6 17. Nxf6 Bxf6 $132 {Bogoljubow,E-Alekhine,A/GER/NLD 1929/MainBase/[ChessBase] (38)}) 10. h4 Bb7 11. h5 $6 {Useless move which doesn't help white to create any threat to black king.It was better to play} (11. Ne5 $5 Be7 12. f4 Nf6 13. Nxf6+ (13. Ng5) 13... Bxf6 14. Rh3 $36 {[%cal Gg2g5] with promising position.}) 11... c5 $1 12. h6 (12. Qe3) 12... g6 13. dxc5 $6 {Thie move is serious inaccuracy after which white finds himself in troubles.} (13. Nxf6+ Qxf6 $13) 13... Bxe4 $1 14. Qxe4 Nxc5 $17 15. Qb4 (15. Rxd8 Nxe4 16. Rxa8 Rxa8 $17 {[%csl Rf2]}) 15... Qc7 16. Be2 b5 $1 {All black pieces are perfectly placed and the decisive attack goes very smoothly.} 17. Kb1 (17. Nd4 a5 18. Qxb5 Qf4+ 19. Kb1 Bxd4 $19) 17... a5 18. Qg4 Na4 $19 19. Nd4 $8 (19. c3 Nxb2 20. Kxb2 Qxc3+ 21. Kb1 Qb2#) 19... Rfc8 20. Rd2 (20. Qg3 $5 e5 (20... Be5 21. Qb3) (20... Qb6 21. Qe3 Qc5 22. c3 b4 $17) (20... Qc5 21. Rh5 $1) 21. Bxb5 Nxb2 22. Kxb2 Rab8 23. Rhe1 Qc5 $17) 20... Nxb2 $1 21. Nxb5 Rab8 $1 $19 {[%cal Gb8b2]} 22. Kc1 (22. Nxc7 Nd3+ $1 23. Nb5 Rxb5+ 24. Qb4 Rxb4#) 22... Qe5 (22... Qc5) 23. f4 Qc5 24. Qf3 Nc4 25. Bxc4 Qxc4 26. Nd6 Qxa2 27. Kd1 Qb1+ 28. Ke2 Qxh1 0-1

