1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 Nc6 6. Bg5 e6 7. Qd2 Be7 8. O-O-O O-O 9. f4 Nxd4 10. Qxd4 Qa5 11. Bc4 Bd7 12. Bb3 Bc6 13. Qd3 {This quiet move cannot yield White anything.} b5 $1 14. Kb1 (14. Bxf6 {Salov} Bxf6 15. Qxd6 {White wins the d6 , but loses the  and the  will become very strong.} Qb6 $1 $36 (15... Rac8 16. e5 Rfd8 17. Qc5 Bxg2 18. Qg1 Bxe5 $5 19. Qxg2 (19. fxe5 Bxh1 20. Qxh1 b4 21. Ne4 Qxe5 $17) 19... Bxc3 20. bxc3 Qxc3 21. Kb1 a5 22. Qg5 $1 $16)) 14... h6 (14... b4 $5 {Salov} 15. Bxf6 (15. Nd5 $5 exd5 16. e5 {is witty, but after} dxe5 17. fxe5 Ne4 18. Bxe7 Rfe8 $15 {Black grabs the .}) 15... Bxf6 16. Ne2 Qc5 $15) 15. Bxf6 Bxf6 16. Ne2 (16. Qxd6 {is again met by} Qb6 $1 (16... Rac8 17. e5 Rfd8 18. Qc5 Bxg2 19. Qg1 $1) 17. Qd3 Rfd8 $44 {White's pieces are passive and soon a5-a4 will come. If White cannot play f5 quickly the  on b3 is not well-placed.}) 16... Rad8 17. g4 Qb4 $1 18. Ng3 Bh4 $15 19. Rhe1 a5 20. f5 a4 21. a3 Qc5 22. Ba2 exf5 23. exf5 b4 24. axb4 Qxb4 25. Qd4 Qxd4 26. Rxd4 Bf6 27. Rc4 Rb8 28. c3 Bb5 29. Rc7 Bd3+ 30. Ka1 a3 31. bxa3 Rfc8 32. Rxc8+ Rxc8 33. Ne4 Be5 34. Kb2 Bxh2 35. Re3 Bb5 36. Bd5 Rb8 37. Ka2 Be5 38. Bb3 Kf8 39. a4 Bc6 40. Nd2 Bf4 41. Rd3 Ke7 42. Nc4 g6 43. Ne3 Be5 44. Nd5+ Kd7 45. fxg6 fxg6 46. Ka3 h5 47. gxh5 gxh5 48. Bd1 Bxd5 49. Rxd5 h4 50. Bg4+ Kc7 51. Rd3 Kc6 52. Bf3+ 1/2-1/2

