{[%mdl 2]} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 Nf6 5. O-O Be7 6. Re1 b5 7. Bb3 O-O 8. d3 {Avoiding the Marschall attack. Fewer and fewer seems to want to enter that complicated line with White these days.} d6 9. c3 Na5 10. Bc2 c5 11. Nbd2 Nc6 12. Nf1 Re8 13. a4 Be6 (13... Bb7 14. Ne3 g6 15. h3 Bf8 16. Nh2 Bg7 {is another setup tried in ½-½ Matanovic,A-O'Kelly de Galway,A/Zagreb 1955/MCD (38)}) 14. Ne3 h6 15. d4 $1 {Even though White started with d3, d4 was still the plan. White seems to have a slight pull here.} exd4 16. cxd4 Nxd4 17. Nxd4 cxd4 18. Qxd4 Nd7 19. axb5 axb5 20. Bd2 Bf6 (20... Qb6 $5) 21. Qxd6 Rxa1 22. Rxa1 Bxb2 23. Rb1 Be5 24. Qd3 Qc7 25. Nd5 Bxd5 (25... Bxh2+ 26. Kh1 Bxd5 27. exd5 Bd6 28. Qh7+ Kf8 29. Bd3 Re5 30. Qh8+ Ke7 31. Qxg7 $14) 26. exd5 Nf6 27. g3 Rc8 $6 (27... Rb8) 28. Bd1 Qc4 $4 29. Rc1 $1 $18 {[%mdl 64] Judit never misses shots like this one.} Qxc1 (29... Qxd3 30. Rxc8+ Kh7 31. Bc2 $18) 30. Bxc1 Rxc1 31. d6 Nd7 32. Kg2 Bf6 33. Bc2 g6 34. Bb3 Kg7 35. Qd5 1-0

