1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 c5 3. d5 b5 4. cxb5 a6 5. b6 d6 6. Nc3 Nbd7 7. e4 $1 {Avoids 7.a4 xb6 8.a5 b4 9.a4 db7 10.e4 g5!  from Glek,I-Arbakov,V [URS-sf Moscow ch 1990]} g6 8. a4 Nxb6 $6 (8... a5 9. Bb5 Bg7 10. Nf3 O-O 11. O-O Bb7 12. Bf4 Nxb6 {/ Savchenko,S-Shliaktin,I [Podolsk tt 1990]}) 9. a5 Nbd7 10. f4 Bg7 11. Bc4 O-O 12. Nf3 Ne8 13. O-O Nc7 14. Qd3 Nb5 15. Bd2 $16 {A novelty on 15.e3 xc3 ?! 16.bxc3   ¨ Dreev,A-Andrianov,N  [New York op 1990]} Nd4 16. Na4 Ra7 17. Nxd4 Bxd4+ 18. Kh1 Nf6 19. Bc3 Bxc3 20. Nxc3 Qc7 21. Rae1 Qxa5 22. e5 Ne8 23. e6 $18 { } f5 24. g4 Qb6 25. gxf5 Rxf5 26. Nd1 Nf6 27. Ne3 Rh5 28. Re2 Bxe6 29. dxe6 Qc6+ 30. Rg2 d5 31. Ba2 Rh3 32. Qe2 Qa4 33. Nxd5 Nh5 34. Bc4 {Hertneck} 1-0

