1. e4 {Polgar,Judit Polgar,Judit} e5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 exd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 Be7 6. g3 O-O 7. Bg2 Nc6 8. Nxc6 bxc6 9. O-O Nd7 10. b3 Bf6 11. Bb2 Rb8 12. Qd2 Re8 {Polgar,Judit: 'N' 'N'} (12... Nb6 {(Polgar,Judit) Ü 91/261 Polgar,Judit: 'Ü 91/261'}) 13. Rad1 c5 14. Bc1 {Polgar,Judit: '!?' '!?'} (14. Na4 {Polgar,Judit} Nb6 (14... Bb7 15. Rfe1 Bc6 16. Bxf6 Nxf6 17. Nc3)) 14... Nb6 15. Rfe1 (15. h3 $5 {Polgar,Judit}) 15... Bg4 16. Ne2 a5 (16... Qc8 {Polgar,Judit} 17. f3 Bd7 18. Nf4 $14) (16... c4 $5 {Polgar,Judit}) 17. h3 (17. a4 {Polgar,Judit} c4 18. Qxa5 cxb3 19. cxb3 Nd7 $1 (19... Be6) 20. Nd4 Bxd1 21. Nc6 Qc8 22. Nxb8 Bxb3) 17... Bxe2 {Polgar,Judit: '?!' '?!'} (17... Bd7 {Polgar,Judit} 18. Nf4 a4) 18. Rxe2 a4 19. Kh2 Qc8 20. f4 axb3 (20... c4 $5 {Polgar,Judit}) 21. cxb3 {Polgar,Judit: '!' '!'} Qa6 {Polgar,Judit: '?!' '?!'} 22. Qc2 {Polgar,Judit: '?' '?'} (22. e5 $1 $16 {Polgar,Judit} dxe5 23. fxe5 Bxe5 24. Rxe5 $1 Rxe5 25. Bb2 Qe2 26. Bxe5 Qxe5 27. Qd8+ Qe8 28. Qxc7 $18) 22... Bd4 (22... c4 $1 {Polgar,Judit}) 23. Be3 Bxe3 24. Rxe3 Re7 {Polgar,Judit: '?!' '?!'} (24... Qa3 $1 {Polgar,Judit}) 25. e5 c4 (25... Rbe8 $5 {Polgar,Judit}) 26. bxc4 dxe5 (26... Nxc4 {Polgar,Judit} 27. Rb3 Rxb3 28. Qxb3 g6 29. Bf1 $18) 27. c5 Nd7 28. c6 Nf8 29. fxe5 Qa7 30. Re2 Rbe8 31. Rd5 Qa6 32. a4 Ng6 33. e6 fxe6 34. Rd7 Nf8 35. Rxe7 (35. Red2 $5 {Polgar,Judit} Qa5 36. Rxe7 Rxe7 37. Rd8) 35... Rxe7 36. Rf2 (36. Re5 $1 {Polgar,Judit}) 36... Qa5 (36... Rf7 $1 {Polgar,Judit} 37. Rxf7 Kxf7 38. Qf2+ Kg8 39. Qd4 $16) 37. Qd2 {Polgar,Judit: '+-!' '+-!'} Qxd2 (37... Qa7 {Polgar,Judit} 38. a5) 38. Rxd2 Re8 {#} 39. Rd7 $1 {Brilliant and winning.} Nxd7 ({Trying to hold on passively with} 39... Rc8 {fails to} 40. a5) ({Or} 39... Ra8 40. Rxc7 Rxa4 41. Re7 Rc4 42. c7 Rc2 43. Kg1 {and Bb7 is decisive.}) 40. cxd7 Rd8 41. Bc6 Kf7 42. a5 Ke7 43. a6 Kd6 44. Bb7 Kxd7 45. a7 Kd6 46. a8=Q Rxa8 47. Bxa8 Ke5 48. Kg2 Kd4 49. Kf3 c5 50. Be4 h6 (50... g6 {Polgar,Judit} 51. g4 Ke5 52. g5 c4 53. h4) 51. Bg6 c4 52. Kf4 Kc3 (52... c3 {Polgar,Judit} 53. h4 h5 54. Bc2 e5+ 55. Kf3) 53. Bf7 g5+ (53... Kd2 {Polgar,Judit} 54. Bxe6 c3 55. Bb3 Ke2 (55... g5+ 56. Kf5 Ke3 57. g4 Kf3 58. Kg6) 56. h4 h5 57. g4 hxg4 58. Kxg4 Kf2 59. h5 Kg2 60. Kg5 Kg3 61. Kg6 Kg4 62. Bc2 Kh4 63. Bd1) 54. Ke3 Kb2 55. Bxe6 c3 56. Bf5 c2 57. Bxc2 Kxc2 58. g4 1-0

