1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. Qc2 O-O 5. a3 Bxc3+ 6. Qxc3 b6 7. Nf3 Bb7 8. e3 c5 9. Be2 cxd4 10. exd4 d5 11. b3 Nbd7 12. O-O dxc4 13. bxc4 {Black creates hanging pawns and wants to attack them quickly.} Qc7 14. a4 {fighting against ...b5.} Rac8 15. Re1 {White has to fight also against ...e5!} Rfe8 16. Bb2 Ng4 $5 (16... h6 17. h3 $14 {and it is not so easy for Black to create any counterplay.}) 17. g3 (17. h3 $2 Bxf3 18. Bxf3 Qh2+ 19. Kf1 e5 $1 $17) 17... Ndf6 18. Nd2 h5 $6 {This looks a bit messy.} (18... e5 $5 $13) 19. h3 Nh6 20. Bf3 {White has to give up his , because the long  is seriously weakened.} Red8 21. Re5 $5 (21. Bxb7 Qxb7 22. Rac1 Nf5 23. Qf3 Qxf3 24. Nxf3 Nd6 $13) 21... Nf5 (21... Bxf3 22. Qxf3 (22. Nxf3 Nf5) 22... Nf5 23. d5 $1 $40 {White's best chance is to create a strong  on d5, opening up the long  as well.}) 22. Bxb7 Qxb7 23. d5 $1 {This is the point!} h4 24. g4 Ne7 25. Ne4 Ne8 $1 (25... Nxe4 26. Rxe4 $16) (25... Ng6 26. Nxf6+ gxf6 27. Rf5 $1 $40) 26. Re1 $2 {White pushes too hard, something went wrong in the calculation of the forced lines.} (26. Rg5 $5 Ng6 27. Qb3 exd5 (27... Nd6 28. Nxd6 Rxd6 29. Re1 exd5 30. cxd5) 28. cxd5 Qa6 $1 { c4}) ({missing the forceful} 26. dxe6 $1 Ng6 27. Qf3 $16) 26... Nxd5 27. Qf3 (27. Qb3 Ndf6) 27... Rxc4 28. Rg5 Qe7 $2 (28... Qc6 $1 {was extremely strong!} 29. Bxg7 (29. Rh5 Ne7 $19) 29... Nxg7 30. Nf6+ Kh8 31. Qd3 Nxf6 32. Qxd8+ Nfe8 $19) 29. Bxg7 Nxg7 30. Rxd5 Rxd5 31. Nf6+ $11 Kf8 32. Nxd5 $1 (32. Nh7+ Ke8 (32... Kg8 33. Nf6+ $11) 33. Nf6+ Kf8 $11 (33... Kd8 $2 34. Nxd5)) 32... Qd6 (32... Qb7 33. Qa3+ Rc5 34. Nf6 Qe7 $13) 33. Nf6 Ne8 34. Qa8 $1 Qe7 35. g5 $1 Rd4 $1 36. Rc1 $1 Rd8 37. Qf3 (37. Rc8 Rxc8 38. Qxc8 e5 $1 39. Kg2 e4) 37... Rd5 38. Kf1 $2 (38. Nxd5 $4 Qxg5+ $19) (38. Qf4 $1 {was required.} Rxg5+ $1 (38... Kg7 39. Qxh4 Nxf6 40. Qh6+ $1 $18) (38... Rf5 39. Qxh4 Nxf6 40. Qh6+ Kg8 41. gxf6 Qxf6 42. Rc8+ $18) 39. Qxg5 Qxf6 40. Qxf6 Nxf6 41. Rc4 a6 42. Rxh4 $16) 38... Nxf6 39. gxf6 Qd8 40. Rc4 Rf5 41. Qa3+ Kg8 42. Rg4+ Kh7 43. Rxh4+ $2 (43. Rg7+ Kh8 44. Qe7 $1 {was still enough for a draw.} Qd1+ 45. Kg2 Qf3+ 46. Kh2 Qxf2+ 47. Rg2 Qf4+ $11) 43... Kg6 44. Rg4+ (44. Qg3+ Kxf6) 44... Kxf6 45. Qc3+ Ke7 46. Rd4 Rd5 47. Rc4 Kd7 $1 48. h4 Qb8 49. Qf6 Rf5 50. Rd4+ Kc6 51. Rc4+ Kb7 52. Qe7+ Ka6 53. Rc7 Qa8 54. Kg1 Rf4 55. f3 Rxf3 56. Qg5 f5 0-1

