nik: 'It seems that Veselin was not able to stop White's advance, enemy's pieces would manage to get into his position anyway.'''} (26... h5 27. Qf4 $1 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Polgar,Judit'} (27. Qd2 $5 {Ftacnik,Lubomir} hxg4) (27. gxh5 {(Ftacnik,Lubomir) Polgar,Judit: 'Ftacnik'} Bxh5 28. Nxh5 Rxh5 29. Rg1 Rh7 (29... Qe7 30. Nf3 $1 d5 $13) 30. Rg5 Ke7 $14) 27... Bxc2+ (27... hxg4 28. Qg5 $18 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Polgar,Judit: '+-''} Bxc2+ {(Ftacnik,Lubomir) Polgar,Judit: 'Ftacnik'} 29. Ka1 Nf3 30. Nxf3 Qe7 31. Ne5 Bxd1 32. Nxf7+ Qxf7 33. Nd5+ Ke8 34. Rxf7 $18) 28. Nxc2 Qxc2+ 29. Ka1 hxg4 (29... Ke7 30. Ne4) 30. Ne4 Rc6 31. Nxd6) 27. h5 Bh7 28. Qh4 $18 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: '!' '!' '!' '!' Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Polgar,Judit: '+-' '+-' Polgar,Judit: 'Ftacnik: '!''' Ftacnik,L: '!'} Bxc2+ (28... Kc7 29. Nxh7 Rxh7 30. Rxf7+ $1 Rxf7 31. Nxe6+ {Ftacnik,Lubomir: '+-' '+-' '+-' '+-' Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Polgar,Judit: 'Ftacnik: '+-''' Ftacnik,L: '+-'}) 29. Nxc2 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: '?!' '?!' '?!' '?!' Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Polgar,Judit: 'Ftacnik: '?!'' Ftacnik,L: '?!' 'Polgar must have been very happy about the position, she somewhat loses her concentration. Much easier was the simple king retreat and Black would have been doomed.'' Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Polgar must have been very happy about the position, she somewhat loses her concentration. Much easier was the simple king retreat and Black would have been doomed. Polgar,Judit: 'Ftacnik: 'Polgar must have been very happy about the position, she somewhat loses her concentration. Much easier was the simple king retreat and Black would have been doomed.'''} (29. Ka1 $1 {(Ftacnik,Lubomir) Polgar,Judit: 'Ftacnik'} Kc7 (29... Bxd1 30. Nd5+ $18) (29... Qa7 30. Ne4+ Qe7 31. Nxe6+ fxe6 32. Rxd6+ Ke8 (32... Nd7 33. Rf7 Qxh4 34. Rdxd7+ Ke8 35. Nd6#) 33. Nf6+ Kf8 34. Nd5+ $18) 30. Nxc2 Qxc2 31. Rc1 $18) 29... Qxc2+ 30. Ka1 Rc4 (30... Rc6 31. Nd5+ Kd7 32. Qe7+ Kc8 33. Nb4 Rc7 {(Ftacnik,Lubomir) Polgar,Judit: 'Ftacnik'} 34. Qxd6 $16) (30... Nd3 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Polgar,Judit'} 31. Nd5+ Kd7 32. Qe7+ Kc6 33. Nb4+ $1 Nxb4 34. Rxd6+ Kc5 35. Rxe6+ Kd5 36. Qd6+ Kc4 37. Rf4+) (30... Ke7 31. Ng8+ {Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Polgar,Judit'} (31. Nd5+ {(Ftacnik,Lubomir) Polgar,Judit: 'Ftacnik'} Kf8 32. Qf6 Rh7 33. Qe7+ Kg7 (33... Kg8 34. Nf6+ Kh8 35. Nxh7 Kxh7 36. Qxd6 Nc4 37. Qd4 $16) 34. g5 $1 exd5 35. g6 $16) 31... Kf8 32. Ne7 Re8 33. Ng6+ Nxg6 34. Qf6) 31. Ne4+ Kc7 (31... Ke8 {(Ftacnik,Lubomir) Polgar,Judit: 'Ftacnik'} 32. Nxd6+ Kf8 33. Nxc4 $18) 32. Nxd6 Rf4 (32... Rc5 {(Ftacnik,Lubomir) Polgar,Judit: 'Ftacnik'} 33. Qe7+ Kb6 34. Qb7+ Ka5 35. Qa7 $1 $18) 33. Qe7+ Kb6 34. Qb7+ Ka5 (34... Kc5 {(Ftacnik,Lubomir) Polgar,Judit: 'Ftacnik'} 35. Qc7+ Nc6 36. Nb7+ $18) 35. Qa7 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: '!' '!' '!' '!' Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Polgar,Judit: 'Ftacnik: '!'' Ftacnik,L: '!' 'A fine move that aquares the black king on the annatural spot a5.'' Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'A fine move that aquares the black king on the annatural spot a5. Polgar,Judit: 'Ftacnik: 'A fine move that aquares the black king on the annatural spot a5.'''} b4 (35... Rxf1 36. Nb7+ Kb4 (36... Ka4 {(Ftacnik,Lubomir) Polgar,Judit: 'Ftacnik'} 37. Qxa6+ Kb4 38. Qa3+ Kc4 39. Nd6#) 37. Qd4+ Nc4 (37... Qc4 {(Ftacnik,Lubomir) Polgar,Judit: 'Ftacnik'} 38. Qd6+ $18) 38. Qc5+ Ka4 39. b3+ {Ftacnik,Lubomir: '+-' '+-' '+-' '+-' Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Polgar,Judit: 'Ftacnik: '+-''' Ftacnik,L: '+-'}) 36. Rfe1 Nf3 37. Rc1 (37. Nb7+ {(Ftacnik,Lubomir) Polgar,Judit: 'Ftacnik'} Kb5 38. Rd6 $18) 37... Nxe1 38. Rxc2 Nxc2+ 39. Kb1 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Ftacnik,L: 'A truly imaginative attack by Judit!'' Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'A truly imaginative attack by Judit!' Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Polgar,Judit: 'Ftacnik: 'A truly imaginative attack by Judit!'''} Nd4 {(Ftacnik,Lubomir) Polgar,Judit: 'Ftacnik'} 40. Nb7+ Kb5 41. Qc5+ Ka4 42. Qa5# 1-0

