9. axb4 g3 70. c6 g2 71. c7 g1=Q 72. c8=Q $18) 60. Rxe2 Bxd6 61. Kd5 $16) (48... Rxg1 49. Rxg1 Qf8 $1 50. Qxb5 Qxf5+ 51. Ka1 Qc8 $5 {is an improvement.}) 49. Qxb5 Rf8 50. Nb4 e4 {Ribli,Zoltan: 'TonyK: 'At first sight the e-pawn looks dangerous, but White manages to blockade it before it does any harm.''} 51. Rde1 Rh4 (51... e3 $1 52. Ka1 (52. Qxa4 Qf6 53. Qd7) 52... Bxb4 53. cxb4) 52. Ka1 e3 (52... Rh2 53. Qxa4 Qd2 {meets} 54. Nc2 $1 {as} Qxc2 55. Qd4+ {leads to mate.}) 53. Qxa4 {Ribli,Z: '+-' Ribli,Zoltan: '+-' '+-' '+-' '+-' Ribli: '+-' Ribli,Zoltan: 'Weiß hat wieder zwei Bauern mehr und der e-Bauer bietet keine Gegenchancen für Schwarz.' Ribli,Z: 'Weiß hat wieder zwei Bauern mehr und der e-Bauer bietet keine Gegenchancen für Schwarz.'} Re4 54. Qa6 Rfe8 {Ribli,Zoltan: 'TonyK: 'Both rooks are behind the pawn, ready to push.''} 55. Re2 $1 $18 Qf8 56. Qd3 Qf6 57. Nc2 Bc5 58. Rge1 {Ribli,Zoltan: 'TonyK: 'The whole position rotates around e3.''} Qe5 59. b4 $1 Bb6 60. Kb2 h5 61. d6 Qf5 {Ribli,Zoltan: 'TonyK: '?''} (61... Rd8 {is better, but} 62. Nxe3 Rxd6 63. Nc4 $1 Rxd3 64. Nxe5 {should win, despite the dangerous h-pawn.}) 62. Rxe3 {Ribli,Z: '!' '!' Ribli,Zoltan: '!' '!' '!' '!' '!' '!' '!' '!' Ribli: '!' '!'} Bxe3 {Ribli,Z} 63. Rxe3 $18 {Ribli,Zoltan: 'TonyK: 'pins the e4-rook, and threatens d7, dislodging its compatriot.''} 1-0

