ir: '!' '!' '!' Ftacnik,L: '!'} d5 31. g6 $6 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: '?!' '?!' '?!' Ftacnik,L: '?!'} (31. Rxe5 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Kasimdzhanov,Rustam'} d4 32. Bxd4 Nxe5 33. Bxe5+ Kg8 34. g6 Bc5+ 35. Ne3 Rg7 36. Bxg7 Qxg7 37. Qxh7+ Qxh7 38. gxh7+ Kh8 39. axb5 $18) (31. fxe5 $18 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Kasimdzhanov,Rustam'}) (31. Qh5 $1 Kg8 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Kasimdzhanov,Rustam'} (31... Qb6+ {(Ftacnik,Lubomir) Kasimdzhanov,Rustam: 'Ftacnik,L'} 32. Kg2 Kg8 33. g6 Qxg6+ 34. Rg3 $18) 32. g6 Qb6+ 33. Kh1 $18) 31... Qb6+ 32. Kh1 Qxg6 33. Rxe5 $2 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: '?!' '?!' '?!' Ftacnik,L: '?!' Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'The time trouble is no friend of the exact solutions, white is complicating his task by chosing second rate solutions.'} (33. fxe5 $1 Rxf5 (33... b4 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Kasimdzhanov,Rustam'} 34. Bd4 Qe6 35. Qh5 $18) 34. e6+ Nf6 35. Rg1 $18) 33... Nxe5 34. Bxe5+ Bg7 (34... Kg8 {(Ftacnik,Lubomir) Kasimdzhanov,Rustam: 'Ftacnik,L'} 35. Rg3 Rxf5 36. Rxg6+ hxg6 37. Qh8+ Kf7 38. Qh7+ Ke8 39. Qxg6+ Rf7 40. Bxb8 $18) 35. Nxg7 (35. Bxg7+ {Ftacnik,Lubomir} Rxg7 36. Nxg7 {1-0 (47) Kasimdzhanov,R (2670)-Polgar,J (2735) San Luis 2005 CBM 110 [Ftacnik,Lubomir]} Qe4+ {Ftacnik,Lubomir} 37. Kg1 Qd4+ 38. Kf1 Qc4+ 39. Rd3 Qxc2 40. Rg3 bxa4 41. Nh5 (41. Qf6 Qc1+ 42. Kg2 Qxb2+ 43. Qxb2 Rxb2+ 44. Kh3 Rb3 45. Ne6 Rxg3+ 46. Kxg3 a3 47. Nd4 a2 48. Nc2 $16) 41... Qd1+ 42. Kg2 Rxb2+ 43. Kh3 Qf1+ 44. Kg4 Qe2+ 45. Rf3 Qe6+ 46. f5 Qg8+ 47. Qg5 Rg2+ 48. Ng3 $16) 35... Rxg7 36. Bxg7+ Qxg7 $16 {[ 9/e] Ftacnik,Lubomir: '?' '?' '?' Ftacnik,L: '?'} 37. axb5 axb5 38. c3 Qg6 $6 $138 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: '?' '?' '?' Ftacnik,L: '?' Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Judit had no easy task of chosing the most promissing defense, unfortunatelly the text loses two vital tempies.'} (38... Re8 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: '' '' '' '' Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Kasimdzhanov,Rustam: 'Ftacnik,L: '' ''''} 39. Rg3 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Kasimdzhanov,Rustam'}) 39. f5 $1 Qg7 (39... Qxf5 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Kasimdzhanov,Rustam'} 40. Qd4+ Kg8 41. Rg3+ $18) 40. Re3 Ra8 41. Qe1 Qf7 (41... Qf6 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Kasimdzhanov,Rustam'} 42. Re5 $16 (42. Re8+ Rxe8 43. Qxe8+ Kg7 44. Qd7+ Qf7 45. Qxb5 Qxf5 46. Qe2 $16)) 42. Qd1 Qg7 (42... Ra4 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Kasimdzhanov,Rustam'} 43. b4 $18) (42... Qxf5 {(Ftacnik,Lubomir) Kasimdzhanov,Rustam: 'Ftacnik,L'} 43. Qd4+ Kg8 44. Rg3+ Kf7 45. Qg7+ Ke6 46. Re3+ $18) 43. b4 h6 $6 (43... Rg8 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Kasimdzhanov,Rustam'} 44. Rg3 Qe5 $16) 44. Qe1 $18 {[עh8]} Ra7 $2 (44... Qf7 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Kasimdzhanov,Rustam'} 45. Qh4 $1 Ra1+ 46. Kg2 Ra2+ 47. Kg3 Qg7+ 48. Kf3 Qg2+ 49. Kf4 Rf2+ 50. Ke5) 45. f6 $1 {Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'With time to spare again white is finding the fine tactical solution.'} Qxf6 (45... Qg6 {(Ftacnik,Lubomir) Kasimdzhanov,Rustam: 'Ftacnik,L'} 46. Re8+ Kh7 47. Re7+ Rxe7 48. fxe7 Qe8 49. Qe6 $18) 46. Re8+ Kh7 (46... Kg7 {(Ftacnik,Lubomir) Kasimdzhanov,Rustam: 'Ftacnik,L'} 47. Qg1+ $18) 47. Qb1+ Qg6 {(Ftacnik,Lubomir) Kasimdzhanov,Rustam: 'Ftacnik,L'} 48. Rh8+ Kxh8 49. Qxg6 $18 1-0

