25.h4 gh4 26.gh4 Nh4 27.f4}) 24. Ka1 Kd7 $2 (24... O-O 25. Be2 Rc8 26. Rb1 Qc5 27. Qxc5 Rxc5 28. Rxb7 Rxc2 (28... Bxh3 29. g4 $16) 29. Rb2 $1 (29. Bxa6 Rh2 $1 30. Bf1 h5 $1 (30... Bxh3 31. Bxh3 Rxh3 32. g4 $16) 31. g4 h4 $44) 29... Rc1+ 30. Rb1 Rc2 31. Bxa6 h5 $1 {צa3, h3} (31... Rh2 32. Bc8 $1 Rxh3 (32... Bxc8 33. Ra8 Rxh3 34. Rxc8+ Kg7 35. Rg1 h5 36. a4 h4 37. a5 $18) (32... Bxh3 33. Rc3 $16) 33. Bxe6 fxe6 34. g4 $16) (31... Bxh3 32. g4 $16)) 25. Be2 $16 Qc5 26. Rb1 Qxe3 27. Rxe3 Rb8 (27... Kc7 28. Rc3+ Kb8 29. Bxa6 $18) (27... Bxh3 28. Rxb7+ Ke6 29. e5 $1 dxe5 30. Rb6+ Kd7 31. Bd3 $18) 28. Bxa6 Ra8 29. Bb5+ (29. Rxb7+ Kd8 30. Bf1 Rxa2+ 31. Kb1 Ra8 $14) 29... Kd8 30. a3 h5 (30... Bxh3 31. Rh1 (31. Be2 h5 $1 (31... Ra7 32. Rh1 $16) 32. Rxb7 Be6 $14) 31... g4 32. fxg4 Bxg4 33. Rxh6 Ra5 $16) 31. Bf1 Ra7 32. Rb4 Bc8 33. Kb2 f6 {[ h4] [ h4] Wells: 'White's task is still far from trivial since he must find a breakthrough and prevent Black's knight sitting pretty upon an outpost. One technique in such a case is returning the exchange for other gains which here works very efficiently.'} (33... h4 34. gxh4 gxh4 (34... Nxh4 $140 {Wells} 35. e5) 35. e5 $1 dxe5 36. Bd3 f5 37. Rb6 e6 38. Bxf5 Kc7 39. Bxg6 Kxb6 40. Rxe5 $16) 34. h4 $1 gxh4 35. gxh4 Bd7 $138 (35... Nxh4 36. e5 Nf5 37. exf6 $1 exf6 (37... Nxe3 38. f7 $18) 38. Rd3 $18) (35... Ra5 36. Rc3 Nxh4 37. f4 $16) 36. Reb3 Bc8 37. Rb5 Nf4 (37... e5 38. Bc4 Nxh4 39. Bf7 $18) 38. Bc4 Kc7 39. Bf7 {Wells: '!'} Bd7 40. Rc3+ $2 $138 (40. Rxh5 Nxh5 41. Bxh5 $18) 40... Kd8 41. Rxh5 {Wells: '!'} Nxh5 42. Bxh5 e6 $2 (42... Ra5 43. Bf7 (43. Bg6 Be8 44. Bxe8 {Ü 43.g6 Ü 43.Bg6} Kxe8 45. Rb3 $1 Rh5 46. Rxb7 Rxh4 $16) 43... Be8 44. Bd5 (44. Bxe8 {Ü 43.g6}) 44... b6 (44... Bc6 45. Bxc6 bxc6 46. Rxc6 Rb5+ 47. Ka2 Rh5 48. a4 Rxh4 $16) 45. f4 $16) 43. Bg6 $18 Bc6 (43... Ra5 44. f4) (43... Be8 44. h5 Bxg6 45. hxg6 b6 46. Rc6) 44. h5 Ke7 45. f4 Ra8 46. h6 Rh8 47. h7 f5 $8 48. exf5 Kf6 49. Rd3 $1 Be4 (49... d5 50. Rg3 exf5 51. Rg5 Bd7 52. K