2 $10) 33. Re7 {King: Black was threatening ...Bc6, so this simplification is forced and the game fades to a draw.} Rxe7 34. Bxe7 Rxc3 35. Rc1 Bf5 36. Bb4 Rxc2 37. Rxc2 Bxc2 {Hecht: Ungleiche L; blockierte sB-Mehrheit am Damenflügel} 38. Kf1 Kf7 39. Ke2 Ke6 40. Kd2 Ba4 41. Bc5 b6 42. Be3 Kd5 43. Kc3 Bb3 44. Kd2 Kc6 45. Kc3 Kb5 46. Bg5 1/2-1/2

