1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. e5 Nfd7 5. f4 c5 6. Nf3 Nc6 7. Be3 cxd4 8. Nxd4 Bc5 9. Qd2 a6 10. O-O-O Nxd4 11. Bxd4 O-O 12. Bxc5 {Quiet rare continuation promising white very little.} (12. h4 b5 13. h5 (13. Rh3 {× c3} b4 (13... Qb6 14. h5 Ra7 15. Rg3 Bxd4 16. Qxd4 Qxd4 17. Rxd4 Nb8 18. Rd2 Nc6 19. Ne2 b4 20. Nd4 Bd7 $10 {Tischbierek,R-Zysk,R/BL9293/}) (13... Bb7 $5 14. h5 b4 15. Na4 Bxd4 16. Qxd4 Qa5 17. b3 Bc6 18. Nb2 Rfc8 $1 $10 {Tischbierek,R-Knaak,R/BL9293/}) 14. Na4 Bxd4 15. Qxd4 a5 (15... f6 $6 $146 16. Qxb4 $1 fxe5 17. Qd6 $1 Qf6 18. f5 $3 $16 {Kasparov,G-Short,N/Amsterdam VSB 1994}) 16. Bb5 (16. b3 Ba6 17. Kb1 Bxf1 18. Rxf1 Qc7 19. h5 Ra6 20. Re3 Rc6 21. Rf2 f6 $15 {Kulish,I-Matveeva,S/Rostov on Don-W 1995}) 16... Rb8 17. Bd3 Qc7 18. Re1 (18. h5 Bb7 19. g4 Rfc8 20. Rh2 Qc6 21. b3 Ba6 22. Bxa6 Qxa6 $13 {Fogarasi,T-Luther,T/Kecskemet 1993}) 18... Qc6 19. b3 Ba6 20. Bxa6 Qxa6 21. h5 (21. Rg3 $5 Rbc8 22. f5 Qc6 23. Re2 Kh8 24. h5 Rg8 25. Rf3 $14 {Arakhamia,K-Matveeva,S/Kishinev izt-W 1995}) 21... Rfc8 22. f5 Qc6 23. Re2 Nc5 $5 $13 {Sedlak,N-Antic,D/JUG-ch 55th 2000}) 13... b4 (13... h6 14. g4 f6 15. Bxc5 Nxc5 16. Qd4 Nd7 17. exf6 Qxf6 18. Bg2 $14 {Moreno,J-Barreiro Pineiro,J/VI Aceimar Open 1999}) 14. Ne2 a5 15. Kb1 (15. Bxc5 Nxc5 16. Qe3 Qb6 {Smirin,A-Lputian,S/Rostov/1993/}) 15... Ba6 16. Qe3 Rc8 17. Bxc5 Nxc5 18. Ng3 Bxf1 19. Rhxf1 Qc7 20. Rc1 Na4 $13 {Rivera,D-Moreno,J/Barcelona UGA 1994}) (12. Kb1 b5 13. h4 b4 14. Na4 Bxd4 15. Qxd4 Qa5 16. b3 Bb7 17. Rh3 Bc6 18. c3 Rab8 $13 {Link,M-Barsov,A/Goch op 1994}) (12. Na4 Bxd4 13. Qxd4 Qc7 14. Rd3 b5 15. Rc3 Qb7 16. Nc5 Nxc5 17. Qxc5 Bd7 $11 {Berg,G-Wilson,E/US Amateur Team East 2000}) 12... Nxc5 13. Qd4 b6 ({Another reasonable option is} 13... Qc7 14. h4 Bd7 15. Bd3 Rac8 16. Kb1 b5 17. h5 Qb7 18. Ne2 b4 19. h6 g6 20. g4 Bb5 21. f5 $13 {½-½ Vallejo Pons,F-Lopez Martinez,J/WJun 1999}) 14. Kb1 Bb7 15. Bd3 Rc8 16. Rhe1 $5 (16. h4 $5 Nxd3 17. Qxd3 (17. cxd3 Qc7 18. Qe3 d4 19. Qxd4 Bxg2 20. Rhg1 Bb7 $13) 17... Qc7 18. Ne2 Qc4 19. Nd4 $14) 16... Qc7 17. g4 f6 (17... Nxd3 $6 18. Qxd3 b5 19. Ne2 $14) 18. f5 $5 Nxd3 19. cxd3 exf5 20. gxf5 fxe5 21. Rxe5 Qc5 22. Qg4 b5 23. d4 Qd6 $6 ({Better was} 23... Qc6 $1 24. Rxd5 b4 25. Rc5 Qg2 26. Qxg2 Bxg2 27. Na4 Be4+ 28. Kc1 Bxf5 $11 {with equal position}) 24. h4 Rc7 25. Re6 Qd8 26. Rf1 Rcf7 27. Re5 b4 28. Nd1 {[%cal Gd1e3]} (28. Na4 $6 Bc8 29. Nc5 g6 $15 {[%csl Rf5]}) 28... a5 29. Ne3 Kh8 30. h5 a4 31. Qg2 b3 32. a3 Qh4 33. Rd1 h6 34. Qe2 Rc7 35. Qb5 Re7 {After this move game becomes extremly sharp and black doesn't stand a pressure.} (35... Rcf7 36. Qxa4 Qxh5 37. Qxb3 $16) (35... Bc6 36. Qc5 Rcc8) 36. f6 $1 Rxe5 (36... Ref7 37. fxg7+ Kxg7 38. Qxa4 $16) 37. fxg7+ Kxg7 38. dxe5 Qe4+ 39. Ka1 Rf7 $2 {Losing in a few moves, while after correct} (39... d4 $1 40. Qd7+ (40. Nc4 Qc6 41. Qb4 Qf3 $132) (40. Rg1+ Kh8 41. Ng4 Qf4 $132) 40... Kh8 41. Qd6 (41. Qe7 Qf3 42. Rg1 Rg8 43. Rxg8+ Kxg8 44. Qd8+ Kf7 45. Qd7+ Kf8 46. Qxd4 $11) 41... Qf4 42. Rxd4 Rc8 43. Rd1 Qxe3 44. Qf6+ Kg8 45. Rd8+ Rxd8 46. Qxd8+ Kf7 47. Qd7+ Kf8 $11 {the position remains equal.}) 40. Rg1+ Kh7 (40... Kf8 41. Qb6 $1 Qxe5 42. Qd8+ Qe8 43. Rg8+ Kxg8 44. Qxe8+ Kg7 45. Nf5+ $18) 41. Ng4 $1 $18 Bc6 $5 (41... Qd4 42. Nf6+ Rxf6 43. Qxb7+ $18) 42. Qxc6 Qxg4 43. Qg6+ $1 1-0

